 varg-video-generation","en":"varg-video-generation"},"description":{"zh":"varg-video-generation是AI原生SDK，用于视频工具开发。它提供高效和高质量的视频生成解决方案","ja":"varg-video-generationはAIエージェントによる動画生成ツールです。高効率と高品質の動画生成ソリューションを提供","ko":"varg-video-generation은 AI 네이티브 SDK로 비디오 도구 개발을 위한 효율적이고 고품질의 비디오 생성 솔루션을 제공합니다","es":"varg-video-generation es un SDK de video nativo de IA para herramientas de video. Ofrece funcionalidades de video avanzadas para desarrolladores","fr":"varg-video-generation est un SDK de vidéo natif IA pour les outils de vidéo. Il propose des fonctionnalités de vidéo avancées pour les développeurs","de":"varg-video-generation ist ein AI-native SDK für Video-Tools. Es bietet erweiterte Video-Funktionen für Entwickler","pt":"O varg-video-generation é um SDK de vídeo nativo em IA para desenvolvedores. Fornece ferramentas de vídeo avançadas para aplicativos.","ru":"Varg-video-generation - это ИИ-ориентированный SDK для видео-инструментов. Предоставляет продвинутые видео-инструменты для приложений.","ar":"varg-video-generation هو SDK فيديو أصلي بالذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين. يوفر أدوات فيديو متقدمة للتطبيقات.","en":"AI-native SDK for video tooling"},"definition":{"en":"AI-native SDK for video tooling"},"features":{"zh":["AI原生SDK","高效视频生成","高质量动画","易于集成","支持多种视频格式"],"ja":["AIエージェント","高効率動画生成","高品質アニメーション","簡単な統合","多種動画形式対応"],"ko":["AI 네이티브 SDK","고효율 비디오 생성","고품질 애니메이션","쉬운 통합","다양한 비디오 형식 지원"],"es":["SDK de video nativo de IA","Funcionalidades de video avanzadas","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo","Compatibilidad con múltiples plataformas","Documentación y soporte técnico"],"fr":["SDK de vidéo natif IA","Fonctionnalités de vidéo avancées","Intégration avec les outils de développement","Compatibilité avec plusieurs plateformes","Documentation et support technique"],"de":["AI-native SDK für Video","Erweiterte Video-Funktionen","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Plattformen","Dokumentation und technischer Support"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicativos de vídeo com IA","Ferramentas de vídeo avançadas","Integração com React, Python e Node.js","CLI para automação de tarefas","Suporte a múltiplos formatos de vídeo"],"ru":["Разработка видео-приложений с ИИ","Продвинутые видео-инструменты","Интеграция с React, Python и Node.js","CLI для автоматизации задач","Поддержка нескольких форматов видео"],"ar":["تطوير تطبيقات الفيديو بالذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات فيديو متقدمة","الدمج مع React، Python و Node.js","CLI لتحسين المهام","دعم العديد من صيغ الفيديو"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用varg-video-generation","什么是AI原生SDK","varg-video-generation替代品","varg-video-generation与其他工具的比较","varg-video-generation安装","varg-video-generation设置指南","AI视频生成工具","动画生成软件"],"ja":["varg-video-generationの使い方","AIエージェントとは","varg-video-generationの代替","varg-video-generationと他のツールの比較","varg-video-generationのインストール","varg-video-generationの設定ガイド","AI動画生成ツール","アニメーション生成ソフト"],"ko":["varg-video-generation 사용법","AI 에이전트란","varg-video-generation 대체","varg-video-generation과 다른 도구 비교","varg-video-generation 설치","varg-video-generation 설정 가이드","AI 비디오 생성 도구","애니메이션 생성 소프트웨어"],"es":["herramientas de video AI","SDK de video nativo de IA","desarrollo de video","alternativas a varg-video-generation","varg-video-generation vs otros SDK","cómo instalar varg-video-generation","guía de configuración de varg-video-generation","usos de varg-video-generation","beneficios de varg-video-generation"],"fr":["outils de vidéo IA","SDK de vidéo natif IA","développement de vidéo","alternatives à varg-video-generation","varg-video-generation vs autres SDK","comment installer varg-video-generation","guide de configuration de varg-video-generation","utilisations de varg-video-generation","avantages de varg-video-generation"],"de":["AI-Video-Tools","AI-native SDK für Video","Video-Entwicklung","Alternativen zu varg-video-generation","varg-video-generation vs andere SDK","wie man varg-video-generation installiert","Konfigurationsanleitung für varg-video-generation","Anwendungen von varg-video-generation","Vorteile von varg-video-generation"],"pt":["como usar varg-video-generation","o que é varg-video-generation","ferramentas de vídeo IA","alternativas ao varg-video-generation","varg-video-generation vs outros SDKs","instalar varg-video-generation","guia de configuração do varg-video-generation"],"ru":["как использовать varg-video-generation","что такое varg-video-generation","ИИ-инструменты для видео","альтернативы varg-video-generation","varg-video-generation vs другие SDK","установить varg-video-generation","руководство по настройке varg-video-generation"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام varg-video-generation","ما هو varg-video-generation","أدوات الفيديو الذكية","بديلات varg-video-generation","varg-video-generation مقابل SDKs أخرى","تثبيت varg-video-generation","دليل إعداد varg-video-generation"]}},"owner":"vargHQ","repo":"sdk","repoPath":"vargHQ/sdk","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.674Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"varg-video-generation","description":"Generate AI videos using varg SDK React engine. Use when creating videos, animations, talking characters, slideshows, or social media content.","version":"1.0.0","bodyPreview":"# Video Generation with varg React Engine\n\nGenerate AI videos using declarative JSX syntax with automatic caching and parallel generation.\n\n## Quick Setup\n\nInitialize a new project:\n\n```bash\nbunx vargai init\n```\n\nOr just create hello.tsx starter:\n\n```bash\nbunx vargai hello\n```\n\nCheck existing API keys:\n\n```bash\ncat .env 2>/dev/null | grep -E \"^(FAL_KEY|ELEVENLABS_API_KEY)=\" || echo \"No API keys found\"\n```\n\n## Required API Keys\n\n### FAL_KEY (Required)\n\n| Detail | Value |\n|--------|-------|\n| Prov","body":"# Video Generation with varg React Engine\n\nGenerate AI videos using declarative JSX syntax with automatic caching and parallel generation.\n\n## Quick Setup\n\nInitialize a new project:\n\n```bash\nbunx vargai init\n```\n\nOr just create hello.tsx starter:\n\n```bash\nbunx vargai hello\n```\n\nCheck existing API keys:\n\n```bash\ncat .env 2>/dev/null | grep -E \"^(FAL_KEY|ELEVENLABS_API_KEY)=\" || echo \"No API keys found\"\n```\n\n## Required API Keys\n\n### FAL_KEY (Required)\n\n| Detail | Value |\n|--------|-------|\n| Provider | Fal.ai |\n| Get it | https://fal.ai/dashboard/keys |\n| Free tier | Yes (limited credits) |\n| Used for | Image generation (Flux), Video generation (Wan 2.5, Kling) |\n\nIf user doesn''t have `FAL_KEY`:\n1. Direct them to https://fal.ai/dashboard/keys\n2. Create account and generate API key\n3. Add to `.env` file: `FAL_KEY=fal_xxxxx`\n\n### Optional Keys\n\n| Feature | Key | Provider | URL |\n|---------|-----|----------|-----|\n| Music/Voice | `ELEVENLABS_API_KEY` | ElevenLabs | https://elevenlabs.io/app/settings/api-keys |\n| Lipsync | `REPLICATE_API_TOKEN` | Replicate | https://replicate.com/account/api-tokens |\n| Transcription | `GROQ_API_KEY` | Groq | https://console.groq.com/keys |\n\n**Warn user about missing optional keys but continue with available features.**\n\n## Available Features by API Key\n\n**FAL_API_KEY only:**\n- Image generation (Flux models)\n- Image-to-video animation (Wan 2.5, Kling)\n- Text-to-video generation\n- Slideshows with transitions\n- Ken Burns zoom effects\n\n**FAL + ELEVENLABS:**\n- All above, plus:\n- AI-generated background music\n- Text-to-speech voiceovers\n- Talking character videos\n\n**All keys:**\n- Full production pipeline with lipsync and auto-captions\n\n## Quick Templates\n\n### Simple Slideshow (FAL only)\n\n```tsx\n/** @jsxImportSource vargai */\nimport { Render, Clip, Image } from \"vargai/react\";\n\nconst SCENES = [\"sunset over ocean\", \"mountain peaks\", \"city at night\"];\n\nexport default (\n  <Render width={1080} height={1920}>\n    {SCENES.map((prompt, i) => (\n      <Clip key={i} duration={3} transition={{ name: \"fade\", duration: 0.5 }}>\n        <Image prompt={prompt} zoom=\"in\" />\n      </Clip>\n    ))}\n  </Render>\n);\n```\n\n### Animated Video (FAL + ElevenLabs)\n\n```tsx\n/** @jsxImportSource vargai */\nimport { Render, Clip, Image, Video, Music } from \"vargai/react\";\nimport { fal, elevenlabs } from \"vargai/ai\";\n\nconst cat = Image({ prompt: \"cute cat on windowsill\" });\n\nexport default (\n  <Render width={1080} height={1920}>\n    <Music prompt=\"upbeat electronic\" model={elevenlabs.musicModel()} />\n    <Clip duration={5}>\n      <Video\n        prompt={{ text: \"cat turns head, blinks slowly\", images: [cat] }}\n        model={fal.videoModel(\"wan-2.5\")}\n      />\n    </Clip>\n  </Render>\n);\n```\n\n### Talking Character\n\n```tsx\n/** @jsxImportSource vargai */\nimport { Render, Clip, Image, Video, Speech, Captions } from \"vargai/react\";\nimport { fal, elevenlabs } from \"vargai/ai\";\n\nconst robot = Image({ prompt: \"friendly robot, blue metallic\", aspectRatio: \"9:16\" });\n\nconst voiceover = Speech({\n  model: elevenlabs.speechModel(\"eleven_multilingual_v2\"),\n  voice: \"adam\",\n  children: \"Hello! I''m your AI assistant. Let''s create something amazing!\",\n});\n\nexport default (\n  <Render width={1080} height={1920}>\n    <Clip duration={5}>\n      <Video\n        prompt={{ text: \"robot talking, subtle head movements\", images: [robot] }}\n        model={fal.videoModel(\"wan-2.5\")}\n      />\n    </Clip>\n    <Captions src={voiceover} style=\"tiktok\" />\n  </Render>\n);\n```\n\n\n\n## Running Videos\n\n```bash\nbunx vargai render your-video.tsx\n```\n\n## Key Components\n\n| Component | Purpose | Required Key |\n|-----------|---------|--------------|\n| `<Render>` | Root container | - |\n| `<Clip>` | Sequential segment | - |\n| `<Image>` | AI image | FAL |\n| `<Animate>` | Image-to-video | FAL |\n| `<Music>` | Background music | ElevenLabs |\n| `<Speech>` | Text-to-speech | ElevenLabs |\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Character Consistency\n\n```tsx\nconst character = Image({ prompt: \"blue robot\" });\n// Reuse same reference = same generated image\n<Animate image={character} motion=\"waving\" />\n<Animate image={character} motion=\"dancing\" />\n```\n\n### Transitions\n\n```tsx\n<Clip transition={{ name: \"fade\", duration: 0.5 }}>\n// Options: fade, crossfade, wipeleft, cube, slideup, etc.\n```\n\n### Aspect Ratios\n\n- `9:16` - TikTok, Reels, Shorts (vertical)\n- `16:9` - YouTube (horizontal)\n- `1:1` - Instagram (square)\n\n### Zoom Effects\n\n```tsx\n<Image prompt=\"landscape\" zoom=\"in\" />   // Zoom in\n<Image prompt=\"landscape\" zoom=\"out\" />  // Zoom out\n<Image prompt=\"landscape\" zoom=\"left\" /> // Pan left\n```\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n### \"FAL_KEY not found\"\n- Check `.env` file exists in project root\n- Ensure no spaces around `=` sign\n- Restart terminal after adding keys\n\n### \"Rate limit exceeded\"\n- Free tier has limited credits\n- Wait or upgrade plan\n- Use caching to avoid regenerating\n\n### \"Video generation failed\"\n- Check prompt doesn''t violate content policy\n- Try simpler motion descriptions\n- Reduce video duration\n\n## Next Steps\n\n1. Run `bunx vargai init` to initialize project\n2. Add your FAL_KEY to `.env`\n3. Run `bunx vargai render hello.tsx`\n4. Or ask the agent: \"create a 10 second tiktok video about cats\"\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:23:24.934Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Media Agents needing advanced video generation capabilities with JSX syntax and automatic caching.","zh":"非常适合需要使用JSX语法和自动缓存来生成高级视频的媒体代理。","ja":"メディアエージェントがJSX構文と自動キャッシングを使用して高度なビデオ生成機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"JSX 구문 및 자동 캐싱을 사용하여 고급 비디오 생성 기능이 필요한 미디어 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Medios que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de generación de video con sintaxis JSX y caché automático.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents multimédias ayant besoin de fonctionnalités avancées de génération de vidéos avec une syntaxe JSX et un cache automatique.","de":"Perfekt für Media-Agenten, die erweiterte Videogenerierungsfunktionen mit JSX-Syntax und automatischem Caching benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Mídia que precisam de capacidades avançadas de geração de vídeo com sintaxe JSX e cache automático.","ru":"Идеально для Медиа-агентов, которым необходимы продвинутые возможности генерации видео с синтаксисом JSX и автоматическим кэшированием.","ar":"مثالي لوسائل الإعلام التي تحتاج إلى إمكانات متقدمة لإنشاء الفيديو باستخدام بنية JSX وتخزين مؤقت تلقائي."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate AI videos using declarative JSX syntax with automatic caching and parallel generation, leveraging varg React Engine and supporting API keys like FAL_KEY and ELEVENLABS_API_KEY.","zh":"赋予代理使用声明式JSX语法生成AI视频的能力，具有自动缓存和并行生成功能，利用varg React Engine，并支持FAL_KEY和ELEVENLABS_API_KEY等API密钥。","ja":"エージェントに宣言的なJSX構文を使用してAIビデオを生成する機能を提供し、自動キャッシングと並行生成を実現し、varg React Engineを利用し、FAL_KEYやELEVENLABS_API_KEYなどのAPIキーをサポートします。","ko":"에이전트가 선언적 JSX 구문을 사용하여 AI 비디오를 생성할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, 자동 캐싱 및 병렬 생성 기능을 제공하고, varg React Engine을 활용하며, FAL_KEY 및 ELEVENLABS_API_KEY와 같은 API 키를 지원합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar videos de IA utilizando una sintaxis JSX declarativa con caché automático y generación paralela, aprovechando el varg React Engine y soportando claves de API como FAL_KEY y ELEVENLABS_API_KEY.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des vidéos d''IA en utilisant une syntaxe JSX déclarative avec un cache automatique et une génération parallèle, en exploitant le varg React Engine et en prenant en charge des clés d''API comme FAL_KEY et ELEVENLABS_API_KEY.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, AI-Videos mit deklarativer JSX-Syntax und automatischem Caching sowie paralleler Generierung zu erstellen, indem sie den varg React Engine nutzen und API-Schlüssel wie FAL_KEY und ELEVENLABS_API_KEY unterstützen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerar vídeos de IA usando sintaxe JSX declarativa com cache automático e geração paralela, aproveitando o varg React Engine e suportando chaves de API como FAL_KEY e ELEVENLABS_API_KEY.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать видео ИИ с помощью декларативного синтаксиса JSX и автоматического кэширования, а также параллельной генерации, используя varg React Engine и поддерживая ключи API, такие как FAL_KEY и ELEVENLABS_API_KEY.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من إنشاء مقاطع فيديو من الذكاء الاصطناعي باستخدام بنية JSX الإعلانية مع التخزين المؤقت التلقائي والإنشاء الموازي، واستخدام محرك varg React ودعم مفاتيح واجهة برمجة التطبيقات مثل FAL_KEY و ELEVENLABS_API_KEY."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating explainer videos with JSX","Automating video content creation with varg React Engine","Debugging video generation workflows with bunx vargai"],"zh":["使用JSX生成解释性视频","使用varg React Engine自动化视频内容创建","使用bunx vargai调试视频生成工作流"],"ja":["JSXを使用して解説ビデオを生成する","varg React Engineを使用してビデオコンテンツの作成を自動化する","bunx vargaiを使用してビデオ生成ワークフローをデバッグする"],"ko":["JSX를 사용하여 설명 비디오를 생성하는 것","varg React Engine을 사용하여 비디오 콘텐츠 생성을 자동화하는 것","bunx vargai를 사용하여 비디오 생성 워크플ロー 디버깅"],"es":["Generación de videos explicativos con JSX","Automatización de la creación de contenido de video con varg React Engine","Depuración de flujos de trabajo de generación de video con bunx vargai"],"fr":["Génération de vidéos explicatives avec JSX","Automatisation de la création de contenu vidéo avec varg React Engine","Débogage des flux de travail de génération de vidéos avec bunx vargai"],"de":["Erstellung von Erklärungsvideos mit JSX","Automatisierung der Erstellung von Videoinhalten mit varg React Engine","Fehlerbehebung bei Videogenerierungsworkflows mit bunx vargai"],"pt":["Gerar vídeos explicativos com JSX","Automatizar a criação de conteúdo de vídeo com varg React Engine","Depurar fluxos de trabalho de geração de vídeo com bunx vargai"],"ru":["Генерировать видео-объяснения с помощью JSX","Автоматизировать создание видеоконтента с помощью varg React Engine","Дебагировать рабочие процессы генерации видео с помощью bunx vargai"],"ar":["إنشاء مقاطع فيديو توضيحية باستخدام JSX","آليّة إنشاء محتوى الفيديو باستخدام محرك varg React","تصحيح أخطاء تدفقات عمل إنشاء الفيديو باستخدام bunx vargai"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires FAL_KEY API key","Needs .env file configuration","Dependent on bunx vargai initialization"],"zh":["需要FAL_KEY API密钥","需要.env文件配置","依赖bunx vargai初始化"],"ja":["FAL_KEY APIキーが必要",".envファイルの設定が必要","bunx vargaiの初期化に依存"],"ko":["FAL_KEY API 키가 필요합니다",".env 파일 구성이 필요합니다","bunx vargai 초기화에 의존"],"es":["Requiere la clave de API FAL_KEY","Necesita configuración del archivo .env","Dependiente de la inicialización de bunx vargai"],"fr":["Nécessite la clé d''API FAL_KEY","Nécessite une configuration du fichier .env","Dépend de l''initialisation de bunx vargai"],"de":["Benötigt den API-Schlüssel FAL_KEY","Benötigt eine Konfiguration der .env-Datei","Abhängig von der Initialisierung von bunx vargai"],"pt":["Exige a chave de API FAL_KEY","Necessita de configuração do arquivo .env","Depende da inicialização do bunx vargai"],"ru":["Требует ключа API FAL_KEY","Требует конфигурации файла .env","Зависит от инициализации bunx vargai"],"ar":["يتطلب مفتاح واجهة برمجة التطبيقات FAL_KEY","يحتاج إلى تكوين ملف .env","يعتمد على تهيئة bunx vargai"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"4de8747f229526a82f3e558c90e6db3c94e3a9a22cd8c944b7fd0dfec3da1e53","qualityScore":33}');
