 Neon PostgreSQL 实时用户交互 高性能 如何使用sqlmodel-task-models sqlmodel-task-models教程 A full-stack web app using Next.js and Tailwind CSS for the frontend, Python backend, and Neon PostgreSQL for the database. It also features an AI chatbot for real-time user interaction, ensuring scalability and high performance.');
