avec les outils de développement","Support pour plusieurs formats de fichiers"],"de":["Leistungsstarker Linter für natürliche Sprache","In Rust geschrieben","Inspiriert von textlint","Überprüfung und Korrektur von Texten","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Unterstützung für mehrere Dateiformate"],"pt":["Alto desempenho","Escrito em Rust","Inspirado no textlint","Linter de linguagem natural","Código aberto"],"ru":["Высокопроизводительность","Написан на Rust","Вдохновлен textlint","Линтер для языка","Открытый исходный код"],"ar":["أداء عالي","مكتوب بلغة روست","مستوحى من textlint","لينتر لغة طبيعية","مفتوح المصدر"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用m04-zero-cost","什么是自然语言检查器","m04-zero-cost替代品","m04-zero-cost与textlint比较","m04-zero-cost安装","m04-zero-cost设置指南","Rust开发工具","代码质量检查"],"ja":["m04-zero-costの使い方","自然言語リントとは","m04-zero-costの代替","m04-zero-costとtextlintの比較","m04-zero-costのインストール","m04-zero-costの設定ガイド","Rust開発ツール","コード品質チェック"],"ko":["m04-zero-cost 사용법","자연어 린터란","m04-zero-cost 대안","m04-zero-cost와 텍스트린트 비교","m04-zero-cost 설치","m04-zero-cost 설정 가이드","러스트 개발 도구","코드 품질 검사"],"es":["herramientas de AI","linter de lenguaje natural","textlint","Rust","desarrollo de software","análisis de código","corrección de textos","integración con herramientas de desarrollo","m04-zero-cost vs textlint","cómo instalar m04-zero-cost"],"fr":["outils d''IA","linter de langage naturel","textlint","Rust","développement de logiciels","analyse de code","correction de textes","intégration avec les outils de développement","m04-zero-cost vs textlint","comment installer m04-zero-cost"],"de":["KI-Tools","Linter für natürliche Sprache","textlint","Rust","Software-Entwicklung","Code-Analyse","Korrektur von Texten","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","m04-zero-cost vs textlint","wie man m04-zero-cost installiert"],"pt":["como usar m04-zero-cost","o que é linter","m04-zero-cost alternativa","m04-zero-cost vs textlint","instalar m04-zero-cost","guia de configuração do m04-zero-cost","ferramentas de ia para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать m04-zero-cost","что такое линтер","m04-zero-cost альтернатива","m04-zero-cost vs textlint","установить m04-zero-cost","руководство по настройке m04-zero-cost","инструменты ии для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام m04-zero-cost","ما هو لينتر","م04-zero-cost بديل","م04-zero-cost مقابل textlint","تثبيت m04-zero-cost","دليل إعداد m04-zero-cost","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين"]}},"owner":"simorgh3196","repo":"tsuzulint","repoPath":"simorgh3196/tsuzulint","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.707Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"m04-zero-cost","description":"CRITICAL: Use for generics, traits, zero-cost abstraction. Triggers: E0277, E0308, E0599, generic, trait, impl, dyn, where, monomorphization, static dispatch, dynamic dispatch, impl Trait, trait bound not satisfied, 泛型, 特征, 零成本抽象, 单态化","bodyPreview":"# Zero-Cost Abstraction\n\n> **Layer 1: Language Mechanics**\n\n## Core Question\n\n**Do we need compile-time or runtime polymorphism?**\n\nBefore choosing between generics and trait objects:\n- Is the type known at compile time?\n- Is a heterogeneous collection needed?\n- What''s the performance priority?\n\n---\n\n## Error → Design Question\n\n| Error | Don''t Just Say | Ask Instead |\n|-------|----------------|-------------|\n| E0277 | \"Add trait bound\" | Is this abstraction at the right level? |\n| E0308 | \"Fix t","body":"# Zero-Cost Abstraction\n\n> **Layer 1: Language Mechanics**\n\n## Core Question\n\n**Do we need compile-time or runtime polymorphism?**\n\nBefore choosing between generics and trait objects:\n- Is the type known at compile time?\n- Is a heterogeneous collection needed?\n- What''s the performance priority?\n\n---\n\n## Error → Design Question\n\n| Error | Don''t Just Say | Ask Instead |\n|-------|----------------|-------------|\n| E0277 | \"Add trait bound\" | Is this abstraction at the right level? |\n| E0308 | \"Fix the type\" | Should types be unified or distinct? |\n| E0599 | \"Import the trait\" | Is the trait the right abstraction? |\n| E0038 | \"Make object-safe\" | Do we really need dynamic dispatch? |\n\n---\n\n## Thinking Prompt\n\nBefore adding trait bounds:\n\n1. **What abstraction is needed?**\n   - Same behavior, different types → trait\n   - Different behavior, same type → enum\n   - No abstraction needed → concrete type\n\n2. **When is type known?**\n   - Compile time → generics (static dispatch)\n   - Runtime → trait objects (dynamic dispatch)\n\n3. **What''s the trade-off priority?**\n   - Performance → generics\n   - Compile time → trait objects\n   - Flexibility → depends\n\n---\n\n## Trace Up ↑\n\nWhen type system fights back:\n\n```\nE0277 (trait bound not satisfied)\n    ↑ Ask: Is the abstraction level correct?\n    ↑ Check: m09-domain (what behavior is being abstracted?)\n    ↑ Check: m05-type-driven (should use newtype?)\n```\n\n| Persistent Error | Trace To | Question |\n|-----------------|----------|----------|\n| Complex trait bounds | m09-domain | Is the abstraction right? |\n| Object safety issues | m05-type-driven | Can typestate help? |\n| Type explosion | m10-performance | Accept dyn overhead? |\n\n---\n\n## Trace Down ↓\n\nFrom design to implementation:\n\n```\n\"Need to abstract over types with same behavior\"\n    ↓ Types known at compile time → impl Trait or generics\n    ↓ Types determined at runtime → dyn Trait\n\n\"Need collection of different types\"\n    ↓ Closed set → enum\n    ↓ Open set → Vec<Box<dyn Trait>>\n\n\"Need to return different types\"\n    ↓ Same type → impl Trait\n    ↓ Different types → Box<dyn Trait>\n```\n\n---\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n| Pattern | Dispatch | Code Size | Runtime Cost |\n|---------|----------|-----------|--------------|\n| `fn foo<T: Trait>()` | Static | +bloat | Zero |\n| `fn foo(x: &dyn Trait)` | Dynamic | Minimal | vtable lookup |\n| `impl Trait` return | Static | +bloat | Zero |\n| `Box<dyn Trait>` | Dynamic | Minimal | Allocation + vtable |\n\n## Syntax Comparison\n\n```rust\n// Static dispatch - type known at compile time\nfn process(x: impl Display) { }      // argument position\nfn process<T: Display>(x: T) { }     // explicit generic\nfn get() -> impl Display { }         // return position\n\n// Dynamic dispatch - type determined at runtime\nfn process(x: &dyn Display) { }      // reference\nfn process(x: Box<dyn Display>) { }  // owned\n```\n\n## Error Code Reference\n\n| Error | Cause | Quick Fix |\n|-------|-------|-----------|\n| E0277 | Type doesn''t impl trait | Add impl or change bound |\n| E0308 | Type mismatch | Check generic params |\n| E0599 | No method found | Import trait with `use` |\n| E0038 | Trait not object-safe | Use generics or redesign |\n\n---\n\n## Decision Guide\n\n| Scenario | Choose | Why |\n|----------|--------|-----|\n| Performance critical | Generics | Zero runtime cost |\n| Heterogeneous collection | `dyn Trait` | Different types at runtime |\n| Plugin architecture | `dyn Trait` | Unknown types at compile |\n| Reduce compile time | `dyn Trait` | Less monomorphization |\n| Small, known type set | `enum` | No indirection |\n\n---\n\n## Object Safety\n\nA trait is object-safe if it:\n- Doesn''t have `Self: Sized` bound\n- Doesn''t return `Self`\n- Doesn''t have generic methods\n- Uses `where Self: Sized` for non-object-safe methods\n\n---\n\n## Anti-Patterns\n\n| Anti-Pattern | Why Bad | Better |\n|--------------|---------|--------|\n| Over-generic everything | Compile time, complexity | Concrete types when possible |\n| `dyn` for known types | Unnecessary indirection | Generics |\n| Complex trait hierarchies | Hard to understand | Simpler design |\n| Ignore object safety | Limits flexibility | Plan for dyn if needed |\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n| When | See |\n|------|-----|\n| Type-driven design | m05-type-driven |\n| Domain abstraction | m09-domain |\n| Performance concerns | m10-performance |\n| Send/Sync bounds | m07-concurrency |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:42:35.027Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Rust-based AI Agents needing high-performance natural language linting and zero-cost abstraction analysis.","zh":"非常适合需要高性能自然语言 linting 和零成本抽象分析的基于 Rust 的 AI Agent。","ja":"高性能な自然言語 linting とゼロコスト抽象化解析を必要とする Rust ベースの AI Agent に最適です。","ko":"고성능 자연어 린팅과 제로 코스트 추상화 분석이 필요한 Rust 기반 AI 에이전트에 완벽합니다.","es":"Ideal para AI Agents basados en Rust que necesitan linting de lenguaje natural de alto rendimiento y análisis de abstracción de costo cero.","fr":"Parfait pour les AI Agents basés sur Rust nécessitant un linting de langage naturel haute performance et une analyse d''abstraction à coût nul.","de":"Perfekt für Rust-basierte AI Agents, die High-Performance-Natural-Language-Linting und Zero-Cost-Abstraktionsanalyse benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para AI Agents baseados em Rust que necessitam de linting de linguagem natural de alta performance e análise de abstração de custo zero.","ru":"Идеально подходит для AI Agents на основе Rust, которым требуется высокопроизводительный линтинг естественного языка и анализ абстракций с нулевой стоимостью.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي القائمين على Rust الذين يحتاجون إلى تدقيق لغة طبيعية عالي الأداء وتحليل تجريد بتكلفة صفر."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze and optimize Rust code using compile-time and runtime polymorphism, leveraging trait objects and generics for enhanced performance, while considering errors like E0277 and E0308 to inform design decisions.","zh":"赋能 Agent 利用编译时和运行时多态性，通过 trait objects 和 generics 来分析和优化 Rust 代码以实现增强性能，同时考虑 E0277 和 E0308 等错误以指导设计决策。","ja":"コンパイル時および実行時のポリモーフィズムを活用し、trait objects と generics を使用して Rust コードを分析および最適化し、パフォーマンスを向上させるとともに、E0277 や E0308 などのエラーを考慮して設計判断を支援します。","ko":"트레이트 객체와 제네릭을 활용한 컴파일 타임 및 런타임 다형성을 통해 Rust 코드를 분석하고 최적화하여 성능을 향상시키는 동시에 E0277 및 E0308과 같은 오류를 고려하여 설계 결정을 내리도록 에이전트를 지원합니다.","es":"Permite a los agents analizar y optimizar código Rust utilizando polimorfismo en tiempo de compilación y en tiempo de ejecución, aprovechando trait objects y generics para un rendimiento mejorado, mientras considera errores como E0277 y E0308 para informar decisiones de diseño.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser et d''optimiser le code Rust en utilisant le polymorphisme à la compilation et à l''exécution, en tirant parti des trait objects et des generics pour des performances accrues, tout en prenant en compte des erreurs comme E0277 et E0308 pour éclairer les décisions de conception.","de":"Ermöglicht Agents, Rust-Code mittels Compile-Time- und Runtime-Polymorphismus zu analysieren und zu optimieren, indem Trait Objects und Generics für verbesserte Leistung genutzt werden, während Fehler wie E0277 und E0308 zur Informierung von Designentscheidungen berücksichtigt werden.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a analisar e otimizar código Rust usando polimorfismo em tempo de compilação e tempo de execução, aproveitando trait objects e generics para performance aprimorada, enquanto considera erros como E0277 e E0308 para informar decisões de design.","ru":"Позволяет агентам анализировать и оптимизировать код Rust, используя полиморфизм во время компиляции и выполнения, применяя trait objects и дженерики для повышения производительности, учитывая при этом такие ошибки, как E0277 и E0308, для принятия проектных решений.","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من تحليل وتحسين كود Rust باستخدام تعدد الأشكال في وقت الترجمة ووقت التشغيل، والاستفادة من كائنات السمات (trait objects) والعواميد (generics) لتحسين الأداء، مع الأخذ في الاعتبار أخطاء مثل E0277 و E0308 لإبلاغ قرارات التصميم."},"useCases":{"en":["Analyzing language mechanics for optimal abstraction","Debugging Rust code with trait object errors","Optimizing performance-critical code using zero-cost abstractions"],"zh":["分析语言机制以实现最佳抽象化","调试带有 trait object 错误的 Rust 代码","使用零成本抽象化优化性能关键代码"],"ja":["最適な抽象化のための言語メカニズムの分析","trait object エラーを含む Rust コードのデバッグ","ゼロコスト抽象化を使用したパフォーマンスクリティカルなコードの最適化"],"ko":["최적의 추상화를 위한 언어 메커니즘 분석","트레이트 객체 오류가 있는 Rust 코드 디버깅","제로 코스트 추상화를 사용한 성능 중요 코드 최적화"],"es":["Analizar mecánicas del lenguaje para una abstracción óptima","Depurar código Rust con errores de trait object","Optimizar código crítico para el rendimiento utilizando abstracciones de costo cero"],"fr":["Analyser les mécanismes du langage pour une abstraction optimale","Déboguer du code Rust avec des erreurs de trait object","Optimiser les code critiques pour les performances en utilisant des abstractions à coût nul"],"de":["Analysieren von Sprachmechaniken für optimale Abstraktion","Debuggen von Rust-Code mit Trait-Object-Fehlern","Optimieren von leistungskritischem Code mittels Zero-Cost-Abstractions"],"pt":["Analisar mecanismos de linguagem para abstração ideal","Depurar código Rust com erros de trait object","Otimizar código crítico de performance usando abstrações de custo zero"],"ru":["Анализ механизмов языка для оптимальной абстракции","Отладка кода Rust с ошибками trait object","Оптимизация критичного к производительности кода с использованием абстракций с нулевой стоимостью"],"ar":["تحليل آليات اللغة للحصول على تجريد أمثل","تصحيح كود Rust مع أخطاء كائن السمة (trait object)","تحسين الكود الحرج للأداء باستخدام تجريدات بتكلفة صفر"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Rust programming knowledge","Limited to Rust-based projects","Dependent on textlint-inspired linting rules"],"zh":["需要 Rust 编程知识","仅限于基于 Rust 的项目","依赖于 textlint 启发的 linting 规则"],"ja":["Rust プログラミングの知識が必要","Rust ベースのプロジェクトに限定される","textlint にヒントを得た linting ルールに依存"],"ko":["Rust 프로그래밍 지식 필요","Rust 기반 프로젝트로 제한됨","textlint에서 영감을 받은 린팅 규칙에 의존"],"es":["Requiere conocimientos de programación en Rust","Limitado a proyectos basados en Rust","Depende de reglas de linting inspiradas en textlint"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances en programmation Rust","Limité aux projets basés sur Rust","Dépend de règles de linting inspirées de textlint"],"de":["Erfordert Rust-Programmierkenntnisse","Beschränkt auf Rust-basierte Projekte","Abhängig von textlint-inspirierten Linting-Regeln"],"pt":["Requer conhecimento de programação Rust","Limitado a projetos baseados em Rust","Dependente de regras de linting inspiradas no textlint"],"ru":["Требует знания программирования на Rust","Ограничено проектами на основе Rust","Зависит от правил линтинга, вдохновленных textlint"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة ببرمجة Rust","مقتصر على المشاريع القائمة على Rust","يعتمد على قواعد التدقيق المستوحاة من textlint"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"3a2eed8faf0a0087aa5c823d66341123cc6f43ef36d1767c3fdbcc86cf8b4b54","qualityScore":33}');
