iones multipágina co...","fr":"Outils IA: Créez des applications multipages avec Streamlit","de":"KI-Tools: Erstellen Sie mehrseitige Anwendungen mit Strea...","pt":"Construindo Aplicativos Multipáginas com Ferramentas de IA","ru":"Создание Мультистраничных Приложений с ИИ Агентами","ar":"بناء تطبيقات متعددة الصفحات مع أدوات الإي الأجنت","en":"building-streamlit-multipage-apps"},"description":{"zh":"使用Streamlit、Python和FastAPI开发AI信用评分系统，实现透明和可审计的信用决策","ja":"Streamlit、Python、FastAPIを使用してAI信用評価システムを開発し、透明性と監査可能な信用意思決定を実現","ko":"Streamlit, Python, FastAPI를 사용하여 AI 신용 평가 시스템을 개발하여 투명성과 감사가 가능한 신용 결정 구현","es":"Construye aplicaciones multipágina con Streamlit y explora las posibilidades de las herramientas de AI en el desarrollo de software","fr":"Créez des applications multipages avec Streamlit et explorez les possibilités des outils IA dans le développement de logiciels","de":"Erstellen Sie mehrseitige Anwendungen mit Streamlit und erkunden Sie die Möglichkeiten von KI-Tools in der Softwareentwicklung","pt":"Construa aplicativos multipáginas com Streamlit e Python para soluções de crédito transparentes e governáveis.","ru":"Создайте мультистраничные приложения с Streamlit и Python для прозрачных и управляемых решений для кредитования.","ar":"ابني تطبيقات متعددة الصفحات مع Streamlit و Python لحلول إئتمان شفافة و محكمة","en":"NEXUS AI: Fair & Auditable Credit Scoring An advanced credit decisioning system bringing transparency and governance to AI lending. Features a Random Forest ..."},"definition":{"en":"NEXUS AI: Fair & Auditable Credit Scoring An advanced credit decisioning system bringing transparency and governance to AI lending. Features a Random Forest model trained on Indian datasets, cryptographic audit logging, and a real-time \"Glassmorphism\" executive dashboard. Built with Python, FastAPI, and Streamlit."},"features":{"zh":["使用Streamlit开发多页应用","Python和FastAPI实现透明的AI信用评分","随机森林模型训练于印度数据集","加密审计日志","实时玻璃态仪表盘"],"ja":["Streamlitを使用してマルチページアプリを開発","PythonとFastAPIを使用して透明なAI信用評価を実現","ランダムフォレストモデルをインドのデータセットでトレーニング","暗号化監査ログ","リアルタイムのガラスモーフィズムダッシュボード"],"ko":["스트림릿을 사용하여 멀티 페이지 앱 개발","Python과 FastAPI를 사용하여 투명한 AI 신용 평가 구현","랜덤 포레스트 모델을 인도 데이터셋에서 학습","암호화 감사 로그","실시간 글래스모피즘 대시보드"],"es":["Construcción de aplicaciones multipágina con Streamlit","Integración con Python y FastAPI","Uso de modelos de Random Forest para la toma de decisiones de crédito","Registro de auditoría criptográfico","Panel de control ejecutivo en tiempo real con Glassmorphism"],"fr":["Création d''applications multipages avec Streamlit","Intégration avec Python et FastAPI","Utilisation de modèles de Random Forest pour la prise de décision de crédit","Journalisation d''audit cryptographique","Tableau de bord exécutif en temps réel avec Glassmorphism"],"de":["Erstellung von mehrseitigen Anwendungen mit Streamlit","Integration mit Python und FastAPI","Verwendung von Random-Forest-Modellen für die Kreditentscheidung","Kryptographisches Audit-Protokoll","Echtzeit-Executive-Dashboard mit Glassmorphism"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicativos multipáginas com Streamlit","Integração com Python e FastAPI","Modelo de Random Forest treinado em datasets indianos","Registro de auditoria criptográfico","Painel executivo em tempo real com Glassmorphism"],"ru":["Разработка мультистраничных приложений с Streamlit","Интеграция с Python и FastAPI","Модель Random Forest, обученная на индийских наборах данных","Криптографический аудитный журнал","Реальный панель управления с Glassmorphism"],"ar":["بناء تطبيقات متعددة الصفحات مع Streamlit","التكامل مع Python و FastAPI","نموذج غابة عشوائية مدرب على مجموعات بيانات هندية","سجل تدقيق تشفيري","لوحة تحكم تنفيذية في الوقت الحقيقي مع Glassmorphism"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Streamlit开发AI信用评分系统","Streamlit多页应用开发","AI信用评分系统是什么","Streamlit vs Dash","Streamlit安装指南","FastAPI和Streamlit集成"],"ja":["Streamlitを使用してAI信用評価システムを開発する方法","Streamlitマルチページアプリの開発","AI信用評価システムとは","StreamlitとDashの比較","Streamlitのインストールガイド","FastAPIとStreamlitの統合"],"ko":["스트림릿을 사용하여 AI 신용 평가 시스템을 개발하는 방법","스트림릿 멀티 페이지 앱 개발","AI 신용 평가 시스템이란","스트림릿과 대시의 비교","스트림릿 설치 가이드","FastAPI와 스트림릿의 통합"],"es":["herramientas de AI","desarrollo de aplicaciones multipágina","Streamlit","Python","FastAPI","Random Forest","cómo usar Streamlit","alternativas a Streamlit","guía de instalación de Streamlit"],"fr":["outils IA","développement d''applications multipages","Streamlit","Python","FastAPI","Random Forest","comment utiliser Streamlit","alternatives à Streamlit","guide d''installation de Streamlit"],"de":["KI-Tools","Entwicklung von mehrseitigen Anwendungen","Streamlit","Python","FastAPI","Random Forest","wie man Streamlit verwendet","Alternativen zu Streamlit","Installationsanleitung für Streamlit"],"pt":["como usar Streamlit","o que é IA","alternativas para FastAPI","Streamlit vs Dash","instalar Streamlit","guia de configuração do Streamlit"],"ru":["как использовать Streamlit","что такое ИИ","альтернативы для FastAPI","Streamlit vs Dash","установить Streamlit","руководство по настройке Streamlit"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Streamlit","ما هي أداة الإي","بديلات ل FastAPI","Streamlit مقابل Dash","تثبيت Streamlit","دليل إعداد Streamlit"]}},"owner":"Mahaboob26","repo":"NEXUS-TRUSAI","repoPath":"Mahaboob26/NEXUS-TRUSAI","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.709Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"building-streamlit-multipage-apps","description":"Building multi-page Streamlit apps. Use when creating apps with multiple pages, setting up navigation, or managing state across pages.","bodyPreview":"# Streamlit multi-page apps\n\nStructure and navigation for apps with multiple pages.\n\n## Directory structure\n\n```\nstreamlit_app.py          # Main entry point\napp_pages/\n    home.py\n    analytics.py\n    settings.py\n```\n\n**Important:** Name your pages directory `app_pages/` (not `pages/`). Using `pages/` conflicts with Streamlit''s old auto-discovery API and can cause unexpected behavior.\n\n## Main module\n\n```python\n# streamlit_app.py\nimport streamlit as st\n\n# Initialize global state (shared across","body":"# Streamlit multi-page apps\n\nStructure and navigation for apps with multiple pages.\n\n## Directory structure\n\n```\nstreamlit_app.py          # Main entry point\napp_pages/\n    home.py\n    analytics.py\n    settings.py\n```\n\n**Important:** Name your pages directory `app_pages/` (not `pages/`). Using `pages/` conflicts with Streamlit''s old auto-discovery API and can cause unexpected behavior.\n\n## Main module\n\n```python\n# streamlit_app.py\nimport streamlit as st\n\n# Initialize global state (shared across pages)\nif \"api_client\" not in st.session_state:\n    st.session_state.api_client = init_api_client()\n\n# Define navigation\npage = st.navigation([\n    st.Page(\"app_pages/home.py\", title=\"Home\", icon=\":material/home:\"),\n    st.Page(\"app_pages/analytics.py\", title=\"Analytics\", icon=\":material/bar_chart:\"),\n    st.Page(\"app_pages/settings.py\", title=\"Settings\", icon=\":material/settings:\"),\n])\n\n# App-level UI runs before page content\n# Useful for shared elements like titles\nst.title(f\"{page.icon} {page.title}\")\n\npage.run()\n```\n\n**Note:** When you handle titles in `streamlit_app.py`, individual pages should NOT use `st.title` again.\n\n## Navigation position\n\n**Few pages (3-7) → Top navigation:**\n\n```python\npage = st.navigation([...], position=\"top\")\n```\n\nCreates a clean horizontal menu. Great for simple apps. Sections are supported too—they appear as dropdowns in the top nav.\n\n**Many pages or nested sections → Sidebar:**\n\n```python\npage = st.navigation({\n    \"Main\": [\n        st.Page(\"app_pages/home.py\", title=\"Home\"),\n        st.Page(\"app_pages/analytics.py\", title=\"Analytics\"),\n    ],\n    \"Admin\": [\n        st.Page(\"app_pages/settings.py\", title=\"Settings\"),\n        st.Page(\"app_pages/users.py\", title=\"Users\"),\n    ],\n}, position=\"sidebar\")\n```\n\n**Mixed: Some pages ungrouped:**\n\nUse an empty string key `\"\"` for pages that shouldn''t be in a section. These ungrouped pages always appear first, before any named groups. Put all ungrouped pages in a single `\"\"` key:\n\n```python\npage = st.navigation({\n    \"\": [\n        st.Page(\"app_pages/home.py\", title=\"Home\"),\n        st.Page(\"app_pages/about.py\", title=\"About\"),\n    ],\n    \"Analytics\": [\n        st.Page(\"app_pages/dashboard.py\", title=\"Dashboard\"),\n        st.Page(\"app_pages/reports.py\", title=\"Reports\"),\n    ],\n}, position=\"top\")\n```\n\n## Page modules\n\n```python\n# app_pages/analytics.py\nimport streamlit as st\n\n# Access global state\napi = st.session_state.api_client\nuser = st.session_state.user\n\n# Page-specific content (title is handled in streamlit_app.py)\ndata = api.fetch_analytics(user.id)\nst.line_chart(data)\n```\n\n## Global state\n\nInitialize state in the main module only if it''s needed across multiple pages:\n\n```python\n# streamlit_app.py\nst.session_state.api = init_client()\nst.session_state.user = get_user()\nst.session_state.settings = load_settings()\n```\n\n**Tip:** Use `st.session_state.setdefault(\"key\", default_value)` to initialize values only if they don''t exist.\n\n**Why main module (for global state):**\n- Runs before every page\n- Ensures state is initialized\n- Single source of truth\n\n## Page-specific state\n\nUse prefixed keys for page-specific state:\n\n```python\n# app_pages/analytics.py\nif \"analytics_date_range\" not in st.session_state:\n    st.session_state.analytics_date_range = default_range()\n```\n\n## Share elements between pages\n\nPut shared UI in the entrypoint (before `page.run()`) so it appears on all pages:\n\n```python\n# streamlit_app.py\nimport streamlit as st\n\npages = [...]\npage = st.navigation(pages)\n\n# Shared title\nst.title(f\"{page.icon} {page.title}\")\n\n# Shared sidebar widgets\nwith st.sidebar:\n    st.selectbox(\"Theme\", [\"Light\", \"Dark\"])\n\npage.run()\n```\n\n## Programmatic navigation\n\nNavigate to another page programmatically:\n\n```python\nif st.button(\"Go to Settings\"):\n    st.switch_page(\"app_pages/settings.py\")\n```\n\nCreate navigation links with `st.page_link`:\n\n```python\nst.page_link(\"app_pages/home.py\", label=\"Home\", icon=\":material/home:\")\nst.page_link(\"https://example.com\", label=\"External\", icon=\":material/open_in_new:\")\n```\n\n> **Note:** Prefer `st.navigation` over `st.page_link` for standard navigation. Do not use `st.page_link` to recreate the nav bar you get with `st.navigation`. Only use `st.page_link` when linking to pages from somewhere other than the sidebar, or when building a more complex navigation menu.\n\n## Conditional pages\n\nShow different pages based on user role, authentication, or any other condition by building the pages list dynamically:\n\n```python\n# streamlit_app.py\nimport streamlit as st\n\npages = [st.Page(\"app_pages/home.py\", title=\"Home\", icon=\":material/home:\")]\n\nif st.user.is_logged_in:\n    pages.append(st.Page(\"app_pages/dashboard.py\", title=\"Dashboard\", icon=\":material/bar_chart:\"))\n\nif st.session_state.get(\"is_admin\"):\n    pages.append(st.Page(\"app_pages/admin.py\", title=\"Admin\", icon=\":material/settings:\"))\n\npage = st.navigation(pages)\npage.run()\n```\n\nCommon conditions for showing/hiding pages:\n- `st.user.is_logged_in` for authenticated users\n- `st.session_state` flags (roles, permissions, feature flags)\n- Environment variables or secrets\n- Time-based access (e.g., beta features)\n\n## Imports from pages\n\nWhen importing from page files in `app_pages/`, always import from the root directory perspective:\n\n```python\n# app_pages/dashboard.py - GOOD\nfrom utils.data import load_sales_data\n\n# app_pages/dashboard.py - BAD (don''t use relative imports)\nfrom ..utils.data import load_sales_data\n```\n\n## References\n\n- [Multipage apps docs](https://docs.streamlit.io/develop/concepts/multipage-apps)\n- [st.navigation](https://docs.streamlit.io/develop/api-reference/navigation/st.navigation)\n- [st.Page](https://docs.streamlit.io/develop/api-reference/navigation/st.page)\n- [st.session_state](https://docs.streamlit.io/develop/api-reference/caching-and-state/st.session_state)\n- [st.switch_page](https://docs.streamlit.io/develop/api-reference/navigation/st.switch_page)\n- [st.page_link](https://docs.streamlit.io/develop/api-reference/widgets/st.page_link)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:44:19.241Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Analysis Agents needing advanced multi-page data visualization and dashboarding capabilities with Streamlit.","zh":"适合需要高级多页数据可视化和仪表板功能的Python分析代理，使用Streamlit。","ja":"Streamlitを使用して高度なマルチページデータ可視化およびダッシュボード機能を必要とするPython分析エージェントに最適です。","ko":"Streamlit를 사용하여 고급 多ページ 데이터 시각화 및 대시보드 기능이 필요한 Python 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Python que necesitan capacidades de visualización de datos avanzadas y multi-página con Streamlit.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse Python qui ont besoin de capacités de visualisation de données avancées et multi-page avec Streamlit.","de":"Perfekt für Python-Analyseagenten, die erweiterte Möglichkeiten für die Datenvisualisierung und das Dashboarding mit Streamlit benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Python que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de visualização de dados em várias páginas e criação de painéis com Streamlit.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа Python, которым необходимы расширенные возможности визуализации данных на нескольких страницах и создания панелей с помощью Streamlit.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء التحليلية بايثون التي تحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة للرؤية البيانية للبيانات على صفحات متعددة وإنشاء لوحات القيادة مع Streamlit."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create structured and navigable multi-page apps using Streamlit, featuring a directory structure with separate pages for home, analytics, and settings, and utilizing Python for seamless integration.","zh":"赋予代理创建结构化和可导航的多页应用程序的能力，使用Streamlit，具有主页、分析和设置的目录结构，并利用Python实现无缝集成。","ja":"Streamlitを使用して、ホーム、分析、設定などのディレクトリ構造を持つ構造化されたナビゲーション可能なマルチページアプリケーションを作成するエージェントの能力を提供し、Pythonを使用してシームレスな統合を実現します。","ko":"Streamlit를 사용하여 홈, 분석, 설정 등과 같은 디렉토리 구조를 갖춘 구조화되고 탐색 가능한 多ページ 애플리케이션을 생성할 수 있는 에이전트의 능력을 부여하며, Python을 사용하여 무결점 통합을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear aplicaciones multi-página estructuradas y navegables utilizando Streamlit, con una estructura de directorios que incluye páginas separadas para inicio, análisis y configuración, y que utiliza Python para una integración sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des applications multi-page structurées et navigables en utilisant Streamlit, avec une structure de répertoire qui comprend des pages distinctes pour l''accueil, l''analyse et les paramètres, et qui utilise Python pour une intégration transparente.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, strukturierte und navigierbare Multi-Seiten-Apps mit Streamlit zu erstellen, mit einer Verzeichnisstruktur, die separate Seiten für Startseite, Analyse und Einstellungen enthält und Python für eine nahtlose Integration nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar aplicativos multi-página estruturados e navegáveis usando Streamlit, com uma estrutura de diretório que inclui páginas separadas para home, análise e configurações, e utilizando Python para integração sem problemas.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать структурированные и навигируемые многостраничные приложения, используя Streamlit, с目录ной структурой, включающей отдельные страницы для главной страницы, аналитики и настроек, и использует Python для бесшовной интеграции.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء تطبيقات متعددة الصفحات منظمات وقابلة للملاحة باستخدام Streamlit، مع هيكل دليل يتضمن صفحات منفصلة للمaison، التحليل والإعدادات، واستخدام بايثون للتكامل دون مشاكل."},"useCases":{"en":["Building interactive executive dashboards","Creating multi-page data storytelling experiences","Developing real-time analytics platforms"],"zh":["构建交互式高管仪表板","创建多页数据故事体验","开发实时分析平台"],"ja":["インタラクティブなエグゼクティブダッシュボードの構築","マルチページデータストーリーテリングの体験の作成","リアルタイム分析プラットフォームの開発"],"ko":["인터랙티브 이그제큐티브 대시보드 구축","多ページ 데이터 스토리 텔링 경험 생성","실시간 분석 플랫폼 개발"],"es":["Creación de paneles de control interactivos para ejecutivos","Creación de experiencias de narración de datos multi-página","Desarrollo de plataformas de análisis en tiempo real"],"fr":["Création de tableaux de bord interactifs pour les dirigeants","Création d''expériences de narration de données multi-page","Développement de plateformes d''analyse en temps réel"],"de":["Erstellung interaktiver Führungskräfte-Dashboards","Erstellung von Multi-Seiten-Daten-Erzählungserlebnissen","Entwicklung von Echtzeit-Analyseplattformen"],"pt":["Construção de painéis executivos interativos","Criação de experiências de narrativa de dados em várias páginas","Desenvolvimento de plataformas de análise em tempo real"],"ru":["Создание интерактивных исполнительных панелей","Создание многостраничных опытов повествования данных","Разработка платформ реального времени аналитики"],"ar":["بناء لوحات تنفيذية تفاعلية","إنشاء تجارب سرد البيانات على صفحات متعددة","تطوير منصات تحليل الوقت الفعلي"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Streamlit installation","Python compatibility required","Directory structure must follow ''app_pages/'' convention to avoid conflicts with Streamlit''s auto-discovery API"],"zh":["需要Streamlit安装","需要Python兼容性","目录结构必须遵循''app_pages/''约定，以避免与Streamlit的自动发现API发生冲突"],"ja":["Streamlitのインストールが必要","Pythonの互換性が必要","ディレクトリ構造は、Streamlitの自動検出APIとコンフリクトを避けるために、''app_pages/''の命名規則に従う必要があります"],"ko":["Streamlit 설치 필요","Python 호환성 필요","디렉토리 구조는 Streamlit의 자동 검색 API와 충돌을 피하기 위해 ''app_pages/'' 규칙을 따라야 함"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de Streamlit","Se requiere compatibilidad con Python","La estructura de directorios debe seguir la convención ''app_pages/'' para evitar conflictos con la API de auto-detección de Streamlit"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Streamlit","La compatibilité Python est requise","La structure de répertoire doit suivre la convention ''app_pages/'' pour éviter les conflits avec l''API de détection automatique de Streamlit"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation von Streamlit","Python-Kompatibilität ist erforderlich","Die Verzeichnisstruktur muss der Konvention ''app_pages/'' folgen, um Konflikte mit der Auto-Discovery-API von Streamlit zu vermeiden"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Streamlit","Compatibilidade com Python necessária","A estrutura de diretório deve seguir a convenção ''app_pages/'' para evitar conflitos com a API de auto-descoberta do Streamlit"],"ru":["Требуется установка Streamlit","Требуется совместимость с Python","Структура директории должна следовать соглашению ''app_pages/'', чтобы избежать конфликтов с API автопоиска Streamlit"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Streamlit","متطلبات التوافق مع بايثون","يجب أن يتبع هيكل الدليل اتفاقية ''app_pages/'' لتجنب النزاعات مع واجهة برمجة التطبيقات للكشف التلقائي في Streamlit"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"801d8abcd2652bf3c213de7a914a5ccb5897bc3eca6ad6843d908161bcff39a5","qualityScore":33}');
