"cats-effect-io","أدوات الأجهزة الافتراضية الجافا","JVM","كيفية استخدام cats-effect-io","ما هي أدوات قاعدة البيانات cats-effect-io","بديلات أدوات قاعدة البيانات cats-effect-io","cats-effect-io مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت cats-effect-io","دليل إعداد cats-effect-io"]}},"owner":"funfix","repo":"database","repoPath":"funfix/database","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.803Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"cats-effect-io","description":"Scala functional programming with Cats Effect IO and typeclasses. Use for wrapping side effects, modeling purity, choosing Sync/Async/Temporal/Concurrent, handling blocking I/O, and composing resources, fibers, and concurrency safely.","bodyPreview":"# Cats Effect IO (Scala)\n\n## Quick start\n- Treat every side effect as an effect value: return `IO[A]`, `SyncIO[A]`, or `F[A]` with `F[_]: Sync`/`Async`/`Temporal` as needed.\n- Wrap Java blocking calls with `IO.blocking` or `IO.interruptible` (or `Sync[F].blocking`/`interruptible`).\n- Use `Resource` to acquire/release resources and `IOApp` for program entry points.\n- Prefer structured concurrency (`parTraverse`, `parMapN`, `background`, `Supervisor`) over manual fiber management.\n- Read `referenc","body":"# Cats Effect IO (Scala)\n\n## Quick start\n- Treat every side effect as an effect value: return `IO[A]`, `SyncIO[A]`, or `F[A]` with `F[_]: Sync`/`Async`/`Temporal` as needed.\n- Wrap Java blocking calls with `IO.blocking` or `IO.interruptible` (or `Sync[F].blocking`/`interruptible`).\n- Use `Resource` to acquire/release resources and `IOApp` for program entry points.\n- Prefer structured concurrency (`parTraverse`, `parMapN`, `background`, `Supervisor`) over manual fiber management.\n- Read `references/cats-effect-io.md` for concepts, recipes, and FAQ guidance.\n- For deeper `Resource` guidance, use the `cats-effect-resource` skill (install: `npx skills add https://github.com/alexandru/skills --skill cats-effect-resource`).\n\n## Workflow\n1. Classify side effects and choose the effect type: `IO` directly or polymorphic `F[_]` with the smallest required Cats Effect typeclass (`Sync`, `Async`, `Temporal`, `Concurrent`).\n2. Wrap side-effectful code using `IO(...)`, `IO.blocking`, `IO.interruptible`, or `IO.async` (or their `Sync`/`Async` equivalents).\n3. Manage resources with `Resource` or `bracket` and keep acquisition/release inside effects.\n4. Compose effects with `flatMap`/for-comprehensions and collection combinators (`traverse`, `parTraverse`).\n5. Use concurrency primitives (`Ref`, `Deferred`, `Queue`, `Semaphore`, `Supervisor`) and structured concurrency to avoid fiber leaks.\n\n## Side-effect rules (apply to `IO`, `SyncIO`, and to `F[_]: Sync/Async`)\n- All side-effectful functions must return results wrapped in `IO` (or `F[_]` with Cats Effect typeclasses).\n- Side-effects include all non-determinism (call sites are not referentially transparent):\n  - Any I/O (files, sockets, console, databases).\n  - `Instant.now()`, `Random.nextInt()`.\n  - Any read from shared mutable state (the read itself is the side effect).\n  - Returning mutable data structures (for example, `Array[Int]`).\n\n## Blocking I/O rules\n- Java blocking methods must be wrapped in `IO.blocking` or `IO.interruptible` (or `Sync[F].blocking`/`interruptible`) so they run on the blocking pool.\n- Prefer `IO.interruptible` for methods that may throw `InterruptedException` or `IOException`, but not for resource disposal.\n- Use `IO.blocking` for cleanup/disposal (`Closeable#close`, `AutoCloseable#close`).\n\n## Output expectations\n- Make side effects explicit in signatures (`IO`/`SyncIO` or `F[_]: Sync/Async`); the guidance here applies equally to concrete `IO` and polymorphic `F[_]`.\n- Use the smallest typeclass constraint that supports the needed operations.\n- Keep effects as values; do not execute effects in constructors or top-level vals.\n\n## References\n- Load `references/cats-effect-io.md` for documentation summary and patterns.\n- For concrete samples, read `references/cats-effect-io.md`.\n- Use the `cats-effect-resource` skill for Resource-specific workflows and patterns (install: `npx skills add https://github.com/alexandru/skills --skill cats-effect-resource`).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:30:21.092Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for JVM-based Agents requiring efficient management of side effects and concurrency using Scala","zh":"适用于需要使用Scala高效管理副作用和并发的JVM-based Agents","ja":"Scalaを使用して副作用と並行性を効率的に管理する必要があるJVM-based Agentsに適している","ko":"Scala를 사용하여 부작용과 并行성을 효율적으로 관리하는必要가 있는 JVM 기반 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes basados en JVM que requieren un manejo eficiente de efectos laterales y concurrencia utilizando Scala","fr":"Idéal pour les agents basés sur JVM nécessitant une gestion efficace des effets secondaires et de la concurrence à l''aide de Scala","de":"Ideal für JVM-basierte Agenten, die eine effiziente Verwaltung von Nebeneffekten und Konkurrenz unter Verwendung von Scala erfordern","pt":"Ideal para agentes baseados em JVM que exigem gerenciamento eficiente de efeitos colaterais e concorrência usando Scala","ru":"Идеально для агентов на основе JVM, требующих эффективного управления побочными эффектами и параллелизмом с использованием Scala","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء المبنيين على JVM الذين يتطلبون إدارة فعالة للآثار الجانبية والتزامن باستخدام Scala"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to handle side effects with IO[A], SyncIO[A], or F[A] using Sync, Async, or Temporal type classes, while leveraging structured concurrency with parTraverse, parMapN, and Supervisor for robust resource management and error handling","zh":"Empowers agents to handle side effects with IO[A], SyncIO[A], or F[A] using Sync, Async, or Temporal type classes, while leveraging structured concurrency with parTraverse, parMapN, and Supervisor for robust resource management and error handling","ja":"Empowers agents to handle side effects with IO[A], SyncIO[A], or F[A] using Sync, Async, or Temporal type classes, while leveraging structured concurrency with parTraverse, parMapN, and Supervisor for robust resource management and error handling","ko":"Empowers agents to handle side effects with IO[A], SyncIO[A], or F[A] using Sync, Async, or Temporal type classes, while leveraging structured concurrency with parTraverse, parMapN, and Supervisor for robust resource management and error handling","es":"Habilita a los agentes a manejar efectos laterales con IO[A], SyncIO[A] o F[A] utilizando las clases de tipo Sync, Async o Temporal, mientras aprovecha la concurrencia estructurada con parTraverse, parMapN y Supervisor para un manejo robusto de recursos y control de errores","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les effets secondaires avec IO[A], SyncIO[A] ou F[A] en utilisant les classes de type Sync, Async ou Temporal, tout en exploitant la concurrence structurée avec parTraverse, parMapN et Supervisor pour une gestion robuste des ressources et de traitement des erreurs","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Nebeneffekte mit IO[A], SyncIO[A] oder F[A] unter Verwendung der Typklassen Sync, Async oder Temporal zu verwalten, während sie die strukturierte Konkurrenz mit parTraverse, parMapN und Supervisor für eine robuste Ressourcenverwaltung und Fehlerbehandlung nutzen","pt":"Habilita os agentes a lidar com efeitos colaterais com IO[A], SyncIO[A] ou F[A] usando as classes de tipo Sync, Async ou Temporal, aproveitando a concorrência estruturada com parTraverse, parMapN e Supervisor para gerenciamento robusto de recursos e tratamento de erros","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обрабатывать побочные эффекты с помощью IO[A], SyncIO[A] или F[A] с использованием классов типов Sync, Async или Temporal, используя структурированный параллелизм с parTraverse, parMapN и Supervisor для надежного управления ресурсами и обработки ошибок","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من التعامل مع الآثار الجانبية باستخدام IO[A]، SyncIO[A] أو F[A] باستخدام فئات النوع Sync، Async أو Temporal، واستخدام التزامن الهيكلي مع parTraverse، parMapN و Supervisor لإدارة موارد قوية ومعالجة الأخطاء"},"useCases":{"en":["Wrapping Java blocking calls with IO.blocking or IO.interruptible for safe execution","Managing resources with Resource to ensure proper acquisition and release","Building concurrent programs with IOApp for structured entry points"],"zh":["Wrapping Java blocking calls with IO.blocking or IO.interruptible for safe execution","Managing resources with Resource to ensure proper acquisition and release","Building concurrent programs with IOApp for structured entry points"],"ja":["Wrapping Java blocking calls with IO.blocking or IO.interruptible for safe execution","Managing resources with Resource to ensure proper acquisition and release","Building concurrent programs with IOApp for structured entry points"],"ko":["Wrapping Java blocking calls with IO.blocking or IO.interruptible for safe execution","Managing resources with Resource to ensure proper acquisition and release","Building concurrent programs with IOApp for structured entry points"],"es":["Envolver llamadas a bloqueos de Java con IO.blocking o IO.interruptible para una ejecución segura","Administrar recursos con Resource para garantizar la adquisición y liberación adecuadas","Crear programas concurrentes con IOApp para puntos de entrada estructurados"],"fr":["Envelopper les appels bloquants Java avec IO.blocking ou IO.interruptible pour une exécution sécurisée","Gérer les ressources avec Resource pour assurer l''acquisition et la libération appropriées","Créer des programmes concurrents avec IOApp pour des points d''entrée structurés"],"de":["Java-Blockieraufrufe mit IO.blocking oder IO.interruptible für eine sichere Ausführung umschließen","Ressourcen mit Resource verwalten, um eine ordnungsgemäße Beschaffung und Freigabe sicherzustellen","Erstellen von Konkurrenzprogrammen mit IOApp für strukturierte Einstiegspunkte"],"pt":["Envolver chamadas Java de bloqueio com IO.blocking ou IO.interruptible para execução segura","Gerenciar recursos com Resource para garantir aquisição e liberação adequadas","Construir programas concorrentes com IOApp para pontos de entrada estruturados"],"ru":["Обёртывание блокирующих вызовов Java с помощью IO.blocking или IO.interruptible для безопасного выполнения","Управление ресурсами с помощью Resource для обеспечения правильного получения и освобождения","Построение конкюрентных программ с помощью IOApp для структурированных точек входа"],"ar":["التغليف للمكالمات الجافا الحاصرة باستخدام IO.blocking أو IO.interruptible لتنفيذ آمن","إدارة الموارد باستخدام Resource لضمان الحصول والتحرير الصحيحين","بناء البرامج المتوازية باستخدام IOApp لنقاط الدخول الهيكلية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Scala programming language","JVM-based environment necessary","Needs understanding of functional programming concepts like Sync, Async, and Temporal"],"zh":["Requires Scala programming language","JVM-based environment necessary","Needs understanding of functional programming concepts like Sync, Async, and Temporal"],"ja":["Requires Scala programming language","JVM-based environment necessary","Needs understanding of functional programming concepts like Sync, Async, and Temporal"],"ko":["Requires Scala programming language","JVM-based environment necessary","Needs understanding of functional programming concepts like Sync, Async, and Temporal"],"es":["Requiere el lenguaje de programación Scala","Entorno basado en JVM necesario","Requiere comprensión de conceptos de programación funcional como Sync, Async y Temporal"],"fr":["Nécessite le langage de programmation Scala","Environnement basé sur JVM nécessaire","Nécessite une compréhension des concepts de programmation fonctionnelle tels que Sync, Async et Temporal"],"de":["Erfordert die Programmiersprache Scala","JVM-basierte Umgebung erforderlich","Erfordert ein Verständnis von Funktionsprogrammierkonzepten wie Sync, Async und Temporal"],"pt":["Exige linguagem de programação Scala","Ambiente baseado em JVM necessário","Exige compreensão de conceitos de programação funcional como Sync, Async e Temporal"],"ru":["Требует языка программирования Scala","Необходимо окружение на основе JVM","Требует понимания концепций функционального программирования, таких как Sync, Async и Temporal"],"ar":["يتطلب لغة برمجة Scala","بيئة مبنية على JVM ضرورية","يتطلب فهمًا لمفاهيم البرمجة الوظيفية مثل Sync، Async والزمني"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"15ec2b761ffb635bf0832379d39c0dc3eb703236060d04a2ac3ca10f07266384","qualityScore":33}');
