 of AI agent skills that solves the problem of coding agents having imperfect understanding of the Urbit runtime, Urbit terminal commands, and Urbit-native programming languages like Hoon and Nock."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能代理助手 - Nock 解释器工程师助手","ja":"AIエージェントのためのNockインタープリターエンジニアアシスタント","ko":"AI 에이전트를 위한 Nock 인터프리터 엔지니어 어시스턴트","es":"Herramientas de AI Agent: nock-interpreter-engineer-assis...","fr":"Outils d''Agents IA: nock-interpreter-engineer-assistant","de":"AI-Tools: nock-interpreter-engineer-assistant für Entwickler","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Nock Interpreter Engineer Assistant","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Nock Interpreter Engineer Assistant","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: Nock Interpreter Engineer Assistant","en":"nock-interpreter-engineer-assistant"},"description":{"zh":"Nock 解释器工程师助手是解决Urbit运行时、Urbit终端命令和Urbit本地编程语言理解问题的AI智能代理助手","ja":"Nockインタープリターエンジニアアシスタントは、Urbitランタイム、Urbitターミナルコマンド、Urbitネイティブプログラミング言語の理解問題を解決するAIエージェントのためのツールです","ko":"Nock 인터프리터 엔지니어 어시스턴트는 Urbit 런타임, Urbit 터미널 명령어, Urbit 네이티브 프로그래밍 언어 이해 문제를 해결하는 AI 에이전트를 위한 도구입니다","es":"El nock-interpreter-engineer-assistant es un repositorio en crecimiento de habilidades de AI Agent que resuelve problemas de comprensión de la runtime de Urb...","fr":"Le nock-interpreter-engineer-assistant est un référentiel en croissance de compétences d''Agents IA qui résout les problèmes de compréhension de la runtime d''...","de":"Der nock-interpreter-engineer-assistant ist ein wachsendes Repository für AI-Tools, das Probleme der Runtime von Urbit und native Programmiersprachen löst.","pt":"O Nock Interpreter Engineer Assistant é uma solução de IA que melhora a compreensão do Urbit, incluindo comandos de terminal e linguagens de programação nati...","ru":"Nock Interpreter Engineer Assistant - это решение ИИ, которое улучшает понимание Urbit, включая команды терминала и родные языки программирования, такие как ...","ar":"Nock Interpreter Engineer Assistant هو حل ذكاء اصطناعي لتحسين فهم Urbit، بما في ذلك أوامر الطرفية ولغات ا