nance. "},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能库管理员 - Librarian Vault Manager","ja":"AIエージェントを活用した知識管理システム - Librarian Vault Manager","ko":"AI 라이브러리 관리자 - Librarian Vault Manager","es":"Gestor de Vault de Bibliotecario: Herramientas de Agentes...","fr":"Gestionnaire de Vault de Bibliothécaire: Outils d''Agents IA","de":"Bibliothekar-Vault-Manager: KI-Agenten-Tools","pt":"Gerenciador de Biblioteca com Ferramentas de IA","ru":"Менеджер Хранилища с ИИ Агентами","ar":"مدير مخزن المكتبة مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","en":"librarian-vault-manager"},"description":{"zh":"Librarian Vault Manager是一个基于AI的知识管理系统，能够管理多个Obsidian库，结合Johnny Decimal和Zettelkasten方法，实现知识的高效管理","ja":"Librarian Vault Managerは、AIエージェントを活用した知識管理システムで、複数のObsidianバULTを管理し、Johnny DecimalとZettelkastenを組み合わせた構造的な知識管理を実現","ko":"Librarian Vault Manager는 AI 라이브러리 관리자를 사용하여 여러 개의 Obsidian 라이브러리를 관리하고, Johnny Decimal과 Zettelkasten 방법을 결합하여 지식의 효율적인 관리를 실현","es":"El proyecto librarian-vault-manager es un sistema de conocimiento compuesto que administra múltiples vaults de Obsidian","fr":"Le projet librarian-vault-manager est un système de connaissances composé qui gère plusieurs vaults d''Obsidian","de":"Das Projekt librarian-vault-manager ist ein komponiertes Wissenssystem, das mehrere Obsidian-Vaults verwaltet","pt":"O gerenciador de biblioteca é um sistema de conhecimento composto que gerencia múltiplos vaults Obsidian com organização estrutural e significado emergente","ru":"Менеджер хранилища является составной системой знаний, которая управляет несколькими vaults Obsidian с структурированной организацией и эмерджентным значением","ar":"مدير مخزن المكتبة هو نظام معرفي مركب يدير مخازن Obsidian المتعددة مع تنظيم هيكلي وmeaning متجدر","en":"This project is a compounding knowledge system (\"Second Brain\") that manages multiple Obsidian vaults, combining Johnny Decimal for structural organization w..."},"definition":{"en":"This project is a compounding knowledge system (\"Second Brain\") that manages multiple Obsidian vaults, combining Johnny Decimal for structural organization with Zettelkasten for emergent meaning, augmented by AI librarian agents for maintenance. "},"features":{"zh":["管理多个Obsidian库","结合Johnny Decimal和Zettelkasten方法","AI智能库管理员","高效知识管理","支持多种数据格式"],"ja":["複数のObsidianバULTを管理","Johnny DecimalとZettelkastenを組み合わせた構造的な知識管理","AIエージェントを活用した知識管理","効率的な知識管理","多種のデータ形式をサポート"],"ko":["여러 개의 Obsidian 라이브러리를 관리","Johnny Decimal과 Zettelkasten 방법을 결합","AI 라이브러리 관리자","지식의 효율적인 관리","다양한 데이터 형식을 지원"],"es":["Integración de Johnny Decimal para la organización estructural","Uso de Zettelkasten para la creación de significado emergente","Agentes de IA para el mantenimiento del sistema","Compatibilidad con múltiples vaults de Obsidian","Mejora de la productividad y la organización del conocimiento"],"fr":["Intégration de Johnny Decimal pour l''organisation structurale","Utilisation de Zettelkasten pour la création de sens émergent","Agents IA pour la maintenance du système","Compatibilité avec plusieurs vaults d''Obsidian","Amélioration de la productivité et de l''organisation des connaissances"],"de":["Integration von Johnny Decimal für die strukturelle Organisation","Verwendung von Zettelkasten für die Schaffung von emergentem Sinn","KI-Agenten für die Wartung des Systems","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Obsidian-Vaults","Verbesserung der Produktivität und der Wissensorganisation"],"pt":["Organização estrutural com Johnny Decimal","Significado emergente com Zettelkasten","Manutenção com agentes de IA","Gerenciamento de múltiplos vaults Obsidian","Integração com ferramentas de IA"],"ru":["Структурированная организация с Johnny Decimal","Эмерджентное значение с Zettelkasten","Техническое обслуживание с ИИ Агентами","Управление несколькими vaults Obsidian","Интеграция с инструментами ИИ"],"ar":["التنظيم الهيكلي مع Johnny Decimal","المعني المتجدر مع Zettelkasten","الصيانة مع وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي","إدارة مخازن Obsidian المتعددة","التكامل مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能库管理员","知识管理系统"," Obsidian库管理","Johnny Decimal","Zettelkasten","如何使用Librarian Vault Manager","Librarian Vault Manager替代品","Librarian Vault Manager安装指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","知識管理システム","ObsidianバULT管理","Johnny Decimal","Zettelkasten","Librarian Vault Managerの使い方","Librarian Vault Managerの代替","Librarian Vault Managerのセットアップガイド"],"ko":["AI 라이브러리 관리자","지식 관리 시스템","Obsidian 라이브러리 관리","Johnny Decimal","Zettelkasten","Librarian Vault Manager 사용법","Librarian Vault Manager 대체","Librarian Vault Manager 설치 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar herramientas de agentes de IA","qué es un sistema de conocimiento compuesto","alternativas a Obsidian","Obsidian vs otros gestores de conocimiento","instalación de agentes de IA","guía de configuración de librarian-vault-manager"],"fr":["comment utiliser des outils d''agents IA","qu''est-ce qu''un système de connaissances composé","alternatives à Obsidian","Obsidian vs autres gestionnaires de connaissances","installation d''agents IA","guide de configuration de librarian-vault-manager"],"de":["wie man KI-Agenten-Tools verwendet","was ist ein komponiertes Wissenssystem","Alternativen zu Obsidian","Obsidian vs andere Wissensmanager","Installation von KI-Agenten","Konfigurationsanleitung für librarian-vault-manager"],"pt":["como usar ferramentas de IA","o que é gerenciador de biblioteca","alternativas ao gerenciador de biblioteca","gerenciador de biblioteca vs outros","instalar gerenciador de biblioteca","guia de configuração do gerenciador de biblioteca","ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores"],"ru":["как использовать инструменты ИИ","что такое менеджер хранилища","альтернативы менеджеру хранилища","менеджер хранилища vs другие","установить менеджер хранилища","руководство по настройке менеджера хранилища","инструменты ИИ для разработчиков"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو مدير مخزن المكتبة","بديلات مدير مخزن المكتبة","مدير مخزن المكتبة مقابل الأخرى","تثبيت مدير مخزن المكتبة","دليل إعداد مدير مخزن المكتبة","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين"]}},"owner":"jabez007","repo":"johnny-decimal-zettelkasten","repoPath":"jabez007/johnny-decimal-zettelkasten","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.898Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"librarian-vault-manager","description":"Knowledge steward for Johnny Decimal/Zettelkasten Obsidian vaults. Use when managing vault structure, auditing links, cleaning up notes, constructing new vault sections, reviewing daily notes, or generating flashcards. Responds to keywords like organize my vault, check my index, review daily notes, audit links, cleanup notes, create new vault section, generate flashcards, Johnny Decimal, Zettelkasten.","bodyPreview":"# **Librarian Vault Manager**\n\n## **Overview**\n\nThis skill enables Gemini CLI to act as a knowledge steward for Obsidian vaults structured using the Johnny Decimal and Zettelkasten methodologies. It helps maintain the vault''s structural integrity and discoverability by guiding the user through various maintenance and knowledge development tasks.\n\n## **Core Mandates**\n\nThe Librarian always prioritizes the preservation of knowledge and the structural integrity of the vault. Gemini CLI, when acting","body":"# **Librarian Vault Manager**\n\n## **Overview**\n\nThis skill enables Gemini CLI to act as a knowledge steward for Obsidian vaults structured using the Johnny Decimal and Zettelkasten methodologies. It helps maintain the vault''s structural integrity and discoverability by guiding the user through various maintenance and knowledge development tasks.\n\n## **Core Mandates**\n\nThe Librarian always prioritizes the preservation of knowledge and the structural integrity of the vault. Gemini CLI, when acting as the Librarian, must adhere strictly to the following:\n\n* **Read-Only Analysis and Proposals:** Gemini CLI **MUST NEVER** create, modify, or delete files directly without a preceding proposal phase. All actions must be presented as concrete, specific proposals for user confirmation.  \n* **Explicit User Approval:** Always await explicit user approval before executing any file operations.  \n* **Respect ACID Notation:** All proposals concerning note identifiers, titles, and locations must strictly follow the `SYS.AC.ID` format (Area, Category, ID).  \n* **Adherence to Vault Guidelines:** Consult and follow the guidelines in `references/copilot-instructions.md` for identity format, atomicity, titles, links, and hierarchy.  \n* **Maintain JDex Integrity:**  \n  * The `00.00.md` root index must exist and link to the root base file.  \n  * Every system must have a `SYS.00.00.md` index linking back to root.  \n  * `_SYS/` folder stores all configuration (`.base`) files.\n\n## **Multi-Vault Architecture**\n\nThis project contains multiple Obsidian vaults in the `vaults/` directory.\n\n### **Vault Selection**\n\n* When a user request lacks explicit vault context, ask: \"Which vault should I work with?\"  \n* Accepted vault identifiers: `[vault-name]` from `vaults/[vault-name]/`  \n* Always confirm vault scope before proposing structural changes\n\n### **Path Resolution**\n\n* All `SYS.AC.ID` references and file paths are **vault-relative**  \n* Translate user intent into paths like: `vaults/[vault-name]/SYS/A0-Area/...`  \n* Never propose paths outside the selected vault''s boundaries\n\n### **Reference Document Lookup**\n\n* All workflow and reference documents are located at the project root: `.gemini/skills/librarian-vault-manager/references/`  \n* This includes vault guidelines (`copilot-instructions.md`), workflows (`audit-links.md`, `cleanup.md`, etc.), and methodologies.\n\n## **Multi-Vault Guardrails**\n\n* **Do not** modify notes in multiple vaults without explicit per-vault confirmation  \n* **Do not** create cross-vault links without user acknowledgment  \n* **Do not** propose structural changes that assume a single JDex  \n* **Always** confirm vault scope before proposing file operations\n\n## **Using the Librarian Skill**\n\nThis skill is designed to guide you through various vault management tasks. Based on the user''s request, you should identify the most relevant workflow.\n\n### **Workflow Selection**\n\nWhen a user''s request matches one of the following, read the corresponding workflow document for detailed instructions:\n\n* **Auditing Links / Strengthening Knowledge Graph**: If the user asks to \"audit links\", \"check for orphaned notes\", \"strengthen connections\", or similar, read `references/workflows/audit-links.md`.  \n* **Cleaning Up / Maintaining Hygiene**: If the user asks to \"clean up vault\", \"detect duplicates\", \"flag naming issues\", \"relocate notes\", or similar, read `references/workflows/cleanup.md`.  \n* **Constructing New Vault Sections**: If the user asks to \"scaffold a new vault\", \"create a new system/area/category\", or \"construct vault structure\", read `references/workflows/construct-vault.md`.  \n* **Daily Review / Extracting Durable Knowledge**: If the user asks to \"review daily notes\", \"extract concepts from daily notes\", or \"identify recurring themes\", read `references/workflows/daily-review.md`.  \n* **Generating Flashcards**: If the user asks to \"generate flashcards\" for a note, read `references/workflows/flashcards.md`.\n\n### **General Reference**\n\nFor general understanding of the vault''s underlying methodologies and specific rules, consult the following documents as needed:\n\n* **Johnny Decimal System**: `references/johnny-decimal.md`  \n* **Zettelkasten Method**: `references/zettelkasten.md`  \n* **Vault Philosophy**: `references/philosophy.md`  \n* **Copilot Instructions (Vault Guidelines)**: `references/copilot-instructions.md`\n\n## **Available Tools**\n\nThe primary tools for this skill are `read_file`, `list_directory`, `search_file_content` for analysis, and `write_file` (or `replace`) to execute changes after user confirmation.\n\n## **Example Scenario**\n\n**User Request:** \"Create a new vault for my Personal Finance.\"  \n**Gemini CLI Action:**\n\n1. Recognize \"Create a new vault\" intent.  \n2. `read_file` `references/workflows/construct-vault.md`.  \n3. Analyze the prompt to discover the system (\"FIN\" or \"MONEY\").  \n4. Follow the discovery workflow to define Areas (Banking, Taxes) and Categories.  \n5. Propose the full structure including `00.00.md` and `_SYS/`.  \n6. Upon \"Approve\", use `write_file` to generate the folders, indexes, and `.base` files.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:56:36.699Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Knowledge Management Agents seeking to organize and maintain complex information systems using Johnny Decimal and Zettelkasten methodologies.","zh":"适合于知识管理代理寻求使用Johnny Decimal和Zettelkasten方法论组织和维护复杂信息系统。","ja":"Johnny DecimalとZettelkastenの方法論を使用して複雑な情報システムを整理して維持しようとするナレッジマネジメントエージェントに最適。","ko":"Johnny Decimal과 Zettelkasten 방법론을 사용하여 복잡한 정보 시스템을 구성하고 유지하려는 지식 관리 에이전트에게 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de Gestión del Conocimiento que buscan organizar y mantener sistemas de información complejos utilizando las metodologías Johnny Decimal y Zettelkasten.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de gestion des connaissances cherchant à organiser et à maintenir des systèmes d''information complexes en utilisant les méthodologies Johnny Decimal et Zettelkasten.","de":"Ideal für Wissensmanagement-Agenten, die komplexe Informationssysteme mithilfe der Johnny Decimal- und Zettelkasten-Methoden organisieren und warten möchten.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Conhecimento que buscam organizar e manter sistemas de informação complexos usando metodologias Johnny Decimal e Zettelkasten.","ru":"Идеально для агентов управления знаниями, стремящихся организовать и поддерживать сложные информационные системы, используя методологии Johnny Decimal и Zettelkasten.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء لإدارة المعرفة الذين يسعون إلى تنظيم ونظام المعلومات المعقدة باستخدام منهجيات Johnny Decimal و Zettelkasten."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage multiple Obsidian vaults, ensuring structural integrity and discoverability through AI-augmented maintenance tasks, utilizing Gemini CLI for guided knowledge development and preservation of knowledge.","zh":"赋予代理管理多个Obsidian保险库的能力，通过AI增强的维护任务确保结构完整性和可发现性，并利用Gemini CLI进行指导性的知识开发和保存。","ja":"エージェントが複数のObsidianボールトを管理できるようにし、Gemini CLIを使用したガイド付きのナレッジ開発とナレッジの保存を通じて、構造的完全性と発見可能性を確保する。","ko":"에이전트가 여러 Obsidian 보관소를 관리할 수 있도록 하여 Gemini CLI를 사용한 유지 보수 작업을 통해 구조적 완전성과 발견 가능성을 보장합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes gestionar múltiples vaults de Obsidian, garantizando la integridad estructural y la capacidad de descubrimiento a través de tareas de mantenimiento mejoradas con inteligencia artificial, utilizando Gemini CLI para el desarrollo y la preservación guiados del conocimiento.","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer plusieurs vaults Obsidian, en garantissant l''intégrité structurelle et la découverte grâce à des tâches de maintenance améliorées par l''intelligence artificielle, en utilisant Gemini CLI pour le développement et la préservation guidés des connaissances.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, mehrere Obsidian-Vaults zu verwalten und so die strukturelle Integrität und die Auffindbarkeit durch künstlich intelligente Wartungsaufgaben sicherzustellen, die Gemini CLI für die gesteuerte Wissensentwicklung und -erhaltung nutzen.","pt":"Habilita agentes a gerenciar várias vaults do Obsidian, garantindo a integridade estrutural e a descoberta por meio de tarefas de manutenção aumentadas por IA, utilizando o Gemini CLI para o desenvolvimento e preservação guiados do conhecimento.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять несколькими хранилищами Obsidian, обеспечивая структуру целостности и обнаружения посредством задач обслуживания, усиленных ИИ, используя Gemini CLI для руководства развитием и сохранением знаний.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إدارة Several Obsidian vaults، مما يضمن السلامة الهيكلية والاكتشاف من خلال مهام الصيانة المعززة بالذكاء الاصطناعي، باستخدام Gemini CLI لتطوير المعرفة والحفاظ عليها بتقديم إرشادات."},"useCases":{"en":["Maintaining Obsidian vaults with Johnny Decimal for structural organization","Augmenting knowledge systems with Zettelkasten for emergent meaning","Guiding users through maintenance and knowledge development tasks using Gemini CLI"],"zh":["使用Johnny Decimal对Obsidian保险库进行结构组织","使用Zettelkasten增强知识系统以实现新兴意义","使用Gemini CLI指导用户完成维护和知识开发任务"],"ja":["Johnny Decimalを使用してObsidianボールトの構造を整理する","Zettelkastenを使用してナレッジシステムを強化して新しい意味を生み出す","Gemini CLIを使用してユーザーをガイド付きの維持とナレッジ開発タスクに導く"],"ko":["Johnny Decimal을 사용하여 Obsidian 보관소의 구조적 구성","Zettelkasten을 사용하여 지식 시스템을 강화하여 새로운 의미를 생성하는 것","Gemini CLI를 사용하여 사용자를 유지 보수 및 지식 개발 작업으로 안내하는 것"],"es":["Mantener vaults de Obsidian con Johnny Decimal para la organización estructural","Ampliar sistemas de conocimiento con Zettelkasten para el significado emergente","Guiar a los usuarios a través de tareas de mantenimiento y desarrollo del conocimiento con Gemini CLI"],"fr":["Maintenir des vaults Obsidian avec Johnny Decimal pour l''organisation structurelle","Améliorer les systèmes de connaissances avec Zettelkasten pour le sens émergent","Guider les utilisateurs à travers les tâches de maintenance et de développement des connaissances avec Gemini CLI"],"de":["Obsidian-Vaults mit Johnny Decimal für strukturelle Organisation warten","Wissenssysteme mit Zettelkasten für emergentes Verständnis erweitern","Benutzer durch Wartungs- und Wissensentwicklungsaufgaben mit Gemini CLI führen"],"pt":["Manter vaults do Obsidian com Johnny Decimal para organização estrutural","Aumentar sistemas de conhecimento com Zettelkasten para significado emergente","Orientar usuários por meio de tarefas de manutenção e desenvolvimento de conhecimento usando Gemini CLI"],"ru":["Поддерживать хранилища Obsidian с Johnny Decimal для структуризации","Усиливать системы знаний с Zettelkasten для появления смысла","Направлять пользователей через задачи обслуживания и развития знаний, используя Gemini CLI"],"ar":["صيانة مستودعات Obsidian مع Johnny Decimal من أجل التنظيم الهيكلي","تعزيز أنظمة المعرفة مع Zettelkasten من أجل المعنى الناشئ","توجيه المستخدمين من خلال مهام الصيانة وتطوير المعرفة باستخدام Gemini CLI"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Gemini CLI compatibility","Limited to Obsidian vaults","Dependent on AI librarian agents for maintenance"],"zh":["需要Gemini CLI兼容性","仅限于Obsidian保险库","依赖于AI图书馆代理进行维护"],"ja":["Gemini CLIの互換性が必要","Obsidianボールトのみ","メンテナンスのためにAIライブラリエージェントに依存"],"ko":["Gemini CLI 호환성이 필요함","Obsidian 보관소에만 제한됨","유지 보수를 위해 AI 도서관 에이전트에 의존"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con Gemini CLI","Limitado a vaults de Obsidian","Dependiente de agentes bibliotecarios de inteligencia artificial para el mantenimiento"],"fr":["Nécessite la compatibilité avec Gemini CLI","Limité aux vaults Obsidian","Dépendant des agents bibliothécaires d''intelligence artificielle pour la maintenance"],"de":["Benötigt Gemini-CLI-Kompatibilität","Begrenzt auf Obsidian-Vaults","Von künstlich intelligenten Bibliotheksagenten für die Wartung abhängig"],"pt":["Requer compatibilidade com Gemini CLI","Limitado a vaults do Obsidian","Dependente de agentes bibliotecários de IA para manutenção"],"ru":["Требует совместимости с Gemini CLI","Ограничен хранилищами Obsidian","Зависит от агентов-библиотекарей ИИ для обслуживания"],"ar":["يتطلب توافقًا مع Gemini CLI","محدود بمستودعات Obsidian","يعتمد على وكلاء المكتبات الاصطناعية للصيانة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"b41e724937c3db5f59ef84cdff6ef037248e705efdb40fd3b28555baf7cbf884","qualityScore":32}');
