INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('jabez007/johnny-decimal-zettelkasten/librarian-vault-manager', 'librarian-vault-manager', 'jabez007', 'johnny-decimal-zettelkasten', 'community', 'librarian-vault-manager jabez007 johnny-decimal-zettelkasten community Librarian Vault Manager是一个基于AI的知识管理系统，能够管理多个Obsidian库，结合Johnny Decimal和Zettelkasten方法，实现知识的高效管理 Librarian Vault Managerは、AIエージェントを活用した知識管理システムで、複数のObsidianバULTを管理し、Johnny DecimalとZettelkastenを組み合わせた構造的な知識管理を実現 Librarian Vault Manager는 AI 라이브러리 관리자를 사용하여 여러 개의 Obsidian 라이브러리를 관리하고, Johnny Decimal과 Zettelkasten 방법을 결합하여 지식의 효율적인 관리를 실현 El proyecto librarian-vault-manager es un sistema de conocimiento compuesto que administra múltiples vaults de Obsidian Le projet librarian-vault-manager est un système de connaissances composé qui gère plusieurs vaults d''Obsidian Das Projekt librarian-vault-manager ist ein komponiertes Wissenssystem, das mehrere Obsidian-Vaults verwaltet O gerenciador de biblioteca é um sistema de conhecimento composto que gerencia múltiplos vaults Obsidian com organização estrutural e significado emergente Менеджер хранилища является составной системой знаний, которая управляет несколькими vaults Obsidian с структурированной организацией и эмерджентным значением مدير مخزن المكتبة هو نظام معرفي مركب يدير مخازن Obsidian المتعددة مع تنظيم هيكلي وmeaning متجدر This project is a compounding knowledge system ("Second Brain") that manages multiple Obsidian vaults, combining Johnny Decimal for structural organization with Zettelkasten for emergent meaning, augmented by AI librarian agents for maintenance. AI智能库管理员 知识管理系统 Obsidian库管理 Johnny Decimal Zettelkasten 如何使用Librarian Vault Manager Librarian Vault Manager替代品 Librarian Vault Manager安装指南 This project is a compounding knowledge system ("Second Brain") that manages multiple Obsidian vaults, combining Johnny Decimal for structural organization with Zettelkasten for emergent meaning, augmented by AI librarian agents for maintenance. ');
