de dados com pandas","Classificação de resultados com Claude","Integração com ferramentas de IA","Suporte a grandes conjuntos de dados","Pesquisa personalizada com LLM Agents"],"ru":["Продвинутый семантический анализ","Фильтрация данных с pandas","Ранжирование результатов с Claude","Интеграция с инструментами ИИ","Поддержка больших наборов данных","Персонализированный поиск с LLM Agents"],"ar":["التحليل الدلالي المتقدم","تصفية البيانات مع pandas","ترتيب النتائج مع Claude","التكامل مع أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","دعم مجموعات البيانات الكبيرة","بحث مخصص مع LLM Agents"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用MCP","什么是AI智能工具","MCP替代品","MCP安装","MCP设置指南","AI研究工具","AI工具下载","MCP教程"],"ja":["MCPの使い方","AIエージェントとは","MCPの代替","MCPのインストール","MCPの設定ガイド","AI研究ツール","AIツールのダウンロード","MCPのチュートリアル"],"ko":["MCP 사용법","AI 에이전트란","MCP 대안","MCP 설치","MCP 설정 가이드","AI 연구 도구","AI 도구 다운로드","MCP 튜토리얼"],"es":["cómo usar deploy-mcp","qué es deploy-mcp","herramientas de AI para análisis de datos","alternativas a deploy-mcp","deploy-mcp vs Claude","instalación de deploy-mcp","guía de configuración de deploy-mcp"],"fr":["comment utiliser deploy-mcp","qu''est-ce que deploy-mcp","outils IA pour l''analyse de données","alternatives à deploy-mcp","deploy-mcp vs Claude","installation de deploy-mcp","guide de configuration de deploy-mcp"],"de":["wie man deploy-mcp verwendet","was ist deploy-mcp","KI-Tools für Datenanalyse","Alternativen zu deploy-mcp","deploy-mcp vs Claude","Installation von deploy-mcp","Konfigurationsanleitung für deploy-mcp"],"pt":["como usar Deploy MCP","o que é Deploy MCP","ferramentas de IA para pesquisa","alternativas para Claude","Deploy MCP vs outras ferramentas","instalar Deploy MCP","guia de configuração do Deploy MCP","pesquisa avançada com LLM Agents","análise semântica com pandas"],"ru":["как использовать Deploy MCP","что такое Deploy MCP","инструменты ИИ для исследования","альтернативы Claude","Deploy MCP vs другие инструменты","установить Deploy MCP","руководство по настройке Deploy MCP","продвинутый поиск с LLM Agents","семантический анализ с pandas"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Deploy MCP","ما هو Deploy MCP","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للبحث","بديلات Claude","Deploy MCP مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت Deploy MCP","دليل إعداد Deploy MCP","بحث متقدم مع LLM Agents","التحليل الدلالي مع pandas"]}},"owner":"futuresearch","repo":"everyrow-sdk","repoPath":"futuresearch/everyrow-sdk","stars":17,"forks":2,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T12:01:38Z","topics":["claude","claude-code","filtering","llm-agents","pandas-dataframe","ranking","semantic-analysis"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"deploy-mcp","description":"Deploy the everyrow MCP server to staging or production on GKE. Use when the user wants to deploy, redeploy, roll back, scale replicas, or check deployment status. Triggers on deploy, redeploy, staging, production, rollout, scale, replicas.","bodyPreview":"# Deploying the MCP Server\n\n## Quick Deploy\n\n### Staging (from main)\n\n```bash\ngh workflow run \"Deploy MCP Server\" -f branch=main -f deploy_staging=true\n```\n\n### Production (from main)\n\n```bash\ngh workflow run \"Deploy MCP Server\" -f branch=main -f deploy_production=true\n```\n\n### Both environments\n\n```bash\ngh workflow run \"Deploy MCP Server\" -f branch=main -f deploy_staging=true -f deploy_production=true\n```\n\n### From a feature branch\n\n```bash\ngh workflow run \"Deploy MCP Server\" -f branch=feat/my-","body":"# Deploying the MCP Server\n\n## Quick Deploy\n\n### Staging (from main)\n\n```bash\ngh workflow run \"Deploy MCP Server\" -f branch=main -f deploy_staging=true\n```\n\n### Production (from main)\n\n```bash\ngh workflow run \"Deploy MCP Server\" -f branch=main -f deploy_production=true\n```\n\n### Both environments\n\n```bash\ngh workflow run \"Deploy MCP Server\" -f branch=main -f deploy_staging=true -f deploy_production=true\n```\n\n### From a feature branch\n\n```bash\ngh workflow run \"Deploy MCP Server\" -f branch=feat/my-branch -f deploy_staging=true\n```\n\n## Monitoring a Deploy\n\n```bash\n# Watch the workflow run\ngh run list --workflow=\"Deploy MCP Server\" --limit 3\ngh run watch <run-id>\n\n# Check pod rollout\nkubectl rollout status deploy/everyrow-mcp-staging -n everyrow-mcp-staging --timeout=5m\n\n# Verify pods are running\nkubectl get pods -n everyrow-mcp-staging -o wide\n```\n\n## How It Works\n\nThe GitHub Actions workflow (`.github/workflows/deploy-mcp.yaml`) does:\n\n1. **Checks** — ruff lint + pytest on the target branch\n2. **Build & push** — Docker image to GAR, tagged with short SHA (+ `latest` on main)\n3. **Deploy** — Helm upgrade with layered values:\n   - `values.yaml` — base config\n   - `values.staging.yaml` — staging overrides (MCP_SERVER_URL, REDIS_DB, replicaCount, host)\n   - `values.secrets.staging.yaml` — SOPS-decrypted secrets (Supabase, API keys)\n\nThe deploy uses `--atomic` so it auto-rolls back on failure.\n\n## Scaling Replicas\n\n### Via Helm values (persistent)\n\nEdit `everyrow-mcp/deploy/chart/values.staging.yaml`:\n```yaml\nreplicaCount: 2  # Change this\n```\nCommit, push, and redeploy.\n\n### Via kubectl (temporary, resets on next deploy)\n\n```bash\n# Staging\nkubectl scale deploy everyrow-mcp-staging -n everyrow-mcp-staging --replicas=3\n\n# Take offline\nkubectl scale deploy everyrow-mcp-staging -n everyrow-mcp-staging --replicas=0\n```\n\n## Environments\n\n| Environment | Namespace | Host | Redis DB |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Staging | `everyrow-mcp-staging` | `mcp-staging.everyrow.io` | 14 |\n| Production | `everyrow-mcp` | `mcp.everyrow.io` | (default in values.yaml) |\n\nBoth environments hit the **same production EveryRow API** — there is no staging API.\n\n## Updating Secrets\n\n```bash\n# View current secrets\nsops -d everyrow-mcp/deploy/chart/secrets.staging.enc.yaml\n\n# Update a value\nsops --set ''[\"secrets\"][\"data\"][\"KEY_NAME\"] \"new-value\"'' everyrow-mcp/deploy/chart/secrets.staging.enc.yaml\n```\n\nCommit the encrypted file and redeploy.\n\n## Key Files\n\n| File | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| `.github/workflows/deploy-mcp.yaml` | CI/CD workflow (checks → build → deploy) |\n| `everyrow-mcp/deploy/chart/values.yaml` | Base Helm values |\n| `everyrow-mcp/deploy/chart/values.staging.yaml` | Staging overrides |\n| `everyrow-mcp/deploy/chart/secrets.enc.yaml` | Production secrets (SOPS) |\n| `everyrow-mcp/deploy/chart/secrets.staging.enc.yaml` | Staging secrets (SOPS) |\n| `everyrow-mcp/deploy/Dockerfile` | Server container image |\n\n## Gotchas\n\n- **Branch protection on main**: Can''t push directly — create a PR and merge first, then deploy from main.\n- **SOPS decryption requires GCP IAM**: Run `gcloud auth application-default login` if decryption fails.\n- **Concurrent deploys**: Workflow uses `cancel-in-progress: false` — if a deploy is running, the next one queues.\n- **Atomic rollback**: `--atomic` means a failed deploy auto-reverts to the previous release. Check `helm history` if this happens.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T13:17:14.914Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for DevOps Agents needing streamlined MCP server deployment capabilities via GitHub workflows.","zh":"非常适合需要通过 GitHub 工作流简化 MCP 服务器部署能力的 DevOps Agent。","ja":"GitHub ワークフローを介した MCP サーバーのデプロイ能力をストリームライン化する必要がある DevOps エージェントに最適です。","ko":"GitHub 워크플로우를 통해 MCP 서버 배포 기능을 간소화해야 하는 DevOps 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de DevOps que necesitan capacidades de implementación de servidor MCP simplificadas a través de flujos de trabajo de GitHub.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents DevOps qui ont besoin de capacités de déploiement de serveur MCP rationalisées via des flux de travail GitHub.","de":"Perfekt für DevOps-Agents, die eine vereinfachte MCP-Server-Bereitstellung über GitHub-Workflows benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agents DevOps que precisam de capacidades de implantação de servidor MCP simplificadas via fluxos de trabalho do GitHub.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов DevOps, которым необходимы упрощенные возможности развертывания сервера MCP через рабочие процессы GitHub.","ar":"مثالي لعميل DevOps الذين يحتاجون إلى możliات نشر خادم MCP مبسطة عبر سلاسل العمل في GitHub."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate MCP server deployment to staging and production environments using gh workflow commands, supporting simultaneous deployments and feature branch testing with protocols like GitHub Actions.","zh":"赋予代理人使用 gh 工作流命令自动化 MCP 服务器部署到预发和生产环境的能力，支持同时部署和使用 GitHub Actions 等协议进行功能分支测试。","ja":"エージェントは、GitHub Actions などのプロトコルを使用して機能ブランチのテストをサポートし、同時にデプロイを行うことができる gh ワークフロー コマンドを使用して、MCP サーバーのデプロイをステージング環境とプロダクション環境に自動化する機能を提供します。","ko":"에이전트는 GitHub Actions와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 기능 브랜치 테스트를 지원하며 동시에 배포를 수행할 수 있는 gh 워크플로 명령을 사용하여 MCP 서버 배포를 스테이징 환경과 프로덕션 환경에 자동화하는 기능을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la implementación de servidores MCP en entornos de ensayo y producción utilizando comandos de flujo de trabajo de gh, lo que admite implementaciones simultáneas y pruebas de ramas de características con protocolos como GitHub Actions.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser le déploiement de serveurs MCP vers des environnements de préproduction et de production en utilisant des commandes de workflow gh, ce qui prend en charge les déploiements simultanés et les tests de branches de fonctionnalités avec des protocoles comme GitHub Actions.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, die Bereitstellung von MCP-Servern in Staging- und Produktionsumgebungen zu automatisieren, indem sie gh-Workflow-Befehle verwenden, was simultane Bereitstellungen und Funktionszweigtests mit Protokollen wie GitHub Actions unterstützt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar a implantação do servidor MCP para ambientes de pré-produção e produção usando comandos de fluxo de trabalho do gh, com suporte a implantações simultâneas e teste de branch de recursos com protocolos como GitHub Actions.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность автоматизировать развертывание сервера MCP в среды подготовки и производства с помощью команд рабочего процесса gh, поддерживая одновременные развертывания и тестирование веток функций с протоколами, такими как GitHub Actions.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية تلقائية لنشر خادم MCP إلى بيئات ما قبل الإنتاج والانتاج باستخدام أوامر سلاسل العمل في gh، مع دعم لنشرات متزامنة واختبار فروع الميزات بروتوكولات مثل GitHub Actions."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating MCP server deployments to staging environments","Deploying MCP servers to production from main branches","Testing MCP server deployments from feature branches"],"zh":["自动化 MCP 服务器部署到预发环境","从主分支部署 MCP 服务器到生产环境","从功能分支测试 MCP 服务器部署"],"ja":["ステージング環境への MCP サーバーのデプロイを自動化する","メインブランチからプロダクション環境への MCP サーバーのデプロイ","機能ブランチからの MCP サーバーのデプロイテスト"],"ko":["스테이징 환경으로의 MCP 서버 배포 자동화","메인 브랜치에서 프로덕션 환경으로의 MCP 서버 배포","기능 브랜치로부터의 MCP 서버 배포 테스트"],"es":["Automatizar la implementación de servidores MCP en entornos de ensayo","Implementar servidores MCP en producción desde ramas principales","Probar la implementación de servidores MCP desde ramas de características"],"fr":["Automatiser le déploiement de serveurs MCP vers des environnements de préproduction","Déployer des serveurs MCP en production à partir de branches principales","Tester le déploiement de serveurs MCP à partir de branches de fonctionnalités"],"de":["Automatisieren der Bereitstellung von MCP-Servern in Staging-Umgebungen","Bereitstellen von MCP-Servern in der Produktion aus Hauptzweigen","Testen der Bereitstellung von MCP-Servern aus Funktionszweigen"],"pt":["Automatizar implantações de servidor MCP para ambientes de pré-produção","Implantar servidores MCP para produção a partir de branches principais","Testar implantações de servidor MCP a partir de branches de recursos"],"ru":["Автоматизировать развертывание сервера MCP в среды подготовки","Развертывать серверы MCP в производство из основных веток","Тестировать развертывание сервера MCP из веток функций"],"ar":["تأشير نشر خادم MCP إلى بيئات ما قبل الإنتاج","نشر خوادم MCP إلى الإنتاج من الفروع الرئيسية","اختبار نشر خادم MCP من فروع الميزات"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub workflow configuration","Limited to MCP server deployments","Needs gh command-line tool installed"],"zh":["需要 GitHub 工作流配置","仅限于 MCP 服务器部署","需要安装 gh 命令行工具"],"ja":["GitHub ワークフローの構成が必要","MCP サーバーのデプロイのみ","gh コマンドライン ツールのインストールが必要"],"ko":["GitHub 워크플로우 구성이 필요","MCP 서버 배포만 해당","gh 명령줄 도구 설치가 필요"],"es":["Requiere configuración de flujo de trabajo de GitHub","Limitado a la implementación de servidores MCP","Necesita la herramienta de línea de comandos gh instalada"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration de workflow GitHub","Limité au déploiement de serveurs MCP","Nécessite l''outil de ligne de commande gh installé"],"de":["Benötigt GitHub-Workflow-Konfiguration","Begrenzt auf die Bereitstellung von MCP-Servern","Benötigt das gh-Befehlszeilen-Tool, das installiert ist"],"pt":["Requer configuração de fluxo de trabalho do GitHub","Limitado às implantações de servidor MCP","Necessita da ferramenta de linha de comando gh instalada"],"ru":["Требует настройки рабочего процесса GitHub","Ограничен развертыванием сервера MCP","Требует установленного инструмента командной строки gh"],"ar":["يتطلب تهيئة سلاسل العمل في GitHub","محدود بنشر خادم MCP","يحتاج إلى أداة سطر الأوامر gh مثبتة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"e1bb3f611236218905ec43f60e90ba27995cad0f9012cb122ec279faee5849fa","qualityScore":31}');
