Compatibilidade com diversas plataformas"],"ru":["Разработан на Rust/Vulkan","Движок изометрической RPG","Создание погружающих игровых trải nghiệm","Оптимизация производительности","Совместимость с различными платформами"],"ar":["تم تطويره على روست/فولكان","محرك آر بي جي الإيزومتري","إنشاء تجارب لعب غامرة","تحسين الأداء","التوافق مع منصات مختلفة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用AI智能工具","什么是AI智能游戏引擎","Rust游戏开发","Vulkan游戏开发","AI智能游戏开发","游戏引擎比较","AI智能工具安装"],"ja":["AIエージェントの使い方","AIエージェントのゲームエンジンとは","Rustゲーム開発","Vulkanゲーム開発","AIエージェントのゲーム開発","ゲームエンジンの比較","AIエージェントのインストール"],"ko":["AI 에이전트의 사용법","AI 에이전트의 게임 엔진이란","러스트 게임 개발","볼칸 게임 개발","AI 에이전트의 게임 개발","게임 엔진 비교","AI 에이전트의 설치 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar Rust para juegos","qué es Vulkan","alternativas a Unity","motor de RPG isométrico","desarrollo de juegos con Rust","instalación de Vulkan","guía de configuración de Rust"],"fr":["comment utiliser Rust pour les jeux","qu''est-ce que Vulkan","alternatives à Unity","moteur de RPG isométrique","développement de jeux avec Rust","installation de Vulkan","guide de configuration de Rust"],"de":["wie man Rust für Spiele verwendet","was ist Vulkan","Alternativen zu Unity","isometrische RPG-Engine","Spielentwicklung mit Rust","Installation von Vulkan","Konfigurationsanleitung für Rust"],"pt":["como usar skill-polisher","o que é skill-polisher","alternativas ao skill-polisher","skill-polisher vs outros motores","instalar skill-polisher","guias de configuração do skill-polisher"],"ru":["как использовать skill-polisher","что такое skill-polisher","альтернативы skill-polisher","skill-polisher vs другие движки","установить skill-polisher","руководства по настройке skill-polisher"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام skill-polisher","ما هو skill-polisher","بديلات skill-polisher","skill-polisher مقابل محركات أخرى","تثبيت skill-polisher","دروس تثبيت skill-polisher"]}},"owner":"poisontr33s","repo":"chthonic-archive","repoPath":"poisontr33s/chthonic-archive","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-03T07:54:31Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"skill-polisher","description":"Meta-skill for Claude Code to validate and polish Codex skills under `.codex/skills/` by running the skill-polisher and reviewing structural integrity. Use when auditing Codex skills, enforcing standardization, or running integrity sweeps across the Codex skill set.","bodyPreview":"# Skill Polisher (Claude Code)\n\nAudit Codex skills for structural integrity and standardization by using the existing Codex `skill-polisher` tooling.\n\n## Flavor Contract\n- **Claude-flavored** by default: validates Claude frontmatter/tooling rules.\n- **Cross-flavored compatible** via shared auditor (see Cross-Flavor Audit).\n\n## Target scope\n- Codex skills:\n  - Single skill: `.codex/skills/<skill-name>`\n  - Whole set: `.codex/skills`\n- Claude skills:\n  - Single skill: `.claude/skills/<skill-name>`","body":"# Skill Polisher (Claude Code)\n\nAudit Codex skills for structural integrity and standardization by using the existing Codex `skill-polisher` tooling.\n\n## Flavor Contract\n- **Claude-flavored** by default: validates Claude frontmatter/tooling rules.\n- **Cross-flavored compatible** via shared auditor (see Cross-Flavor Audit).\n\n## Target scope\n- Codex skills:\n  - Single skill: `.codex/skills/<skill-name>`\n  - Whole set: `.codex/skills`\n- Claude skills:\n  - Single skill: `.claude/skills/<skill-name>`\n  - Whole set: `.claude/skills`\n\n## Execution\n### Codex skills (preferred)\nUse the Codex polisher for deterministic audits:\n\n```powershell\nuv run .codex/skills/skill-polisher/scripts/polish_skill.py .codex/skills --all\n```\n\nFor a single skill:\n\n```powershell\nuv run .codex/skills/skill-polisher/scripts/polish_skill.py .codex/skills/<skill-name>\n```\n\n### Claude skills (manual audit)\nClaude skills do not share the Codex polisher; use a lightweight audit:\n\n```powershell\nGet-ChildItem .claude/skills -Directory\nGet-Content .claude/skills/<skill-name>/SKILL.md\n```\n\nChecks to confirm:\n- `SKILL.md` present\n- Frontmatter includes `name` and `description`\n- Any `allowed-tools` entries match Claude tool names (`Read`, `Write`, `Glob`, `Grep`, `Bash` as needed)\n\n## Cross-Flavor Audit (shared)\nUse the shared auditor when you want consistent reporting:\n\n```powershell\nuv run scripts/skill_audit.py --flavor codex --root .codex/skills\nuv run scripts/skill_audit.py --flavor claude --root .claude/skills\n```\n\n## Hook (Claude-side)\nRun the Claude cross-compatible audit via the helper script:\n\n```powershell\n.\\scripts\\run_claude_skill_polisher.ps1 -Root .claude/skills\n```\n\n## Claude-Local Audit (Claude-centric outputs)\nWrite JSON outputs into `claude/mailbox`:\n\n```powershell\n.\\scripts\\run_claude_local_audit.ps1 -Root .claude/skills\n```\n\n## Hook (Claude-side cross-polish)\nRun both Codex and Claude audits in one pass:\n\n```powershell\n.\\scripts\\run_claude_cross_polish.ps1 -CodexRoot .codex/skills -ClaudeRoot .claude/skills\n```\n\n## Bridge (Codex tooling)\nInvoke Codex polisher from Claude:\n\n```powershell\n.\\scripts\\run_codex_polisher.ps1 -Root .codex/skills\n```\n\n## Reporting\nSummarize:\n- TASTE + score\n- Issues (if any)\n- Files changed (if any)\n\n## Notes\n- This skill audits **Codex and Claude skills**; do not modify either unless explicitly requested.\n- If you need to add `@POLISHED` seals, do so after a clean run and record the timestamp.\n\n## Cross-Flavor Compatibility\n- Codex flavor: requires `agents/openai.yaml` and `assets/` with SVG icons.\n- Claude flavor: requires `SKILL.md` with valid frontmatter (`name`, `description`), optional `allowed-tools`.\n- For shared audits use: `python scripts/skill_audit.py --flavor codex --root .codex/skills` and `python scripts/skill_audit.py --flavor claude --root .claude/skills`.\n\n\n\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-03T15:19:49.465Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Codex/Claude Agent Developers maintaining standardized skill repositories.","zh":"对于维护标准化技能仓库的 Codex/Claude 代理开发人员至关重要。","ja":"標準化されたスキルリポジトリを維持するCodex/Claudeエージェント開発者にとって不可欠です。","ko":"표준화된 스킬 저장소를 유지하는 Codex/Claude 에이전트 개발자를 위한 필수입니다.","es":"Esencial para los desarrolladores de agentes Codex/Claude que mantienen repositorios de habilidades estandarizados.","fr":"Essentiel pour les développeurs d''agents Codex/Claude qui maintiennent des dépôts de compétences standardisés.","de":"Essenziell für Codex/Claude Agent-Entwickler, die standardisierte Skill-Repositories pflegen.","pt":"Essencial para desenvolvedores de Agentes Codex/Claude que mantêm repositórios de skills padronizados.","ru":"Необходимо для разработчиков агентов Codex/Claude, поддерживающих стандартизированные репозитории навыков.","ar":"أساسي لمطوري وكلاء Codex/Claude الذين يحافظون على مستودعات المهارات الموحدة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Automates structural integrity checks and standardization across Codex and Claude skill ecosystems using specialized audit tooling. Provides cross-flavor compatibility validation through shared auditor modules for consistent skill architecture.","zh":"使用专门的审计工具自动执行Codex和Claude技能生态系统的结构完整性检查和标准化。通过共享的审计模块为一致的技能架构提供跨风格兼容性验证。","ja":"専用の監査ツールを使用して、CodexとClaudeのスキルエコシステムの構造的完全性のチェックと標準化を自動化します。共有監査モジュールを介して、一貫したスキルアーキテクチャに対するクロスフレーバーの互換性を検証します。","ko":"전문적인 감사 도구를 사용하여 Codex와 Claude 스킬 에코시스템의 구조적 정합성 및 표준화를 자동화합니다. 공유 감사 모듈을 통해 일관된 스킬 아키텍처에 대한 크로스 플레버 호환성을 검증합니다.","es":"Automatiza las comprobaciones de integridad estructural y la estandarización en los ecosistemas de habilidades de Codex y Claude utilizando herramientas de auditoría especializadas. Proporciona validación de compatibilidad entre variantes a través de módulos de auditoría compartidos para una arquitectura de habilidades consistente.","fr":"Automatise les vérifications d''intégrité structurelle et la standardisation à travers les écosystèmes de compétences Codex et Claude en utilisant des outils d''audit spécialisés. Fournit une validation de compatibilité cross-flavor grâce à des modules d''auditeur partagés pour une architecture de compétences cohérente.","de":"Automatisiert strukturelle Integritätsprüfungen und Standardisierung in den Codex- und Claude-Skill-Ökosystemen mittels spezialisierter Audit-Tools. Bietet Cross-Flavor-Kompatibilitätsvalidierung durch gemeinsame Auditor-Module für eine konsistente Skill-Architektur.","pt":"Automatiza verificações de integridade estrutural e padronização nos ecossistemas de skills do Codex e Claude usando ferramentas de auditoria especializadas. Fornece validação de compatibilidade cruzada através de módulos de auditoria compartilhados para uma arquitetura de skill consistente.","ru":"Автоматизирует проверки структурной целостности и стандартизации в экосистемах навыков Codex и Claude с использованием специализированных инструментов аудита. Обеспечивает проверку совместимости между различными вариантами через общие модули аудитора для согласованной архитектуры навыков.","ar":"يؤتمت فحوصات السلامة الهيكلية والمعايير عبر أنظمة مهارات Codex وClaude باستخدام أدوات التدقيق المتخصصة. يوفر التحقق من التوافق عبر الأنواع المختلفة من خلال وحدات المدقق المشتركة لهندسة مهارات متناسقة."},"useCases":{"en":["Auditing single skill structural integrity","Validating entire skill sets for standardization","Enforcing Claude-flavored frontmatter rules","Performing cross-flavor compatibility checks"],"zh":["审计单个技能的结构完整性","验证整个技能集的标准化","强制执行Claude风格的前置事项规则","执行跨风格兼容性检查"],"ja":["単一のスキルの構造的完全性の監査","全スキルセットの標準化の検証","Claude風のフロントマター規則の適用","クロスフレーバーの互換性のチェック"],"ko":["개별 스킬의 구조적 정합성 감사","전체 스킬 세트의 표준화 검증","Claude 风格의 프론티어 규칙 적용","크로스 플레버 호환성 점검"],"es":["Auditoría de la integridad estructural de una habilidad única","Validación de conjuntos de habilidades completos para su estandarización","Aplicación de reglas de frontmatter con formato Claude","Realización de comprobaciones de compatibilidad entre variantes"],"fr":["Audit de l''intégrité structurelle d''une compétence unique","Validation d''ensembles de compétences entiers pour la standardisation","Application des règles de frontmatter au format Claude","Réalisation de vérifications de compatibilité cross-flavor"],"de":["Audit der strukturellen Integrität einzelner Skills","Validierung gesamter Skill-Sets zur Standardisierung","Durchsetzung von Claude-flavored Frontmatter-Regeln","Durchführung von Cross-Flavor-Kompatibilitätsprüfungen"],"pt":["Auditoria da integridade estrutural de uma skill individual","Validação de conjuntos de skills inteiros para padronização","Imposição de regras de frontmatter no estilo Claude","Realização de verificações de compatibilidade cruzada"],"ru":["Аудит структурной целостности отдельного навыка","Проверка стандартизации целых наборов навыков","Применение правил фронтметра в стиле Claude","Выполнение проверок совместимости между вариантами"],"ar":["تدقيق السلامة الهيكلية لمهارة فردية","التحقق من مجموعات المهارات بأكملها للتقييس","فرض قواعد frontmatter بنمط Claude","إجراء فحوصات التوافق عبر الأنواع المختلفة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires existing Codex skill-polisher tooling","Limited to Codex/Claude skill formats","Dependent on specific directory structures (.codex/skills/, .claude/skills/)"],"zh":["需要现有的Codex技能抛光工具","仅限于Codex/Claude技能格式","依赖于特定的目录结构(.codex/skills/, .claude/skills/)"],"ja":["既存のCodexスキルポリッシャツールが必要","Codex/Claudeスキル形式に限定される","特定のディレクトリ構造(.codex/skills/, .claude/skills/)に依存する"],"ko":["기존의 Codex 스킬 폴리싱 도구가 필요","Codex/Claude 스킬 형식에만 국한됨","특정 디렉토리 구조(.codex/skills/, .claude/skills/)에 의존"],"es":["Requiere la existencia de herramientas Codex skill-polisher","Limitado a los formatos de habilidades Codex/Claude","Depende de estructuras de directorios específicas (.codex/skills/, .claude/skills/)"],"fr":["Nécessite l''existence d''outils Codex skill-polisher","Limité aux formats de compétences Codex/Claude","Dépend de structures de répertoire spécifiques (.codex/skills/, .claude/skills/)"],"de":["Erfordert bestehende Codex skill-polisher Tooling","Beschränkt auf Codex/Claude Skill-Formate","Abhängig von spezifischen Verzeichnisstrukturen (.codex/skills/, .claude/skills/)"],"pt":["Requer a existência de ferramentas Codex skill-polisher","Limitado aos formatos de skills Codex/Claude","Dependente de estruturas de diretórios específicas (.codex/skills/, .claude/skills/)"],"ru":["Требует наличия инструментов Codex skill-polisher","Ограничено форматами навыков Codex/Claude","Зависит от конкретных структур каталогов (.codex/skills/, .claude/skills/)"],"ar":["يتطلب وجود أدوات Codex skill-polisher","يقتصر على تنسيقات مهارات Codex/Claude","يعتمد على هياكل مجلدات محددة (.codex/skills/, .claude/skills/)"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"ced48430eb6fceece6b6c57e039dac3988eb14fa5961921cd26145360717098c","qualityScore":31}');
