: sod DFG Operator Console","en":"sod"},"description":{"zh":"sod是DFG运算控制台的AI智能工具，帮助开发者高效完成任务","ja":"sodはDFGオペレーターコンソールのAIエージェントで、開発者のタスクを効率的に完了するのに役立ちます","ko":"sod는 DFG 연산 콘솔의 AI 에이전트로 개발자가 작업을 효율적으로 완료하도록 도와줍니다","es":"La consola de operador DFG es una herramienta de AI diseñada para ayudar a los desarrolladores a gestionar y automatizar tareas. Ofrece una interfaz de línea...","fr":"La console d''opérateur DFG est un outil d''IA conçu pour aider les développeurs à gérer et à automatiser des tâches. Elle offre une interface de ligne de comm...","de":"Die DFG-Operator-Konsole ist ein KI-Tool, das dazu dient, Entwicklern bei der Verwaltung und Automatisierung von Aufgaben zu helfen. Es bietet eine Kommandoz...","pt":"O sod DFG Operator Console é uma ferramenta de AI que auxilia no desenvolvimento de aplicações com CLI e Agent","ru":"sod DFG Operator Console - это инструмент ИИ, помогающий в разработке приложений с CLI и Agent","ar":"سود DFG Operator Console هو أداة ذكاء اصطناعي تساعد في تطوير التطبيقات مع واجهة سطر الأوامر و Agent","en":"DFG Operator Console"},"definition":{"en":"DFG Operator Console"},"features":{"zh":["支持DFG运算","高效的开发工具","智能化的任务管理","简单易用的界面","支持多种开发语言"],"ja":["DFGオペレーションのサポート","効率的な開発ツール","智能的なタスク管理","シンプルで使いやすいインターフェース","複数の開発言語をサポート"],"ko":["DFG 연산 지원","효율적인 개발 도구","지능형 작업 관리","간단하고 사용하기 쉬운 인터페이스","다중 개발 언어 지원"],"es":["Interfaz de línea de comandos (CLI) para interactuar con el sistema","Automatización de tareas y procesos","Gestión de sistemas y aplicaciones","Soporte para múltiples plataformas","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo como React y Node.js"],"fr":["Interface de ligne de commande (CLI) pour interagir avec le système","Automatisation de tâches et de processus","Gestion de systèmes et d''applications","Prise en charge de plusieurs plateformes","Intégration avec des outils de développement tels que React et Node.js"],"de":["Kommandozeilen-Schnittstelle (CLI) zur Interaktion mit dem System","Automatisierung von Aufgaben und Prozessen","Verwaltung von Systemen und Anwendungen","Unterstützung für mehrere Plattformen","Integration mit Entwicklungstools wie React und Node.js"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de aplicações com React","Integração com Python e Node.js","Suporte a CLI e Agent","Ferramentas de AI para automação","Otimização de processo de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["Разработка приложений с React","Интеграция с Python и Node.js","Поддержка CLI и Agent","Инструменты ИИ для автоматизации","Оптимизация процесса разработки"],"ar":["تطوير التطبيقات مع React","التكامل مع Python و Node.js","دعم واجهة سطر الأوامر و Agent","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للتحكم الآلي","تحسين عملية التطوير"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用sod","什么是DFG运算","sod替代工具","sod vs 其他AI工具","sod安装","sod设置指南","AI智能工具","开发效率提升"],"ja":["sodの使い方","DFGオペレーションとは","sodの代替ツール","sod vs 他のAIエージェント","sodのインストール","sodの設定ガイド","AIエージェント","開発効率の向上"],"ko":["sod 사용법","DFG 연산이란","sod 대체 도구","sod vs 다른 AI 에이전트","sod 설치","sod 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트","개발 효율 향상"],"es":["herramientas de AI","consola de operador DFG","automatización de tareas","gestión de sistemas","CLI","React","Node.js","cómo usar la consola de operador DFG","alternativas a la consola de operador DFG"],"fr":["outils d''IA","console d''opérateur DFG","automatisation de tâches","gestion de systèmes","CLI","React","Node.js","comment utiliser la console d''opérateur DFG","alternatives à la console d''opérateur DFG"],"de":["KI-Tools","DFG-Operator-Konsole","Automatisierung von Aufgaben","Verwaltung von Systemen","CLI","React","Node.js","wie man die DFG-Operator-Konsole verwendet","Alternativen zur DFG-Operator-Konsole"],"pt":["como usar sod DFG Operator Console","o que é sod DFG Operator Console","sod DFG Operator Console alternativa","sod DFG Operator Console vs outros","instalar sod DFG Operator Console","guia de configuração do sod DFG Operator Console"],"ru":["как использовать sod DFG Operator Console","что такое sod DFG Operator Console","альтернатива sod DFG Operator Console","sod DFG Operator Console vs другие","установить sod DFG Operator Console","руководство по настройке sod DFG Operator Console"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام sod DFG Operator Console","ما هو sod DFG Operator Console","بديل sod DFG Operator Console","sod DFG Operator Console مقابل غيره","تثبيت sod DFG Operator Console","دليل إعداد sod DFG Operator Console"]}},"owner":"venturecrane","repo":"dfg-console","repoPath":"venturecrane/dfg-console","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-03T02:33:04Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sod","description":"Start of Day","bodyPreview":"# /sod - Start of Day\n\nThis command prepares your session using MCP tools to validate context, show work priorities, and ensure you''re ready to code.\n\n## Execution\n\n### Step 1: Start Session\n\nCall the `crane_sod` MCP tool to initialize the session.\n\nThe tool returns a structured briefing with:\n\n- Session context (venture, repo, branch)\n- Behavioral directives (enterprise rules)\n- Continuity (recent handoffs)\n- Alerts (P0 issues, active sessions)\n- Weekly plan status\n- Cadence briefing (overdue/d","body":"# /sod - Start of Day\n\nThis command prepares your session using MCP tools to validate context, show work priorities, and ensure you''re ready to code.\n\n## Execution\n\n### Step 1: Start Session\n\nCall the `crane_sod` MCP tool to initialize the session.\n\nThe tool returns a structured briefing with:\n\n- Session context (venture, repo, branch)\n- Behavioral directives (enterprise rules)\n- Continuity (recent handoffs)\n- Alerts (P0 issues, active sessions)\n- Weekly plan status\n- Cadence briefing (overdue/due recurring activities)\n- Knowledge base and enterprise context\n\n> **Note:** The MCP tool reads the weekly plan but does not auto-create it. If the plan is missing, Step 4 below guides you through creating it.\n\n### Step 2: Display Context Confirmation\n\nPresent a clear context confirmation box:\n\n```\nVENTURE:  {venture_name} ({venture_code})\nREPO:     {repo}\nBRANCH:   {branch}\nSESSION:  {session_id}\n```\n\nState: \"You''re in the correct repository and on the {branch} branch.\"\n\n### Step 3: Handle P0 Issues\n\nIf the Alerts section shows P0 issues:\n\n1. Display prominently with warning icon\n2. Say: \"**There are P0 issues that need immediate attention.**\"\n3. List each issue\n\n### Step 4: Check Weekly Plan\n\nThe weekly plan is a **portfolio-level** artifact that lives in crane-console (vc). Only prompt for creation when the active venture is `vc`.\n\nBased on `weekly_plan` status in the response:\n\n- **valid**: Note the priority venture and proceed\n- **stale**: Warn user: \"Weekly plan is {age_days} days old. Consider updating.\"\n- **missing**:\n  - **If venture is `vc`**: Ask user:\n    - \"What venture is priority this week? (vc/dfg/sc/ke)\"\n    - \"Any specific issues to target? (optional)\"\n    - \"Any capacity constraints? (optional)\"\n\n    Then create `docs/planning/WEEKLY_PLAN.md`:\n\n    ```markdown\n    # Weekly Plan - Week of {DATE}\n\n    ## Priority Venture\n\n    {venture code}\n\n    ## Target Issues\n\n    {list or \"None specified\"}\n\n    ## Capacity Notes\n\n    {notes or \"Normal capacity\"}\n\n    ## Created\n\n    {ISO timestamp}\n    ```\n\n  - **If venture is NOT `vc`**: Skip silently. Do not prompt the user to create a weekly plan.\n\n### Step 5: STOP and Wait\n\n**CRITICAL**: Do NOT automatically start working.\n\nPresent a brief summary and ask: **\"What would you like to focus on?\"**\n\nIf user wants to see the full work queue, call `crane_status` MCP tool.\n\n## Wrong Repo Prevention\n\nAll GitHub issues created this session MUST target the repo shown in context confirmation. If you find yourself targeting a different repo, STOP and verify with the user.\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\nIf MCP tools aren''t available:\n\n1. Check `claude mcp list` shows crane connected\n2. Ensure started with: `crane vc`\n3. Try: `cd ~/dev/crane-console/packages/crane-mcp && npm run build && npm link`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T15:32:24.848Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing automated session preparation and MCP tool integration.","zh":"非常适合需要自动化会话准备和MCP工具集成的开发代理。","ja":"開発エージェントが自動化されたセッション準備とMCPツールの統合を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"자동화된 세션 준비 및 MCP 툴 통합이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Desarrollo que necesitan preparación de sesión automatizada y integración de herramientas MCP.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents de Développement ayant besoin d''une préparation de session automatisée et d''une intégration d''outils MCP.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel benötigende automatisierte Sitzungsvorbereitung und MCP-Tool-Integration.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que precisam de preparação de sessão automatizada e integração da ferramenta MCP.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходима автоматизированная подготовка сессий и интеграция с инструментом MCP.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء النمطية الذين يحتاجون إلى تحضير جلسة آلي ودمج أداة MCP."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to initialize sessions with structured briefings, leveraging MCP tools for context validation, work priority display, and continuity checks, utilizing protocols like crane_sod for seamless integration.","zh":"赋予代理初始化会话的结构化简报的能力，利用MCP工具进行上下文验证、工作优先级显示和连续性检查，使用类似crane_sod的协议实现无缝集成。","ja":"エージェントがセッションを初期化するための構造化されたブリーフィングを提供し、MCPツールを使用してコンテキストの検証、作業の優先度の表示、継続性の確認を行い、crane_sodなどのプロトコルを使用してシームレスな統合を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 구조화된 브리핑으로 세션을 초기화할 수 있도록 하며, MCP 툴을 사용하여 컨텍스트 검증, 작업 우선순위 표시 및 연속성 확인을 수행하며, crane_sod와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여无缝한 통합을 구현합니다.","es":"Empodera a los agentes para inicializar sesiones con breves estructurados, aprovechando herramientas MCP para la validación de contexto, la visualización de la prioridad de trabajo y las comprobaciones de continuidad, utilizando protocolos como crane_sod para una integración perfecta.","fr":"Autonomise les agents pour initialiser des sessions avec des briefings structurés, en exploitant les outils MCP pour la validation du contexte, l''affichage de la priorité de travail et les vérifications de continuité, en utilisant des protocoles comme crane_sod pour une intégration sans accroc.","de":"Ermächtigt Mittel, Sitzungen mit strukturierten Briefings zu initialisieren, MCP-Tools für Kontextvalidierung, Arbeitsprioritätsanzeige und Kontinuitätsprüfungen zu nutzen und Protokolle wie crane_sod für eine nahtlose Integration zu verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a inicializar sessões com briefings estruturados, aproveitando as ferramentas MCP para validação de contexto, exibição de prioridade de trabalho e verificações de continuidade, utilizando protocolos como crane_sod para integração sem problemas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью инициализации сессий с структурированными брифингами, используя инструменты MCP для проверки контекста, отображения приоритета работы и проверок на непрерывность, используя протоколы, такие как crane_sod, для бесшовной интеграции.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على 初始化 الجلسات مع إيجاز منظم، مستفيداً من أدوات MCP للتحقق من السياق وعرض الأولوية العمل والتحقق من الاستمرارية، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل crane_sod للدمج السلس."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating daily session setups with venture and repository context","Generating weekly plan status reports and cadence briefings","Validating session context and ensuring compliance with enterprise rules and behavioral directives"],"zh":["使用venture和repository上下文自动化每日会话设置","生成每周计划状态报告和cadence简报","验证会话上下文并确保遵守企业规则和行为指令"],"ja":["ベンチャーとリポジトリのコンテキストを使用して毎日のセッション設定を自動化する","毎週の計画状態レポートとケイデンスブリーフィングを生成する","セッションコンテキストを検証し、企業ルールと行動指針に準拠することを確認する"],"ko":["venture 및 repository 컨텍스트를 사용하여 일일 세션 설정을 자동화합니다","주간 계획 상태 보고서 및 캐드نس 브리핑을 생성합니다","세션 컨텍스트를 검증하고 기업 규칙 및 행동 지침을 준수하는지 확인합니다"],"es":["Automatizar la configuración de sesiones diarias con contexto de empresa y repositorio","Generar informes de estado del plan semanal y briefings de cadencia","Validar el contexto de la sesión y garantizar el cumplimiento de las reglas y directrices de comportamiento de la empresa"],"fr":["Automatiser la configuration des sessions quotidiennes avec contexte d''entreprise et de référentiel","Générer des rapports d''état du plan hebdomadaire et des briefings de cadence","Valider le contexte de la session et assurer le respect des règles et directives de comportement de l''entreprise"],"de":["Automatisieren der täglichen Sitzungseinrichtungen mit Kontext von Unternehmen und Repository","Erzeugen von Statusberichten des wöchentlichen Plans und Kadenz-Briefings","Validieren des Sitzungskontexts und Sicherstellen der Einhaltung der Regeln und Verhaltensrichtlinien des Unternehmens"],"pt":["Automatizar configurações diárias de sessão com contexto de venture e repositório","Gerar relatórios de status do plano semanal e briefings de cadência","Validar contexto de sessão e garantir conformidade com regras e diretivas comportamentais da empresa"],"ru":["Автоматизировать ежедневные настройки сессий с контекстом venture и репозиторием","Генерировать еженедельные отчеты о статусе плана и брифинги по каденции","Проверять контекст сессии и обеспечивать соблюдение правил и директив поведения предприятия"],"ar":["توفير إعدادات جلسة يومية آلي مع سياق المشروع والمستودع","توليد تقارير حالة الخطة الأسبوعية وإيجاز الإيقاع","التحقق من سياق الجلسة وضمان امتثال لقواعد وتوجيهات السلوك المؤسسية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires MCP tool access and crane_sod protocol integration","Dependent on active session and continuity data"],"zh":["需要MCP工具访问和crane_sod协议集成","依赖于活动会话和连续性数据"],"ja":["MCPツールへのアクセスとcrane_sodプロトコルの統合が必要","アクティブセッションと連続性データに依存する"],"ko":["MCP 툴 액세스 및 crane_sod 프로토콜 통합이 필요합니다","액티브 세션 및 연속성 데이터에 의존합니다"],"es":["Requiere acceso a herramientas MCP y integración del protocolo crane_sod","Dependiente de la sesión activa y los datos de continuidad"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux outils MCP et une intégration du protocole crane_sod","Dépendante de la session active et des données de continuité"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf MCP-Tools und crane_sod-Protokollintegration","Abhängig von der aktiven Sitzung und den Kontinuitätsdaten"],"pt":["Requer acesso à ferramenta MCP e integração do protocolo crane_sod","Depende de dados de sessão ativa e continuidade"],"ru":["Требует доступа к инструменту MCP и интеграции протокола crane_sod","Зависит от активных данных сессии и непрерывности"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى أداة MCP ودمج بروتوكول crane_sod","يعتمد على بيانات جلسة نشطة والاستمرارية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"e9ed1283becd540049095836354ffe51f4ab84f851e3c77e230b3361f8fbcc07","qualityScore":31}');
