s للوظائف الخاد...","en":"upstash-workflow-js"},"description":{"zh":"Upstash Workflow JS提供了可靠、高性能的服务器less函数，帮助开发者简化工作流程","ja":"Upstash Workflow JSは信頼性の高いサーバーレス関数を提供し、開発者がワークフローを簡素化できるようにします","ko":"Upstash Workflow JS는 안정적인 서버리스 함수를 제공하여 개발자가 작업 흐름을 간소화할 수 있습니다","es":"upstash-workflow-js ofrece funciones serverless duraderas, confiables y de alto rendimiento para desarrolladores","fr":"upstash-workflow-js propose des fonctions serverless durables, fiables et performantes pour les développeurs","de":"upstash-workflow-js bietet zuverlässige, leistungsstarke Serverless-Funktionen für Entwickler","pt":"O upstash-workflow-js é uma solução de funções serverless duráveis, confiáveis e de alto desempenho para desenvolvedores","ru":"Upstash-workflow-js - это надежное решение для серверных функций с высокой производительностью для разработчиков","ar":"upstash-workflow-js هو حل_Serverless موثوق وذو أداء عالٍ للوظائف الخادمة للمطورين","en":"Durable, Reliable and Performant Serverless Functions"},"definition":{"en":"Durable, Reliable and Performant Serverless Functions"},"features":{"zh":["可靠的服务器less函数","高性能的工作流程","简化的工作流程管理","支持多种编程语言","与Upstash生态系统集成"],"ja":["信頼性の高いサーバーレス関数","高性能なワークフロー","ワークフローの簡素化","多くのプログラミング言語をサポート","Upstashエコシステムとの統合"],"ko":["안정적인 서버리스 함수","고성능의 워크플ロー","작업 흐름의 간소화","다수의 프로그래밍 언어 지원","Upstash 생태계와의 통합"],"es":["Funciones serverless duraderas","Alto rendimiento garantizado","Implementación fácil y rápida","Compatibilidad con Node.js","Soporte técnico especializado"],"fr":["Fonctions serverless durables","Haute performance garantie","Mise en œuvre facile et rapide","Compatibilité avec Node.js","Support technique spécialisé"],"de":["Zuverlässige Serverless-Funktionen","Hohe Leistung garantiert","Einfache und schnelle Implementierung","Kompatibilität mit Node.js","Spezialisierte technische Unterstützung"],"pt":["Funções serverless duráveis e confiáveis","Alto desempenho e escalabilidade","Integração fácil com Node.js e outros frameworks","Suporte a CLI e API","Monitoramento e logging avançados"],"ru":["Надежные и долговечные серверные функции","Высокая производительность и масштабируемость","Легкая интеграция с Node.js и другими фреймворками","Поддержка CLI и API","Расширенный мониторинг и логирование"],"ar":["الوظائف الخادمة الموثوقة والمتينة","أداء عالٍ وقابلية التوسع","التكامل السهل مع Node.js وأطر العمل الأخرى","دعم CLI و API","مراقبة وتسجيل متقدم"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Upstash Workflow JS","服务器less函数","工作流程管理","如何使用Upstash Workflow JS","Upstash Workflow JS教程","服务器less函数工具","工作流程优化","Upstash Workflow JS安装","Upstash Workflow JS设置指南"],"ja":["Upstash Workflow JS","サーバーレス関数","ワークフローマネジメント","Upstash Workflow JSの使い方","Upstash Workflow JSチュートリアル","サーバーレス関数ツール","ワークフローの最適化","Upstash Workflow JSのインストール","Upstash Workflow JSの設定ガイド"],"ko":["Upstash Workflow JS","서버리스 함수","작업 흐름 관리","Upstash Workflow JS 사용법","Upstash Workflow JS 튜토리얼","서버리스 함수 도구","작업 흐름 최적화","Upstash Workflow JS 설치","Upstash Workflow JS 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de AI","funciones serverless","upstash-workflow-js","cómo usar upstash-workflow-js","guía de instalación de upstash-workflow-js","alternativas a upstash-workflow-js","upstash-workflow-js vs AWS Lambda","desarrollo de funciones serverless","mejores prácticas para funciones serverless"],"fr":["outils d''IA","fonctions serverless","upstash-workflow-js","comment utiliser upstash-workflow-js","guide d''installation de upstash-workflow-js","alternatives à upstash-workflow-js","upstash-workflow-js vs AWS Lambda","développement de fonctions serverless","meilleures pratiques pour les fonctions serverless"],"de":["KI-Tools","Serverless-Funktionen","upstash-workflow-js","wie man upstash-workflow-js verwendet","Installationsanleitung für upstash-workflow-js","Alternativen zu upstash-workflow-js","upstash-workflow-js vs AWS Lambda","Entwicklung von Serverless-Funktionen","beste Praktiken für Serverless-Funktionen"],"pt":["como usar upstash-workflow-js","o que é upstash-workflow-js","upstash-workflow-js vs aws lambda","upstash-workflow-js install","upstash-workflow-js setup guide","ferramentas de ia para desenvolvedores","funções serverless duráveis","desenvolvimento de software com upstash-workflow-js"],"ru":["как использовать upstash-workflow-js","что такое upstash-workflow-js","upstash-workflow-js vs aws lambda","установка upstash-workflow-js","руководство по настройке upstash-workflow-js","инструменты ии для разработчиков","надежные серверные функции","разработка программного обеспечения с upstash-workflow-js"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام upstash-workflow-js","ما هو upstash-workflow-js","upstash-workflow-js vs aws lambda","تثبيت upstash-workflow-js","دليل إعداد upstash-workflow-js","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","الوظائف الخادمة الموثوقة","تطوير البرمجيات مع upstash-workflow-js"]}},"owner":"upstash","repo":"workflow-js","repoPath":"upstash/workflow-js","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.663Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"upstash-workflow-js","description":"Lightweight guidance for using the Upstash Workflow SDK to define, trigger, and manage workflows. Use this Skill whenever a user wants to create workflow endpoints, run steps, or interact with the Upstash Workflow client.","bodyPreview":"# Upstash Workflow SDK\n\n## Quick Start\n\nThe Upstash Workflow SDK lets you expose serverless workflow endpoints and run them reliably using QStash under the hood.\n\nInstall:\n\n```bash\nnpm install @upstash/workflow\n```\n\nDefine a simple workflow endpoint:\n\n```ts\nimport { serve } from \"@upstash/workflow\";\n\nexport const { POST } = serve(async (context) => {\n  await context.run(\"step-1\", () => console.log(\"step 1\"));\n  await context.run(\"step-2\", () => console.log(\"step 2\"));\n});\n```\n\nTrigger it from yo","body":"# Upstash Workflow SDK\n\n## Quick Start\n\nThe Upstash Workflow SDK lets you expose serverless workflow endpoints and run them reliably using QStash under the hood.\n\nInstall:\n\n```bash\nnpm install @upstash/workflow\n```\n\nDefine a simple workflow endpoint:\n\n```ts\nimport { serve } from \"@upstash/workflow\";\n\nexport const { POST } = serve(async (context) => {\n  await context.run(\"step-1\", () => console.log(\"step 1\"));\n  await context.run(\"step-2\", () => console.log(\"step 2\"));\n});\n```\n\nTrigger it from your backend:\n\n```ts\nimport { Client } from \"@upstash/workflow\";\n\nconst client = new Client({ token: process.env.QSTASH_TOKEN! });\nawait client.trigger({ url: \"https://your-app.com/api/workflow\" });\n```\n\n## Other Skill Files\n\nThese files contain the full documentation. Use them for details, patterns, and advanced behavior.\n\n- basics:\n  - **basics/serve** – How to expose workflow endpoints.\n  - **basics/context** – Full API for workflow `context` (steps, waits, webhooks, events, invoke, etc.).\n  - **basics/client** – Using the Workflow client to trigger, cancel, inspect, and notify runs.\n- features:\n  - **features/invoke** – Cross‑workflow invocation.\n  - **features/reliability** – Retries, failure callbacks, and DLQ.\n  - **features/flow-control** – Rate limits, concurrency, and parallelism.\n  - **features/wait-for-event** – Notify and wait-for-event patterns.\n  - **features/webhooks** – Webhook creation and consumption.\n- how to:\n  - **how-to/local-dev** – Local QStash dev server and tunneling.\n  - **how-to/realtime** – Realtime and human‑in‑the‑loop workflows.\n  - **how-to/migrations** – Migrating workflows safely.\n  - **how-to/middleware** – Adding middleware to workflows.\n- other files:\n  - **rest-api** – Low-level REST endpoints for interacting with QStash/Workflow.\n  - **troubleshooting** – Common debugging and environment issues.\n  - **agents** – Using Workflow with agents, orchestrators, and automation patterns.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:21:00.069Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Serverless Agents requiring durable and reliable workflow execution using QStash under the hood.","zh":"适用于需要使用 QStash 执行强大可靠的工作流的 Serverless Agents。","ja":"QStash を使用して強力で信頼性の高いワークフローを実行する必要がある Serverless エージェントに最適です。","ko":"QStash 를 사용하여 내구성 있고 신뢰할 수 있는 워크플로우 실행이 필요한 Serverless 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes sin servidor que requieren una ejecución de flujo de trabajo duradera y confiable utilizando QStash bajo la capa","fr":"Idéal pour les agents sans serveur nécessitant une exécution de workflow durable et fiable en utilisant QStash sous le capot","de":"Ideal für serverlose Agenten, die eine dauerhafte und zuverlässige Workflow-Ausführung mit QStash unter der Haube erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Serverless que exigem execução de fluxo de trabalho durável e confiável usando QStash por baixo dos panos.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Serverless, требующих надежной и долговечной реализации рабочих процессов с использованием QStash под капотом.","ar":"مثالي لعميل الخادم أقل الذي يتطلب تنفيذ تدفق عمل متين وموثوق به باستخدام QStash تحت الغطاء."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to expose serverless workflow endpoints and run them reliably with the Upstash Workflow SDK, utilizing QStash for performant serverless functions and supporting libraries like @upstash/workflow for seamless integration.","zh":"赋予代理程序以使用 Upstash Workflow SDK 暴露无服务器工作流端点并可靠运行它们的能力，利用 QStash 实现高性能的无服务器函数，并支持诸如 @upstash/workflow 之类的库以实现无缝集成。","ja":"Upstash Workflow SDK を使用してエージェントにサーバーレス ワークフロー エンドポイントを公開して信頼性高く実行する機能を提供し、QStash を使用してパフォーマンスの高いサーバーレス関数を実現し、@upstash/workflow などのライブラリをサポートしてシームレスな統合を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 Upstash Workflow SDK를 사용하여 서버리스 워크플로우 엔드포인트를 노출하고 안정적으로 실행할 수 있는 기능을 제공하며, QStash를 사용하여 고성능 서버리스 함수를 지원하고 @upstash/workflow와 같은 라이브러리를 지원하여無断な 통합을 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a exponer puntos de conexión de flujo de trabajo sin servidor y ejecutarlos de forma confiable con el SDK de flujo de trabajo de Upstash, utilizando QStash para funciones sin servidor de alto rendimiento y bibliotecas de apoyo como @upstash/workflow para una integración sin problemas","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exposer des points de terminaison de workflow sans serveur et de les exécuter de manière fiable avec le SDK de workflow Upstash, en utilisant QStash pour des fonctions sans serveur performantes et des bibliothèques de support comme @upstash/workflow pour une intégration transparente","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, serverlose Workflow-Endpunkte bereitzustellen und sie zuverlässig mit dem Upstash-Workflow-SDK auszuführen, wobei QStash für leistungsstarke serverlose Funktionen und Bibliotheken wie @upstash/workflow für eine nahtlose Integration verwendet wird","pt":"Permite que os agentes exponham pontos de extremidade de fluxo de trabalho sem servidor e executem-nos de forma confiável com o SDK de Fluxo de Trabalho Upstash, utilizando QStash para funções sem servidor de alto desempenho e bibliotecas de suporte como @upstash/workflow para integração sem problemas.","ru":"Предоставляет агентам возможность обнародовать конечные точки рабочих процессов без сервера и запускать их надежно с помощью SDK рабочих процессов Upstash, используя QStash для высокопроизводительных функций без сервера и поддерживающих библиотек, таких как @upstash/workflow, для бесшовной интеграции.","ar":"تمكن العملاء من تعريض نقاط النهاية لتدفق العمل بدون خادم وتشغيلها بشكل موثوق باستخدام SDK Flux de Upstash ، باستخدام QStash لدوال بدون خادم ذات الأداء العالي ومكتبات الدعم مثل @upstash/workflow للتكامل السلس."},"useCases":{"en":["Defining simple workflow endpoints with serve","Triggering serverless workflows using POST requests","Running reliable workflows with context.run"],"zh":["使用 serve 定义简单的工作流端点","使用 POST 请求触发服务器工作流","使用 context.run 运行可靠的工作流"],"ja":["serve を使用してシンプルなワークフロー エンドポイントを定義する","POST リクエストを使用してサーバーレス ワークフローをトリガーする","context.run を使用して信頼性の高いワークフローを実行する"],"ko":["serve를 사용하여 단순한 워크플로우 엔드포인트를 정의하는 것","POST 요청을 사용하여 서버리스 워크플로우를 트리거하는 것","context.run을 사용하여 안정적인 워크플로우를 실행하는 것"],"es":["Definir puntos de conexión de flujo de trabajo simples con serve","Activar flujos de trabajo sin servidor mediante solicitudes POST","Ejecutar flujos de trabajo confiables con contexto.ejecutar"],"fr":["Définir des points de terminaison de workflow simples avec serve","Déclencher des workflows sans serveur à l''aide de requêtes POST","Exécuter des workflows fiables avec contexte.exécuter"],"de":["Definieren einfacher Workflow-Endpunkte mit serve","Auslösen serverloser Workflows mithilfe von POST-Anfragen","Ausführen zuverlässiger Workflows mit kontext.ausführen"],"pt":["Definir pontos de extremidade de fluxo de trabalho simples com serve","Acionar fluxos de trabalho sem servidor usando solicitações POST","Executar fluxos de trabalho confiáveis com context.run"],"ru":["Определение простых конечных точек рабочих процессов с помощью serve","Запуск рабочих процессов без сервера с помощью запросов POST","Запуск надежных рабочих процессов с context.run"],"ar":["تحديد نقاط النهاية البسيطة لتدفق العمل مع.Serve","تشغيل تدفقات العمل بدون خادم باستخدام طلبات POST","تشغيل تدفقات العمل الموثوقة مع context.run"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires npm installation of @upstash/workflow","Dependent on QStash under the hood"],"zh":["需要安装 @upstash/workflow 的 npm","依赖于 QStash"],"ja":["@upstash/workflow の npm インストールが必要","QStash への依存"],"ko":["@upstash/workflow의 npm 설치가 필요함","QStash에 의존"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de npm de @upstash/workflow","Dependiente de QStash bajo la capa"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de npm de @upstash/workflow","Dépend de QStash sous le capot"],"de":["Erfordert die npm-Installation von @upstash/workflow","Abhängig von QStash unter der Haube"],"pt":["Exige instalação do npm do @upstash/workflow","Dependente de QStash por baixo dos panos"],"ru":["Требует установки npm @upstash/workflow","Зависит от QStash под капотом"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت npm @upstash/workflow","يعتمد على QStash تحت الغطاء"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"8d94ad14a754cbf10a5c6908205a38955dfae9232cd197d2187830435c7f017b","qualityScore":31}');
