{"zh":"Worktree技能是使用git worktrees和Tmux窗口实现零摩擦的并行开发，提高开发效率","ja":"Worktreeスキルは、git worktreesとTmuxウィンドウを使用して零摩擦の並列開発を実現し、開発効率を向上させる","ko":"워크트리 스킬은 git 워크트리와 tmux 창을 사용하여 제로 마찰의 병렬 개발을 구현하고 개발 효율성을 향상시키는 방법입니다","es":"Worktree es una herramienta que combina git worktrees y tmux windows para un desarrollo paralelo sin fricciones","fr":"Worktree est un outil qui combine git worktrees et tmux windows pour un développement parallèle sans friction","de":"Worktree ist ein Tool, das git worktrees und tmux windows für eine parallele Entwicklung ohne Reibung kombiniert","pt":"O Worktree é uma ferramenta que permite desenvolvimento paralelo com git worktrees e tmux, permitindo que os desenvolvedores trabalhem em tarefas simultaneam...","ru":"Worktree — это инструмент, который позволяет параллельное развитие с Git Worktrees и Tmux, позволяя разработчикам работать над задачами одновременно.","ar":"ووركتري هو أداة تسمح بالتطوير الموازي مع جيت ووركتيرز وتموكس، وتمكن المطورين من العمل على مهام متزامنة.","en":"git worktrees + tmux windows for zero-friction parallel dev"},"definition":{"en":"git worktrees + tmux windows for zero-friction parallel dev"},"features":{"zh":["使用git worktrees实现并行开发","集成Tmux窗口提高开发效率","零摩擦开发体验","提高代码质量","简化开发流程"],"ja":["git worktreesを使用して並列開発を実現","Tmuxウィンドウを統合して開発効率を向上","零摩擦開発体験","コード品質の向上","開発プロセスの簡素化"],"ko":["git 워크트리를 사용하여 병렬 개발을 구현","tmux 창을 통합하여 개발 효율성을 향상","제로 마찰 개발 경험","코드 품질 향상","개발 프로세스 단순화"],"es":["Desarrollo paralelo sin fricciones","Uso de git worktrees","Integración con tmux windows","Lanzamiento de tareas en nuevos worktrees","Compatibilidad con workmux"],"fr":["Développement parallèle sans friction","Utilisation de git worktrees","Intégration avec tmux windows","Lancement de tâches dans de nouveaux worktrees","Compatibilité avec workmux"],"de":["Parallele Entwicklung ohne Reibung","Verwendung von git worktrees","Integration mit tmux windows","Starten von Aufgaben in neuen Worktrees","Kompatibilität mit workmux"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento paralelo com git worktrees","Integração com tmux para gerenciamento de janelas","Criação de tarefas simultâneas","Aumento da produtividade do time de desenvolvimento","Fácil utilização e configuração"],"ru":["Параллельное развитие с Git Worktrees","Интеграция с Tmux для управления окнами","Создание одновременных задач","Увеличение производительности команды разработки","Лёгкое использование и настройка"],"ar":["التطوير الموازي مع جيت ووركتيرز","التكامل مع تموكس لإدارة النوافذ","إنشاء مهام متزامنة","زيادة إنتاجية فريق التطوير","سهولة الاستخدام والتهيئة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Worktree","git worktrees","Tmux","并行开发","零摩擦开发","开发效率","代码质量","开发流程"],"ja":["Worktree","git worktrees","Tmux","並列開発","零摩擦開発","開発効率","コード品質","開発プロセス"],"ko":["워크트리","git 워크트리","tmux","병렬 개발","제로 마찰 개발","개발 효율성","코드 품질","개발 프로세스"],"es":["desarrollo paralelo","git worktrees","tmux windows","workmux","desarrollo de software","herramientas de desarrollo","productividad de desarrollo"],"fr":["développement parallèle","git worktrees","tmux windows","workmux","développement de logiciels","outils de développement","productivité de développement"],"de":["parallele Entwicklung","git worktrees","tmux windows","workmux","Software-Entwicklung","Entwicklungstools","Entwicklungsproduktivität"],"pt":["desenvolvimento paralelo","git worktrees","tmux","produtividade","desenvolvimento de software","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","desenvolvedores","equipes de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["параллельное развитие","Git Worktrees","Tmux","производительность","разработка программного обеспечения","инструменты разработки","разработчики","команды разработки"],"ar":["التطوير الموازي","جيت ووركتيرز","تموكس","إنتاجية","تطوير البرمجيات","أدوات التطوير","المطورين","فرق التطوير"]}},"owner":"raine","repo":"workmux","repoPath":"raine/workmux","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.667Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"worktree","description":"Launch one or more tasks in new git worktrees using workmux.","bodyPreview":"Launch one or more tasks in new git worktrees using workmux.\n\nTasks: $ARGUMENTS\n\n## You are a dispatcher, not an implementer\n\n**HARD RULE — NO EXCEPTIONS:** Do NOT explore, read, grep, glob, or search the\ncodebase. Do NOT use the Task/Explore agent. Do NOT investigate the problem. You\nare a thin dispatcher — your ONLY job is to write prompt files and run\n`workmux add`. The worktree agent will do all the exploration and implementation.\n\nIf the user''s message contains enough context to write a pro","body":"Launch one or more tasks in new git worktrees using workmux.\n\nTasks: $ARGUMENTS\n\n## You are a dispatcher, not an implementer\n\n**HARD RULE — NO EXCEPTIONS:** Do NOT explore, read, grep, glob, or search the\ncodebase. Do NOT use the Task/Explore agent. Do NOT investigate the problem. You\nare a thin dispatcher — your ONLY job is to write prompt files and run\n`workmux add`. The worktree agent will do all the exploration and implementation.\n\nIf the user''s message contains enough context to write a prompt, write it\nimmediately. If not, ask the user for clarification — do NOT try to figure it\nout by reading code.\n\nIf tasks reference earlier conversation (e.g., \"do option 2\"), include all\nrelevant context in each prompt you write.\n\nIf tasks reference a markdown file (e.g., a plan or spec), re-read the file to\nensure you have the latest version before writing prompts.\n\nFor each task:\n\n1. Generate a short, descriptive worktree name (2-4 words, kebab-case)\n2. Write a detailed implementation prompt to a temp file\n3. Run `workmux add <worktree-name> -b -P <temp-file>` to create the worktree\n\nThe prompt file should:\n\n- Include the full task description\n- Use RELATIVE paths only (never absolute paths, since each worktree has its own\n  root directory)\n- Be specific about what the agent should accomplish\n\n## Skill delegation\n\nIf the user passes a skill reference (e.g., `/auto`, `/plan-review`),\nthe prompt should instruct the agent to use that skill instead of writing out\nmanual implementation steps.\n\n**Skills can have flags.** If the user passes `/auto --gemini`, pass the\nflag through to the skill invocation in the prompt.\n\nExample prompt:\n```\n[Task description here]\n\nUse the skill: /skill-name [flags if any] [task description]\n```\n\nDo NOT write detailed implementation steps when a skill is specified — the skill\nhandles that.\n\n## Flags\n\n**`--merge`**: When passed, add instruction to use `/merge` skill at the end to\ncommit, rebase, and merge the branch.\n\n```\n...\nThen use the /merge skill to commit, rebase, and merge the branch.\n```\n\n## Workflow\n\nWrite ALL temp files first, THEN run all workmux commands.\n\nStep 1 - Write all prompt files (in parallel):\n\n```bash\ntmpfile=$(mktemp).md\ncat > \"$tmpfile\" << ''EOF''\nImplement feature X...\nEOF\necho \"$tmpfile\"  # Note the path for step 2\n```\n\nStep 2 - After ALL files are written, run workmux commands (in parallel):\n\n```bash\nworkmux add feature-x -b -P /tmp/tmp.abc123.md\nworkmux add feature-y -b -P /tmp/tmp.def456.md\n```\n\nAfter creating the worktrees, inform the user which branches were created.\n\n**Remember:** Your task is COMPLETE once worktrees are created. Do NOT implement\nanything yourself.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:22:04.296Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Development Agents requiring seamless parallel development capabilities with git worktrees and tmux windows","zh":"适用于需要使用 git worktrees 和 tmux 窗口进行无缝并行开发的开发代理","ja":"git worktrees と tmux ウィンドウを使用したシームレスな並行開発機能を必要とする開発エージェントに最適","ko":"git worktrees와 tmux 창을 사용하여無шов한 병렬 개발 기능이 필요한 개발 에이전트에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo que requieren capacidades de desarrollo paralelo sin problemas con git worktrees y ventanas de tmux","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement nécessitant des capacités de développement parallèle sans rupture avec git worktrees et fenêtres tmux","de":"Ideal für Entwicklungsmittel, die eine nahtlose parallele Entwicklung mit git Worktrees und tmux-Fenstern erfordern","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que exigem capacidades de desenvolvimento paralelo sem interrupção com git worktrees e janelas tmux","ru":"Идеально для агентов разработки, требующих бесшовных возможностей параллельной разработки с git worktrees и окнами tmux","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذي يتطلب إمكانيات التطوير الموازي دون انقطاع مع git worktrees ونافذة tmux"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to launch multiple tasks in isolated git worktrees using workmux, enabling zero-friction parallel development with features like tmux window management and automated task dispatching","zh":"使代理能够使用 workmux 在隔离的 git worktrees 中启动多个任务，实现零摩擦的并行开发，具有 tmux 窗口管理和自动任务调度等功能","ja":"エージェントが workmux を使用して分離された git worktrees 内で複数のタスクを起動できるようにし、tmux ウィンドウ管理や自動タスク派遣などの機能を備えた零摩擦の並行開発を可能に","ko":"에이전트가 workmux를 사용하여 분리된 git worktrees 내에서 여러 작업을 시작할 수 있도록 하여, tmux 창 관리 및 자동 작업 배포와 같은 기능을 갖춘 无摩擦의 병렬 개발을 가능하게 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a iniciar múltiples tareas en git worktrees aislados utilizando workmux, lo que permite un desarrollo paralelo sin fricciones con características como la gestión de ventanas tmux y el envío automático de tareas","fr":"Permet aux agents de lancer plusieurs tâches dans des worktrees git isolés à l''aide de workmux, permettant un développement parallèle sans friction avec des fonctionnalités telles que la gestion de fenêtres tmux et l''expédition automatique de tâches","de":"Ermächtigt die Mittel, mehrere Aufgaben in isolierten git Worktrees mit workmux zu starten, wodurch ein reibungsloser paralleler Entwicklungsprozess mit Funktionen wie tmux-Fensterverwaltung und automatischer Auftragsherstellung ermöglicht wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a lançar várias tarefas em git worktrees isolados usando workmux, permitindo o desenvolvimento paralelo sem atrito com recursos como gerenciamento de janelas tmux e despacho de tarefas automatizado","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью запуска нескольких задач в изолированных git worktrees с помощью workmux, обеспечивая параллельную разработку без трения с функциями, такими как управление окнами tmux и автоматическая отправка задач","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء إمكانية إطلاق مهام متعددة في git worktrees معزولة باستخدام workmux، مما يتيح التطوير الموازي بدون احتكاك مع ميزات مثل إدارة نوافذ tmux وتوزيع المهام الآلي"},"useCases":{"en":["Launching parallel development tasks","Managing multiple git worktrees","Automating task dispatching with workmux"],"zh":["启动并行开发任务","管理多个 git worktrees","使用 workmux 自动任务调度"],"ja":["並行開発タスクの起動","複数の git worktrees の管理","workmux を使用した自動タスク派遣"],"ko":["병렬 개발 작업 시작","여러 git worktrees 관리","workmux를 사용한 자동 작업 배포"],"es":["Lanzar tareas de desarrollo paralelo","Administrar múltiples git worktrees","Automatizar el envío de tareas con workmux"],"fr":["Lancer des tâches de développement parallèle","Gérer plusieurs worktrees git","Automatiser l''expédition de tâches avec workmux"],"de":["Starten von Aufgaben für die parallele Entwicklung","Verwalten mehrerer git Worktrees","Automatisieren der Auftragsherstellung mit workmux"],"pt":["Lançar tarefas de desenvolvimento paralelo","Gerenciar vários git worktrees","Automatizar o despacho de tarefas com workmux"],"ru":["Запуск параллельных задач разработки","Управление несколькими git worktrees","Автоматизация отправки задач с помощью workmux"],"ar":["إطلاق مهام التطوير الموازي","إدارة متعددة git worktrees","التوفير الآلي لتحويل المهام مع workmux"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires git and tmux installation","No codebase exploration or investigation allowed","Dependent on workmux for task management"],"zh":["需要 git 和 tmux 安装","不允许代码库探索或调查","依赖 workmux 进行任务管理"],"ja":["git と tmux のインストールが必要","コードベースの探索や調査は許可されない","タスク管理に workmux 依存"],"ko":["git 및 tmux 설치가 필요","코드베이스 탐색 또는 조사 허용 안됨","작업 관리에 workmux 의존"],"es":["Requiere la instalación de git y tmux","No se permite la exploración o investigación del código base","Dependiente de workmux para la gestión de tareas"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de git et tmux","L''exploration ou l''enquête sur le code base n''est pas autorisée","Dépend de workmux pour la gestion des tâches"],"de":["Erfordert die Installation von git und tmux","Keine Codebasis-Exploration oder -Untersuchung erlaubt","Von workmux für die Aufgabenverwaltung abhängig"],"pt":["Exige instalação do git e tmux","Nenhuma exploração ou investigação de codebase permitida","Dependente do workmux para gerenciamento de tarefas"],"ru":["Требует установки git и tmux","Не допускается исследование или расследование codebase","Зависит от workmux для управления задачами"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت git و tmux","لا يسمح بفحص أو تحقيق codebase","يعتمد على workmux لإدارة المهام"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"222481216adf803430cea1996068fe03f654b27e1ab7d556fc1fdf1b0b4614fa","qualityScore":31}');
