outils de développement","Gestion des versions des métadonnées","Compatibilité avec des formats de données variés"],"de":["Versionierung von beispielbasierten Metadaten","Inkrementale Multimodal-Pipeline","Integration mit Entwicklungstools","Verwaltung von Versionen von Metadaten","Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen Datenformaten"],"pt":["Gerenciamento de metadados em nível de amostra","Versão incremental de metadados","Integração com pipelines multimodais","Escalabilidade e flexibilidade","Suporte a múltiplos formatos de metadados"],"ru":["Управление метаданными на уровне образца","Постепенное версионирование метаданных","Интеграция с мультимодальными пайплайнами","Масштабируемость и гибкость","Поддержка нескольких форматов метаданных"],"ar":["إدارة البيانات الوصفية على مستوى العينة","نسخ متوالية للبيانات","التكامل مع الأنابيب متعددة الوسائط","المرونة والتنظيم","دعم صيغ متعددة للبيانات الوصفية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["sybil","AI智能工具","增量多模态管道","可插拔样本级元数据版本控制","AI开发效率","如何使用sybil","sybil安装","sybil设置指南"],"ja":["sybil","AIエージェント","インクリメンタルマルチモーダルパイプライン","プラガブルサンプルレベルメタデータバージョニング","AI開発効率","sybilの使い方","sybilのインストール","sybilの設定ガイド"],"ko":["sybil","AI 에이전트","증분 멀티모달 파이프라인","플러그 가능 샘플 레벨 메타데이터 버전 관리","AI 개발 효율","sybil 사용법","sybil 설치","sybil 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de ia","sybil","version de metadatos","pipeline multimodal","desarrollo de software","integración de herramientas","gestión de versiones","formatos de datos","guias de instalación de sybil"],"fr":["outils d''ia","sybil","version des métadonnées","pipeline multimodal","développement de logiciels","intégration d''outils","gestion des versions","formats de données","guides d''installation de sybil"],"de":["ki-tools","sybil","versionierung von metadaten","multimodal-pipeline","software-entwicklung","integration von tools","verwaltung von versionen","datenformate","installation von sybil"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","sybil","metadados em pipelines multimodais","versão incremental de metadados","como usar sybil","sybil vs outras ferramentas","instalação do sybil","guias de configuração do sybil"],"ru":["ИИ агенты","sybil","метаданные в мультимодальных пайплайнах","версионирование метаданных","как использовать sybil","sybil против других инструментов","установка sybil","руководства по настройке sybil"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","sybil","بيانات وصفية في الأنابيب متعددة الوسائط","نسخ متوالية للبيانات","كيفية استخدام sybil","sybil مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت sybil","دليل إعداد sybil"]}},"owner":"anam-org","repo":"metaxy","repoPath":"anam-org/metaxy","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.680Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"sybil","description":"Use Sybil for testing code examples in documentation and docstrings. Covers pytest integration, parsers, skip directives, and namespace management.","bodyPreview":"# Sybil Documentation Testing\n\nSybil validates code examples embedded in documentation and docstrings by parsing and executing them as part of normal test runs.\n\n**Official Documentation**: https://sybil.readthedocs.io/en/latest/\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\npip install sybil[pytest]\n```\n\n## Pytest Integration\n\nConfigure in `conftest.py`. See [pytest integration docs](https://sybil.readthedocs.io/en/latest/integration.html#pytest-integration).\n\n```python\nfrom sybil import Sybil\nfrom sybil.parsers.m","body":"# Sybil Documentation Testing\n\nSybil validates code examples embedded in documentation and docstrings by parsing and executing them as part of normal test runs.\n\n**Official Documentation**: https://sybil.readthedocs.io/en/latest/\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\npip install sybil[pytest]\n```\n\n## Pytest Integration\n\nConfigure in `conftest.py`. See [pytest integration docs](https://sybil.readthedocs.io/en/latest/integration.html#pytest-integration).\n\n```python\nfrom sybil import Sybil\nfrom sybil.parsers.markdown.codeblock import PythonCodeBlockParser\nfrom sybil.parsers.markdown.skip import SkipParser\n\npytest_collect_file = Sybil(\n    parsers=[\n        SkipParser(),\n        PythonCodeBlockParser(),\n    ],\n    patterns=[\"*.md\", \"**/*.py\"],\n).pytest()\n```\n\n### Sybil Parameters\n\nSee [API reference](https://sybil.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api.html#sybil.Sybil).\n\n| Parameter        | Description                                                     |\n| ---------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `parsers`        | Sequence of parser callables                                    |\n| `patterns`       | File glob patterns to include (e.g., `[\"*.md\", \"src/**/*.py\"]`) |\n| `excludes`       | File glob patterns to exclude                                   |\n| `setup`          | Callable receiving namespace dict, called before each document  |\n| `teardown`       | Callable receiving namespace dict, called after each document   |\n| `fixtures`       | List of pytest fixture names to inject into namespace           |\n| `document_types` | Map file extensions to Document classes                         |\n\n### Document Types\n\nSee [API reference](https://sybil.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api.html#documents).\n\n- **Default**: Parse entire file\n- `PythonDocument`: Import `.py` file as module, names available in namespace\n- `PythonDocStringDocument`: Parse only docstrings from `.py` files\n\n```python\nfrom sybil.document import PythonDocStringDocument\n\npytest_collect_file = Sybil(\n    parsers=[...],\n    patterns=[\"src/**/*.py\"],\n    document_types={\".py\": PythonDocStringDocument},\n).pytest()\n```\n\n### Fixtures\n\n```python\nimport pytest\nfrom sybil import Sybil\n\n\n@pytest.fixture\ndef my_fixture():\n    return {\"key\": \"value\"}\n\n\npytest_collect_file = Sybil(\n    parsers=[...],\n    patterns=[\"*.md\"],\n    fixtures=[\"my_fixture\"],  # Available in document namespace\n).pytest()\n```\n\n### Setup/Teardown\n\n```python\ndef sybil_setup(namespace):\n    namespace[\"helper\"] = lambda x: x * 2\n\n\ndef sybil_teardown(namespace):\n    pass  # Cleanup if needed\n\n\npytest_collect_file = Sybil(\n    parsers=[...],\n    setup=sybil_setup,\n    teardown=sybil_teardown,\n).pytest()\n```\n\n## Disable pytest''s Built-in Doctest\n\nAdd to `pyproject.toml` to prevent conflicts:\n\n```toml\n[tool.pytest.ini_options]\naddopts = \"-p no:doctest\"\n```\n\n## Markdown Parsers\n\nSee [Markdown parsers docs](https://sybil.readthedocs.io/en/latest/markdown.html).\n\n```python\nfrom sybil.parsers.markdown.codeblock import PythonCodeBlockParser, CodeBlockParser\nfrom sybil.parsers.markdown.skip import SkipParser\nfrom sybil.parsers.markdown.clear import ClearNamespaceParser\n```\n\n## Skip Directives\n\nSee [skip directive docs](https://sybil.readthedocs.io/en/latest/markdown.html#skipping-examples).\n\n**SkipParser must come before other parsers** to handle skip directives.\n\n````markdown\n<!-- skip: next -->\n\n```python\n# This example is skipped\n```\n````\n\n<!-- skip: next \"reason for skipping\" -->\n\n```python\n# Skipped and reported as skipped test with reason\n```\n\n<!-- skip: start -->\n\n```python\n# Multiple examples\n```\n\n```python\n# All skipped\n```\n\n<!-- skip: end -->\n\n<!-- skip: next if(condition_var) -->\n\n```python\n# Conditionally skipped based on namespace variable\n```\n\n````\n## Invisible Code Blocks\n\nSetup code that doesn''t render in documentation. See [invisible code blocks docs](https://sybil.readthedocs.io/en/latest/markdown.html#invisible-code-blocks).\n\n```markdown\n<!-- invisible-code-block: python\nsetup_var = \"hidden setup\"\n-->\n````\n\n## Clear Namespace\n\nReset the document namespace for isolation. See [clear namespace docs](https://sybil.readthedocs.io/en/latest/markdown.html#clearing-the-namespace).\n\n```markdown\n<!-- clear-namespace -->\n```\n\n## Custom Evaluators\n\nSee [evaluators API](https://sybil.readthedocs.io/en/latest/api.html#evaluators).\n\n```python\nfrom sybil.parsers.markdown.codeblock import CodeBlockParser\nfrom sybil.evaluators.python import PythonEvaluator\n\n# Custom evaluator with future imports\nevaluator = PythonEvaluator(future_imports=[\"annotations\"])\n\nparser = CodeBlockParser(language=\"python\", evaluator=evaluator)\n```\n\n## Running Sybil Tests\n\nSybil tests are collected like regular pytest tests. To run only Sybil tests:\n\n```bash\n# Run tests from specific directory containing documented code\npytest src/mypackage/ -v\n\n# Exclude regular tests, only run documentation examples\npytest docs/ -v\n```\n\nTo exclude Sybil tests from regular test runs, use pytest''s `--ignore` flag or configure `addopts` in `pyproject.toml`.\n\n## Example: Complete conftest.py\n\n```python\n\"\"\"Sybil configuration for docstring testing.\"\"\"\n\nfrom sybil import Sybil\nfrom sybil.document import PythonDocStringDocument\nfrom sybil.evaluators.python import PythonEvaluator\nfrom sybil.parsers.markdown.codeblock import CodeBlockParser\nfrom sybil.parsers.markdown.skip import SkipParser\n\nimport mypackage\n\n\ndef sybil_setup(namespace):\n    \"\"\"Pre-populate namespace for all examples.\"\"\"\n    namespace[\"pkg\"] = mypackage\n\n\ndef sybil_teardown(namespace):\n    \"\"\"Cleanup after document.\"\"\"\n    pass\n\n\npytest_collect_file = Sybil(\n    parsers=[\n        SkipParser(),\n        CodeBlockParser(language=\"python\", evaluator=PythonEvaluator()),\n        CodeBlockParser(language=\"py\", evaluator=PythonEvaluator()),\n    ],\n    patterns=[\"src/mypackage/**/*.py\"],\n    document_types={\".py\": PythonDocStringDocument},\n    setup=sybil_setup,\n    teardown=sybil_teardown,\n    excludes=[\n        \"**/tests/**\",\n        \"**/_internal/**\",\n    ],\n).pytest()\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:24:30.552Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Analysis Agents needing advanced documentation testing and validation capabilities with pytest integration.","zh":"非常适合需要高级文档测试和验证功能并集成pytest的Python分析代理。","ja":"pytestの統合を必要とするPython分析エージェントに適した、高度なドキュメントのテストおよび検証機能を必要とする。","ko":"pytest 통합을 필요로 하는 Python 분석 에이전트에 적합한 고급 문서 테스트 및 검증 기능을 필요로 할 때 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Análisis de Python que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de prueba y validación de documentación con integración de pytest.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse Python ayant besoin de capacités de test et de validation de documentation avancées avec intégration de pytest.","de":"Perfekt für Python-Analyse-Agents, die erweiterte Dokumentationstest- und Validierungsfunktionen mit pytest-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para agentes de análise Python que precisam de capacidades avançadas de teste e validação de documentação com integração pytest.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов анализа Python, которым требуются расширенные возможности тестирования и проверки документации с интеграцией pytest.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء تحليل بايثون الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لاختبار وتحقق الوثائق مع دمج pytest."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to validate code examples embedded in documentation and docstrings by parsing and executing them as part of normal test runs using pluggable sample-level metadata versioning for incremental multimodal pipelines with libraries like pytest.","zh":"赋予代理验证文档和文档字符串中嵌入的代码示例的能力，通过解析和执行它们作为正常测试运行的一部分，使用可插拔的示例级元数据版本控制实现增量多模式管道，类似pytest的库。","ja":"ドキュメントとドキュメント文字列に埋め込まれたコード例を解析して実行することで、通常のテスト実行の一部として代理がコードを検証できるようにし、pytestなどのライブラリを使用して、プラグ可能なサンプルレベルのメタデータバージョニングによる増分的多モーダルパイプラインを実現します。","ko":" 문서와 문서 문자열에 포함된 코드 예시를 파싱하고 실행하여, 정상적인 테스트 실행의 일부로 에이전트가 코드를 검증할 수 있도록 하며, pytest와 같은 라이브러리를 사용하여, 플러그 가능한 샘플 수준의 메타데이터 버전 관리를 통한 증분 다중 모드 파이프라인을 구현합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a validar ejemplos de código incrustados en la documentación y cadenas de documentación al analizarlos y ejecutarlos como parte de las ejecuciones de prueba normales utilizando versiones de metadatos a nivel de muestra para pipelines multimodales incrementales con bibliotecas como pytest.","fr":"Permet aux agents de valider les exemples de code intégrés dans la documentation et les docstrings en les analysant et en les exécutant comme partie des exécutions de test normales en utilisant des versions de métadonnées au niveau de l''échantillon pour les pipelines multimodaux incrémentiels avec des bibliothèques comme pytest.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Codebeispiele in der Dokumentation und Docstrings zu validieren, indem sie diese analysieren und als Teil normaler Testläufe ausführen, wobei versionierte Metadaten auf Sample-Ebene für inkrementelle multimodale Pipelines mit Bibliotheken wie pytest verwendet werden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a validar exemplos de código incorporados na documentação e docstrings, analisando-os e executando-os como parte de execuções de teste normais, utilizando versionamento de metadados de nível de amostra plugável para pipelines multimodais incrementais com bibliotecas como pytest.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью проверять примеры кода, встроенные в документацию и docstrings, анализируя и выполняя их в рамках обычных запусков тестов, используя подключаемый версионирование метаданных на уровне образца для инкрементных многомодальных конвейеров с библиотеками, такими как pytest.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على التحقق من أمثلة الشفرة المضمنة في الوثائق والشرطات، عن طريق تحليلها وتنفيذها كجزء من تشغيل الاختبارات العادي، باستخدام إصدار بيانات وصفية على مستوى العينة قابلة للتحديث لخطوط أنابيب متعددة الحالات المتزايدة مع مكتبات مثل pytest."},"useCases":{"en":["Validating code examples in documentation","Executing docstrings as part of test runs","Parsing sample-level metadata for incremental multimodal pipelines"],"zh":["验证文档中的代码示例","将文档字符串作为测试运行的一部分执行","解析示例级元数据以用于增量多模式管道"],"ja":["ドキュメント内のコード例の検証","ドキュメント文字列をテスト実行の一部として実行","サンプルレベルのメタデータの解析による増分的多モーダルパイプライン"],"ko":["문서에 포함된 코드 예시의 검증","문서 문자열을 테스트 실행의 일부로 실행","샘플 수준의 메타데이터 파싱을 통한 증분 다중 모드 파이프라인"],"es":["Validar ejemplos de código en la documentación","Ejecutar docstrings como parte de las ejecuciones de prueba","Analizar metadatos a nivel de muestra para pipelines multimodales incrementales"],"fr":["Valider les exemples de code dans la documentation","Exécuter les docstrings comme partie des exécutions de test","Analyser les métadonnées au niveau de l''échantillon pour les pipelines multimodaux incrémentiels"],"de":["Codebeispiele in der Dokumentation validieren","Docstrings als Teil von Testläufen ausführen","Metadaten auf Sample-Ebene für inkrementelle multimodale Pipelines analysieren"],"pt":["Validar exemplos de código na documentação","Executar docstrings como parte de execuções de teste","Analizar metadados de nível de amostra para pipelines multimodais incrementais"],"ru":["Проверка примеров кода в документации","Выполнение docstrings в рамках запусков тестов","Анализ метаданных на уровне образца для инкрементных многомодальных конвейеров"],"ar":["التحقق من أمثلة الشفرة في الوثائق","تنفيذ الشرطات كجزء من تشغيل الاختبارات","تحليل بيانات وصفية على مستوى العينة لخطوط أنابيب متعددة الحالات المتزايدة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires pytest integration","Python environment needed","Limited to validating code examples in documentation and docstrings"],"zh":["需要pytest集成","需要Python环境","仅限于验证文档和文档字符串中的代码示例"],"ja":["pytestの統合が必要","Python環境が必要","ドキュメントおよびドキュメント文字列内のコード例の検証のみ"],"ko":["pytest 통합이 필요","Python 환경이 필요","문서 및 문서 문자열에 포함된 코드 예시의 검증만"],"es":["Requiere integración de pytest","Se necesita entorno de Python","Limitado a la validación de ejemplos de código en la documentación y docstrings"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration de pytest","Environnement Python nécessaire","Limité à la validation des exemples de code dans la documentation et les docstrings"],"de":["Benötigt pytest-Integration","Python-Umgebung erforderlich","Begrenzt auf die Validierung von Codebeispielen in der Dokumentation und Docstrings"],"pt":["Requer integração pytest","Ambiente Python necessário","Limitado à validação de exemplos de código na documentação e docstrings"],"ru":["Требуется интеграция pytest","Необходимо окружение Python","Ограниченная проверка примеров кода в документации и docstrings"],"ar":["يتطلب دمج pytest","بيئة بايثون مطلوبة","محدود بالتحقق من أمثلة الشفرة في الوثائق والشرطات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"bc0d0c5591e50dd9eacc9eefb6485210391b31709fc60637d41074bec302fa6b","qualityScore":31}');
