":"Ferramentas de Notificação UI para Aplicativos Todo","ru":"ИИ Агенты для Todo-Приложений: Notification-UI","ar":"أدوات الإشعارات واجهة المستخدم للtodo-تطبيقات","en":"notification-ui"},"description":{"zh":"notification-ui是一个用于构建Todo应用程序的AI智能通知界面，提供了强大的用户体验","ja":"notification-uiは、Todoアプリケーションを構築するためのAIエージェントによる通知UIです。強力なユーザーエクスペリエンスを提供します","ko":"notification-ui는 Todo 애플리케이션을 구축하기 위한 AI 알림 UI로 강력한 사용자 경험을 제공합니다","es":"Nuestra herramienta de notificación UI para aplicaciones Todo te permite crear notificaciones personalizadas y mejoras la experiencia del usuario","fr":"Notre outil de notification UI pour applications Todo vous permet de créer des notifications personnalisées et d''améliorer l''expérience utilisateur","de":"Unser Benachrichtigungs-UI-Tool für Todo-Anwendungen ermöglicht es Ihnen, benutzerdefinierte Benachrichtigungen zu erstellen und die Benutzererfahrung zu ver...","pt":"A Notification-UI é uma ferramenta de notificação para aplicativos Todo que melhora a experiência do usuário com notificações personalizadas","ru":"Notification-UI - это инструмент уведомлений для Todo-приложений, который улучшает пользовательский опыт с помощью индивидуальных уведомлений","ar":"واجهة المستخدم الإشعارات هي أداة إشعارات لتطبيقات Todo التي تحسن تجربة المستخدم من خلال الإشعارات المخصصة","en":"Todo-Application"},"definition":{"en":"Todo-Application"},"features":{"zh":["支持React和Node.js","提供强大的用户体验","易于集成和使用","支持多种通知类型","高度可定制"],"ja":["ReactとNode.jsをサポート","強力なユーザーエクスペリエンスを提供","簡単に統合および使用","多種多様な通知タイプをサポート","高度にカスタマイズ可能"],"ko":["React와 Node.js 지원","강력한 사용자 경험 제공","쉽게 통합 및 사용","다양한 알림 유형 지원","고도화된 사용자 정의 가능"],"es":["Diseño personalizable de notificaciones","Integración con aplicaciones Todo","Soporte para múltiples plataformas","Notificaciones en tiempo real","Compatibilidad con React y otros frameworks"],"fr":["Conception de notifications personnalisables","Intégration avec les applications Todo","Prise en charge de plusieurs plateformes","Notifications en temps réel","Compatibilité avec React et d''autres frameworks"],"de":["Benutzerdefiniertes Design von Benachrichtigungen","Integration mit Todo-Anwendungen","Unterstützung für mehrere Plattformen","Echtzeit-Benachrichtigungen","Kompatibilität mit React und anderen Frameworks"],"pt":["Notificações personalizadas para aplicativos Todo","Integração com React, Python e Node.js","Suporte a CLI para facilidade de uso","Customização de notificações para melhor experiência do usuário","Compatibilidade com diferentes plataformas"],"ru":["Индивидуальные уведомления для Todo-приложений","Интеграция с React, Python и Node.js","Поддержка CLI для простоты использования","Настройка уведомлений для лучшего пользовательского опыта","Совместимость с разными платформами"],"ar":["إشعارات مخصصة لتطبيقات Todo","التكامل مع React و Python و Node.js","دعم CLI لسهولة الاستخدام","تخصيص الإشعارات لتحسين تجربة المستخدم","التوافق مع منصات مختلفة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用notification-ui","什么是AI智能通知界面","notification-ui替代方案","notification-ui与竞争对手的比较","notification-ui安装","notification-ui设置指南","Todo应用程序开发","AI工具"],"ja":["notification-uiの使用方法","AIエージェントによる通知UIとは","notification-uiの代替","notification-uiと競合製品の比較","notification-uiのインストール","notification-uiの設定ガイド","Todoアプリケーションの開発","AIエージェント"],"ko":["notification-ui 사용 방법","AI 알림 UI란","notification-ui 대체","notification-ui와 경쟁 제품 비교","notification-ui 설치","notification-ui 설정 가이드","Todo 애플리케이션 개발","AI 알림 도구"],"es":["herramientas de notificación UI","cómo crear notificaciones personalizadas","aplicaciones Todo","notificación UI para desarrolladores","alternativas a herramientas de notificación","guía de instalación de notificación UI","configuración de notificación UI"],"fr":["outils de notification UI","comment créer des notifications personnalisées","applications Todo","notification UI pour développeurs","alternatives aux outils de notification","guide d''installation de notification UI","configuration de notification UI"],"de":["Benachrichtigungs-UI-Tools","wie man benutzerdefinierte Benachrichtigungen erstellt","Todo-Anwendungen","Benachrichtigungs-UI für Entwickler","Alternativen zu Benachrichtigungs-Tools","Installationsanleitung für Benachrichtigungs-UI","Konfiguration von Benachrichtigungs-UI"],"pt":["como usar notificação ui","o que é notificação ui","notificação ui alternative","notificação ui vs outras ferramentas","instalar notificação ui","guia de configuração notificação ui","notificação ui para desenvolvedores","notificação ui para aplicativos todo"],"ru":["как использовать ИИ Агенты уведомлений","что такое ИИ Агенты уведомлений","ИИ Агенты уведомлений альтернатива","ИИ Агенты уведомлений vs другие инструменты","установить ИИ Агенты уведомлений","руководство по настройке ИИ Агентов уведомлений","ИИ Агенты уведомлений для разработчиков","ИИ Агенты уведомлений для Todo-приложений"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام أدوات الإشعارات","ما هي أدوات الإشعارات","أدوات الإشعارات بديلة","أدوات الإشعارات مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت أدوات الإشعارات","دليل إعداد أدوات الإشعارات","أدوات الإشعارات للمطورين","أدوات الإشعارات لتطبيقات Todo"]}},"owner":"Syedaashnaghazanfar","repo":"full-stack-todo-app","repoPath":"Syedaashnaghazanfar/full-stack-todo-app","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.727Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"notification-ui","description":"Renders notification bell icon with unread count badge, pulse animations for new notifications, and dropdown panel (320px × max 400px) displaying notification items with purple theme for VERY IMPORTANT tasks. Includes mark-as-read interaction and empty state handling.","bodyPreview":"# Notification UI Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nThe notification UI skill provides the visual interface for displaying notifications, including a bell icon with badge, animated indicators, and an interactive notification panel.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nApply this skill:\n- When rendering the app header (bell icon)\n- When displaying unread notification count\n- When showing notification panel/dropdown\n- When animating new notification arrivals\n- When user interacts with notifications (click to mark as read)\n- When","body":"# Notification UI Skill\n\n## Overview\n\nThe notification UI skill provides the visual interface for displaying notifications, including a bell icon with badge, animated indicators, and an interactive notification panel.\n\n## When to Apply\n\nApply this skill:\n- When rendering the app header (bell icon)\n- When displaying unread notification count\n- When showing notification panel/dropdown\n- When animating new notification arrivals\n- When user interacts with notifications (click to mark as read)\n- When displaying empty state (no notifications)\n\n## Bell Icon Specifications\n\n### Icon Size and Position\n\n- **Size**: 24px × 24px\n- **Position**: Top-right header\n- **Color**: Default #374151 (gray), hover #1F2937 (dark gray)\n\n```jsx\nfunction BellIcon({ unreadCount, onClick }) {\n  return (\n    <button\n      className=\"bell-icon-button\"\n      onClick={onClick}\n      aria-label={`Notifications (${unreadCount} unread)`}\n    >\n      <svg\n        width=\"24\"\n        height=\"24\"\n        viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"\n        fill=\"none\"\n        xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"\n        className=\"bell-icon\"\n      >\n        <path\n          d=\"M15 17H20L18.5951 15.5951C18.2141 15.2141 18 14.6973 18 14.1585V11C18 8.38757 16.3304 6.16509 14 5.34142V5C14 3.89543 13.1046 3 12 3C10.8954 3 10 3.89543 10 5V5.34142C7.66962 6.16509 6 8.38757 6 11V14.1585C6 14.6973 5.78595 15.2141 5.40493 15.5951L4 17H9M15 17V18C15 19.6569 13.6569 21 12 21C10.3431 21 9 19.6569 9 18V17M15 17H9\"\n          stroke=\"currentColor\"\n          strokeWidth=\"2\"\n          strokeLinecap=\"round\"\n          strokeLinejoin=\"round\"\n        />\n      </svg>\n      {unreadCount > 0 && (\n        <span className=\"badge\">{unreadCount > 99 ? ''99+'' : unreadCount}</span>\n      )}\n    </button>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Bell Icon Styling\n\n```css\n.bell-icon-button {\n  position: relative;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 8px;\n  background: transparent;\n  border: none;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n  transition: background-color 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.bell-icon-button:hover {\n  background-color: #F3F4F6;\n}\n\n.bell-icon {\n  color: #374151;\n  transition: color 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.bell-icon-button:hover .bell-icon {\n  color: #1F2937;\n}\n```\n\n## Unread Count Badge\n\n### Badge Specifications\n\n- **Shape**: Circular\n- **Background**: #DC2626 (red)\n- **Text**: White (#FFFFFF)\n- **Display**: Count up to 99, then \"99+\"\n- **Position**: Top-right corner of bell icon\n\n```css\n.badge {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 4px;\n  right: 4px;\n  min-width: 18px;\n  height: 18px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background-color: #DC2626; /* Red */\n  color: #FFFFFF; /* White */\n  font-size: 10px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  padding: 0 4px;\n  box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);\n}\n```\n\n### Badge Display Logic\n\n```javascript\nfunction getBadgeText(count) {\n  if (count === 0) return null; // No badge\n  if (count > 99) return ''99+'';\n  return count.toString();\n}\n```\n\n## Pulse Animation\n\n### Animation Specifications\n\n- **Duration**: 2 seconds\n- **Effect**: Purple glow (#8B5CF6)\n- **Trigger**: On new notification arrival\n- **Iterations**: 3 times, then stop\n\n```css\n@keyframes pulse {\n  0%, 100% {\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.7);\n  }\n  50% {\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 8px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0);\n  }\n}\n\n.bell-icon-button.pulsing {\n  animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out 3;\n}\n```\n\n### Animation Trigger\n\n```jsx\nfunction NotificationBell({ notifications }) {\n  const [isPulsing, setIsPulsing] = useState(false);\n  const prevCountRef = useRef(notifications.length);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    // Detect new notification\n    if (notifications.length > prevCountRef.current) {\n      setIsPulsing(true);\n\n      // Stop animation after 6 seconds (3 iterations × 2s)\n      setTimeout(() => setIsPulsing(false), 6000);\n    }\n\n    prevCountRef.current = notifications.length;\n  }, [notifications.length]);\n\n  return (\n    <BellIcon\n      className={isPulsing ? ''pulsing'' : ''''}\n      unreadCount={notifications.filter(n => !n.read).length}\n    />\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Notification Dropdown Panel\n\n### Panel Specifications\n\n- **Width**: 320px\n- **Max Height**: 400px\n- **Scrollable**: Yes (overflow-y: auto)\n- **Position**: Dropdown below bell icon\n- **Elevation**: Shadow for depth\n\n```css\n.notification-dropdown {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: calc(100% + 8px);\n  right: 0;\n  width: 320px;\n  max-height: 400px;\n  overflow-y: auto;\n  background-color: #FFFFFF;\n  border: 1px solid #E5E7EB;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1),\n              0 4px 6px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);\n  z-index: 1000;\n}\n\n.notification-dropdown-header {\n  padding: 16px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E7EB;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n\n.notification-dropdown-title {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: #111827;\n}\n\n.mark-all-read {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: #8B5CF6;\n  background: none;\n  border: none;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.mark-all-read:hover {\n  color: #7C3AED;\n  text-decoration: underline;\n}\n```\n\n## Notification Item Styling\n\n### Item Specifications\n\n- **Padding**: 16px\n- **Border**: Bottom separator (1px solid #F3F4F6)\n- **Hover**: Background change to #F9FAFB\n- **Purple Theme**: VERY IMPORTANT notifications use #8B5CF6 accent\n\n```css\n.notification-item {\n  padding: 16px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #F3F4F6;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background-color 0.15s ease;\n}\n\n.notification-item:hover {\n  background-color: #F9FAFB;\n}\n\n.notification-item:last-child {\n  border-bottom: none;\n}\n\n.notification-item.unread {\n  background-color: #FAF5FF; /* Very light purple */\n}\n\n.notification-item.unread:hover {\n  background-color: #F3E8FF; /* Light purple */\n}\n\n.notification-content {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n\n.notification-header {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.notification-priority-indicator {\n  width: 6px;\n  height: 6px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background-color: #8B5CF6; /* Purple for VERY IMPORTANT */\n  margin-top: 6px;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.notification-message {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  color: #374151;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  flex: 1;\n}\n\n.notification-item.unread .notification-message {\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: #111827;\n}\n\n.notification-time {\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: #9CA3AF;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 4px;\n}\n\n.unread-dot {\n  width: 8px;\n  height: 8px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  background-color: #8B5CF6; /* Purple */\n}\n```\n\n## Complete Notification Item Component\n\n```jsx\nfunction NotificationItem({ notification, onMarkAsRead }) {\n  const handleClick = () => {\n    if (!notification.read) {\n      onMarkAsRead(notification.id);\n    }\n  };\n\n  const relativeTime = formatRelativeTime(notification.timestamp);\n\n  return (\n    <div\n      className={`notification-item ${notification.read ? '''' : ''unread''}`}\n      onClick={handleClick}\n    >\n      <div className=\"notification-content\">\n        <div className=\"notification-header\">\n          <div className=\"notification-priority-indicator\" />\n          <p className=\"notification-message\">{notification.message}</p>\n        </div>\n        <div className=\"notification-time\">\n          {!notification.read && <span className=\"unread-dot\" />}\n          <span>{relativeTime}</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n\nfunction formatRelativeTime(timestamp) {\n  const now = Date.now();\n  const diff = now - timestamp;\n  const minutes = Math.floor(diff / (1000 * 60));\n  const hours = Math.floor(diff / (1000 * 60 * 60));\n  const days = Math.floor(diff / (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24));\n\n  if (minutes < 1) return ''Just now'';\n  if (minutes < 60) return `${minutes}m ago`;\n  if (hours < 24) return `${hours}h ago`;\n  return `${days}d ago`;\n}\n```\n\n## Mark-as-Read Interaction\n\n### Click to Mark Read\n\nClicking an unread notification marks it as read:\n\n```jsx\nfunction handleNotificationClick(notification) {\n  if (!notification.read) {\n    // Mark as read\n    notificationPersistence.markAsRead(notification.id);\n\n    // Update UI state\n    setNotifications(notificationPersistence.getAll());\n    setUnreadCount(notificationPersistence.getUnreadCount());\n\n    // Optional: Navigate to task\n    navigateToTask(notification.taskId);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### Visual Feedback\n\n```jsx\nfunction NotificationItem({ notification, onMarkAsRead }) {\n  const [isMarking, setIsMarking] = useState(false);\n\n  const handleClick = async () => {\n    if (!notification.read && !isMarking) {\n      setIsMarking(true);\n      await onMarkAsRead(notification.id);\n      setIsMarking(false);\n    }\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <div\n      className={`notification-item ${notification.read ? '''' : ''unread''} ${isMarking ? ''marking'' : ''''}`}\n      onClick={handleClick}\n    >\n      {/* ... */}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Empty State\n\n### Empty State Component\n\n```jsx\nfunction EmptyState() {\n  return (\n    <div className=\"notification-empty-state\">\n      <div className=\"empty-icon\">🔔</div>\n      <p className=\"empty-title\">No notifications</p>\n      <p className=\"empty-description\">\n        You''re all caught up! Notifications for VERY IMPORTANT tasks will appear here.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n### Empty State Styling\n\n```css\n.notification-empty-state {\n  padding: 48px 24px;\n  text-align: center;\n  color: #6B7280;\n}\n\n.empty-icon {\n  font-size: 48px;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n  opacity: 0.4;\n}\n\n.empty-title {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: #374151;\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n\n.empty-description {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  color: #9CA3AF;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\n```\n\n## Complete Notification System\n\n```jsx\nfunction NotificationSystem() {\n  const [isOpen, setIsOpen] = useState(false);\n  const [notifications, setNotifications] = useState([]);\n  const [unreadCount, setUnreadCount] = useState(0);\n  const dropdownRef = useRef(null);\n\n  // Load notifications\n  useEffect(() => {\n    const loaded = notificationPersistence.getAll();\n    setNotifications(loaded);\n    setUnreadCount(notificationPersistence.getUnreadCount());\n  }, []);\n\n  // Close dropdown when clicking outside\n  useEffect(() => {\n    function handleClickOutside(event) {\n      if (dropdownRef.current && !dropdownRef.current.contains(event.target)) {\n        setIsOpen(false);\n      }\n    }\n\n    document.addEventListener(''mousedown'', handleClickOutside);\n    return () => document.removeEventListener(''mousedown'', handleClickOutside);\n  }, []);\n\n  const handleMarkAsRead = (id) => {\n    notificationPersistence.markAsRead(id);\n    setNotifications(notificationPersistence.getAll());\n    setUnreadCount(notificationPersistence.getUnreadCount());\n  };\n\n  const handleMarkAllAsRead = () => {\n    notificationPersistence.markAllAsRead();\n    setNotifications(notificationPersistence.getAll());\n    setUnreadCount(0);\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"notification-system\" ref={dropdownRef}>\n      <NotificationBell\n        unreadCount={unreadCount}\n        onClick={() => setIsOpen(!isOpen)}\n        notifications={notifications}\n      />\n\n      {isOpen && (\n        <div className=\"notification-dropdown\">\n          <div className=\"notification-dropdown-header\">\n            <h3 className=\"notification-dropdown-title\">Notifications</h3>\n            {unreadCount > 0 && (\n              <button className=\"mark-all-read\" onClick={handleMarkAllAsRead}>\n                Mark all as read\n              </button>\n            )}\n          </div>\n\n          {notifications.length === 0 ? (\n            <EmptyState />\n          ) : (\n            <div className=\"notification-list\">\n              {notifications.map(notification => (\n                <NotificationItem\n                  key={notification.id}\n                  notification={notification}\n                  onMarkAsRead={handleMarkAsRead}\n                />\n              ))}\n            </div>\n          )}\n        </div>\n      )}\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## Responsive Behavior\n\n### Mobile Adjustments\n\n```css\n@media (max-width: 640px) {\n  .notification-dropdown {\n    position: fixed;\n    top: 0;\n    left: 0;\n    right: 0;\n    bottom: 0;\n    width: 100%;\n    max-height: 100%;\n    border-radius: 0;\n  }\n\n  .notification-dropdown-header {\n    position: sticky;\n    top: 0;\n    background-color: #FFFFFF;\n    z-index: 1;\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Integration Points\n\nThis skill integrates with:\n- **Notification Persistence Skill**: Reads notification data\n- **Notification Trigger Skill**: Displays triggered notifications\n- **Priority Classification Skill**: Uses purple theme for VERY IMPORTANT\n- **Notification Experience Agent**: Coordinates UI interactions\n\n## Accessibility\n\n- Bell icon button has aria-label with unread count\n- Keyboard navigation supported (Enter/Space to open/close)\n- Focus management in dropdown\n- Screen reader announcements for new notifications\n- Sufficient color contrast ratios (WCAG AA)\n\n## Performance Considerations\n\n- Dropdown renders only when open (conditional rendering)\n- Virtual scrolling for large notification lists (>50)\n- Debounced mark-as-read operations\n- Memoized components to prevent unnecessary re-renders\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:57:10.777Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for User Interface Agents requiring interactive notification systems with animated indicators and customizable notification panels.","zh":"非常适合需要带有动画指示器和可自定义通知面板的交互式通知系统的用户界面代理。","ja":"アニメーションインジケーターとカスタマイズ可能な通知パネルを備えたインタラクティブな通知システムを必要とするユーザーインターフェースエージェントに理想的です。","ko":"애니메이션 표시기와 사용자 정의 가능한 알림 패널이 포함된 대화형 알림 시스템이 필요한 사용자 인터페이스 에이전트에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Interfaz de Usuario que requieren sistemas de notificación interactivos con indicadores animados y paneles de notificación personalizables.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Interface Utilisateur nécessitant des systèmes de notification interactifs avec des indicateurs animés et des panneaux de notification personnalisables.","de":"Ideal für Benutzeroberflächenagenten, die interaktive Benachrichtigungssysteme mit animierten Indikatoren und anpassbaren Benachrichtigungspanels erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Interface do Usuário que exigem sistemas de notificação interativos com indicadores animados e painéis de notificação personalizáveis.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов интерфейса пользователя, требующих интерактивных систем уведомлений с анимированными индикаторами и настраиваемыми панелями уведомлений.","ar":"مثالية للوكلاء واجهة المستخدم التي تتطلب أنظمة الإشعارات التفاعلية مع المؤشرات المتحركة واللوحات الإشعارات القابلة للتعديل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to display unread notification counts, render animated bell icons with badges, and create interactive notification dropdowns using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript, enhancing user engagement with real-time updates and intuitive interfaces.","zh":"使代理能够显示未读通知计数，渲染带有徽章的动画铃铛图标，并使用HTML、CSS和JavaScript创建交互式通知下拉菜单，通过实时更新和直观界面增强用户参与度。","ja":"エージェントが未読通知数を表示し、バッジ付きのアニメーション通知ベルアイコンをレンダリングし、HTML、CSS、JavaScriptを使用してインタラクティブな通知ドロップダウンを作成できるようにし、リアルタイム更新と直感的なインターフェースでユーザーエンゲージメントを高めます。","ko":"에이전트가 읽지 않은 알림 수를 표시하고, 배지가 있는 애니메이션 벨 아이콘을 렌더링하며, HTML, CSS 및 JavaScript를 사용하여 대화형 알림 드롭다운을 생성할 수 있도록 하여 실시간 업데이트와 직관적인 인터페이스로 사용자 참여를 향상시킵니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para mostrar cuentas de notificaciones no leídas, renderizar iconos de campana animados con insignias y crear menús desplegables de notificación interactivos utilizando HTML, CSS y JavaScript, mejorando la participación del usuario con actualizaciones en tiempo real y interfaces intuitivas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''afficher des comptes de notifications non lus, de rendre des icônes de cloche animées avec des badges et de créer des menus déroulants de notification interactifs en utilisant HTML, CSS et JavaScript, améliorant ainsi l''engagement de l''utilisateur avec des mises à jour en temps réel et des interfaces intuitives.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, ungelesene Benachrichtigungsanzahlen anzuzeigen, animierte Glockensymbole mit Abzeichen zu rendern und interaktive Benachrichtigungsmenüs mithilfe von HTML, CSS und JavaScript zu erstellen, wodurch die Benutzerbeteiligung durch Echtzeitupdates und intuitive Oberflächen verbessert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a exibir contagens de notificações não lidas, renderizar ícones de sino animados com distintivos e criar menus suspensos de notificação interativos usando HTML, CSS e JavaScript, melhorando o engajamento do usuário com atualizações em tempo real e interfaces intuitivas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью отображать непрочитанные счетчики уведомлений, отображать анимированные значки колокольчика с значками и создавать интерактивные выпадающие списки уведомлений, используя HTML, CSS и JavaScript, улучшая вовлеченность пользователей с обновлениями в реальном времени и интуитивно понятными интерфейсами.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من عرض عدد الإشعارات غير المقروءة، وتصيير رموز الجرس المتحركة مع الشعارات، وإنشاء قوائم الإشعارات التفاعلية المنسدلة باستخدام HTML و CSS و JavaScript، مما يحسن تفاعل المستخدم مع التحديثات في الوقت الفعلي والواجهات التفاعلية."},"useCases":{"en":["Rendering app headers with dynamic notification badges","Animating new notification arrivals for enhanced user experience","Generating interactive notification panels for user interaction","Displaying unread notification counts for timely updates","Creating customizable notification systems for diverse applications"],"zh":["渲染带有动态通知徽标的应用程序标题","为新通知到达设置动画以增强用户体验","生成用于用户交互的交互式通知面板","显示未读通知计数以便及时更新","为多样化应用程序创建可自定义的通知系统"],"ja":["動的な通知バッジ付きのアプリヘッダーのレンダリング","ユーザーエクスペリエンス向上のための新しい通知到着のアニメーション化","ユーザーインタラクションのためのインタラクティブな通知パネルの生成","タイムリーな更新のための未読通知数の表示","多様なアプリケーション向けのカスタマイズ可能な通知システムの作成"],"ko":["동적 알림 배지가 있는 앱 헤더 렌더링","향상된 사용자 경험을 위한 새 알림 도착 애니메이션","사용자 상호 작용을 위한 대화형 알림 패널 생성","시기적절한 업데이트를 위한 읽지 않은 알림 수 표시","다양한 애플리케이션을 위한 사용자 정의 가능한 알림 시스템 생성"],"es":["Renderizar encabezados de aplicaciones con insignias de notificación dinámicas","Animar las nuevas llegadas de notificaciones para una experiencia de usuario mejorada","Generar paneles de notificación interactivos para la interacción del usuario","Mostrar cuentas de notificaciones no leídas para actualizaciones oportunas","Crear sistemas de notificación personalizables para aplicaciones diversas"],"fr":["Render les en-têtes d''applications avec des badges de notification dynamiques","Animer les nouvelles arrivées de notifications pour une expérience utilisateur améliorée","Générer des panneaux de notification interactifs pour l''interaction utilisateur","Afficher des comptes de notifications non lus pour des mises à jour opportunnes","Créer des systèmes de notification personnalisables pour des applications diverses"],"de":["Rendern von App-Headern mit dynamischen Benachrichtigungsabzeichen","Animieren von neuen Benachrichtigungsankünften für eine verbesserte Benutzererfahrung","Erstellen interaktiver Benachrichtigungspanels für die Benutzerinteraktion","Anzeigen ungelesener Benachrichtigungsanzahlen für rechtzeitige Updates","Erstellen von anpassbaren Benachrichtigungssystemen für diverse Anwendungen"],"pt":["Renderização de cabeçalhos de aplicativos com distintivos de notificação dinâmicos","Animação de novas chegadas de notificação para experiência do usuário aprimorada","Geração de painéis de notificação interativos para interação do usuário","Exibição de contagens de notificações não lidas para atualizações atempadas","Criação de sistemas de notificação personalizáveis para aplicações diversas"],"ru":["Рендеринг заголовков приложений с динамическими значками уведомлений","Анимация новых уведомлений для улучшения пользовательского опыта","Генерация интерактивных панелей уведомлений для взаимодействия с пользователем","Отображение непрочитанных счетчиков уведомлений для своевременных обновлений","Создание настраиваемых систем уведомлений для различных приложений"],"ar":["تصيير رؤوس التطبيقات مع شارات الإشعارات الديناميكية","تحريك وصول الإشعارات الجديدة لتحسين تجربة المستخدم","توليد لوحات الإشعارات التفاعلية للتفاعل مع المستخدم","عرض عدد الإشعارات غير المقروءة للتحديثات في الوقت المناسب","إنشاء أنظمة الإشعارات القابلة للتعديل لتطبيقات متنوعة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires frontend development capabilities","Limited to web-based applications","May require additional libraries for advanced animations or interactions"],"zh":["需要前端开发能力","仅限于基于Web的应用程序","可能需要额外的库来实现高级动画或交互"],"ja":["フロントエンド開発能力が必要","Webベースのアプリケーションに限定","高度なアニメーションやインタラクションには追加ライブラリが必要な場合あり"],"ko":["프론트엔드 개발 능력 필요","웹 기반 애플리케이션으로 제한됨","고급 애니메이션이나 상호 작용을 위해 추가 라이브러리가 필요할 수 있음"],"es":["Requiere capacidades de desarrollo frontend","Limitado a aplicaciones basadas en web","Puede requerir bibliotecas adicionales para animaciones o interacciones avanzadas"],"fr":["Nécessite des capacités de développement frontend","Limité aux applications basées sur le web","Peut nécessiter des bibliothèques supplémentaires pour des animations ou des interactions avancées"],"de":["Erfordert Fähigkeiten zur Entwicklung von Frontend","Begrenzt auf webbasierte Anwendungen","Kann zusätzliche Bibliotheken für erweiterte Animationen oder Interaktionen erfordern"],"pt":["Exige capacidades de desenvolvimento de frontend","Limitado a aplicações baseadas na web","Pode exigir bibliotecas adicionais para animações ou interações avançadas"],"ru":["Требует возможностей по разработке frontend","Ограничен веб-приложениями","Может требовать дополнительных библиотек для продвинутых анимаций или взаимодействий"],"ar":["يتطلب قدرات تطوير واجهة المستخدم","محدود للتطبيقات المستندة إلى الويب","يمكن أن يتطلب مكتبات إضافية لتحريك أو تفاعلات متقدمة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"b1470954596364db57b123d0b13f4d053961314448b77eb12a1c68d7bf378715","qualityScore":31}');
