t mit Technologien wie React, Python und Node.js","Kommandozeileninterface (CLI) für eine größere Flexibilität","Aktive Entwickler-Community für Support und Zusammenarbeit"],"pt":["Plataforma de IA open-source","Desenvolvimento de soluções personalizadas","Integração com React, Python e Node.js","Suporte à linha de comando (CLI)","Comunidade ativa de desenvolvedores"],"ru":["Открытая платформа ИИ Агентов","Разработка индивидуальных решений","Интеграция с React, Python и Node.js","Поддержка командной строки (CLI)","Активное сообщество разработчиков"],"ar":["منصة ذكاء اصطناعي مفتوحة المصدر","تنمية حلول مخصصة","التكامل مع React و Python و Node.js","دعم سطر الأوامر (CLI)","مجتمع نشط من المطورين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用 Issue-Maker","什么是 Gen-AI","Issue-Maker 替代品","Issue-Maker 安装","Issue-Maker 设置指南","Issue-Maker vs 其他工具","Gen-AI 开发","AI 工具","Issue-Maker 文档","Issue-Maker 教程"],"ja":["Issue-Maker の使い方","Gen-AI とは","Issue-Maker の代替","Issue-Maker のインストール","Issue-Maker の設定ガイド","Issue-Maker と他のツールの比較","Gen-AI 開発","AI ツール","Issue-Maker ドキュメント","Issue-Maker チュートリアル"],"ko":["Issue-Maker 사용법","Gen-AI是什么","Issue-Maker 대체","Issue-Maker 설치","Issue-Maker 설정 가이드","Issue-Maker와 다른 도구 비교","Gen-AI 개발","AI 도구","Issue-Maker 문서","Issue-Maker 튜토리얼"],"es":["herramientas de AI","desarrollo de AI","(issue-maker alternative)","issue-maker vs otras herramientas de AI","cómo instalar issue-maker","guía de configuración de issue-maker","qué es issue-maker","cómo usar issue-maker"],"fr":["outils d''IA","développement d''IA","(issue-maker alternative)","issue-maker vs d''autres outils d''IA","comment installer issue-maker","guide de configuration d''issue-maker","qu''est-ce qu''issue-maker","comment utiliser issue-maker"],"de":["KI-Tools","KI-Entwicklung","(issue-maker Alternative)","issue-maker vs andere KI-Tools","wie man issue-maker installiert","Handbuch zur Einrichtung von issue-maker","was ist issue-maker","wie man issue-maker verwendet"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","desenvolvimento de ia","ia open-source","issue-maker alternative","issue-maker vs outros","instalar issue-maker","guia de configuração do issue-maker"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","разработка ИИ","открытый исходный код ИИ","issue-maker альтернатива","issue-maker vs другие","установить issue-maker","руководство по настройке issue-maker"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تنمية الذكاء الاصطناعي","الذكاء الاصطناعي مفتوح المصدر","بديل issue-maker","issue-maker مقابل الآخرين","تثبيت issue-maker","دليل إعداد issue-maker"]}},"owner":"pollinations","repo":"pollinations","repoPath":"pollinations/pollinations","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.727Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"issue-maker","description":"Create GitHub issues following Pollinations team conventions. Use when asked to create issues, track work, or plan features.","bodyPreview":"# Issue-Maker\n\nTurn any user request into GitHub issues following team conventions.\n\n---\n\n## Hard Rules\n\n1. **Repo:** `pollinations/pollinations`\n2. **Assignee:** Assign to appropriate team member based on domain expertise\n3. **No local side-effects** (no file creation/modification)\n\n---\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Research First\n\nBefore creating any issues:\n\n```bash\n# Check @eulervoid''s PRs for style inspiration (concise, bullet-point format)\ngh search prs --repo pollinations/pollinations --author eul","body":"# Issue-Maker\n\nTurn any user request into GitHub issues following team conventions.\n\n---\n\n## Hard Rules\n\n1. **Repo:** `pollinations/pollinations`\n2. **Assignee:** Assign to appropriate team member based on domain expertise\n3. **No local side-effects** (no file creation/modification)\n\n---\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Research First\n\nBefore creating any issues:\n\n```bash\n# Check @eulervoid''s PRs for style inspiration (concise, bullet-point format)\ngh search prs --repo pollinations/pollinations --author eulervoid --limit 5\n\n# Search existing issues for patterns\ngh search issues --repo pollinations/pollinations \"KEYWORD\" --limit 5\n```\n\n### 2. Plan\n\nList all planned issues:\n\n-   One sentence description per issue\n-   Identify assignee and labels\n-   Note related PRs or issues\n\n### 3. Create\n\n```bash\ngh issue create --repo pollinations/pollinations \\\n  --title \"EMOJI Short clear title\" \\\n  --body \"- Bullet point 1\n- Bullet point 2\n- Bullet point 3\" \\\n  --assignee HANDLE \\\n  --label \"LABEL\"\n```\n\n### 4. Output\n\nProvide Discord-compatible summary:\n\n-   Bold titles with issue numbers\n-   Plain URLs on separate lines (Discord auto-embeds)\n-   Group by category\n\n---\n\n## Team Handles\n\n| Name   | GitHub          | Domain                    |\n| ------ | --------------- | ------------------------- |\n| Thomas | **@voodoohop**  | General, Models, Infra    |\n| Joshua | **@eulervoid**  | Pollen, Backend, Auth     |\n| Elliot | **@elliotetag** | Community, Newsletter, UI |\n\n---\n\n## Common Labels\n\n| Label             | Use Case                                           |\n| ----------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `TRACKING`        | Meta/planning issues that track multiple sub-tasks |\n| `NEWS`            | Community announcements and updates                |\n| `ext-issue`       | External user requests (tier upgrades, etc.)       |\n| `app:review`      | New project submission (under review)              |\n| `app:info-needed` | Submission awaiting user response                  |\n| `app:approved`    | Project approved and merged                        |\n| `app:denied`      | Submission rejected                                |\n\n---\n\n## Issue Templates\n\n### Standard Issue (max 3 bullets)\n\n```markdown\n-   Adds X to Y\n-   Fix Z by doing W\n-   Related: #1234\n```\n\n### Tracking Issue (more detailed)\n\n```markdown\n## Overview\n\nBrief description\n\n## Tasks\n\n-   [ ] Task 1\n-   [ ] Task 2\n-   [ ] Task 3\n\n## Related\n\n-   #issue1\n-   #issue2\n```\n\n### Tier Upgrade Request\n\n```markdown\n-   Upgrade @USERNAME to TIER tier\n-   Qualification: [reason]\n-   Related: #original_request_issue\n```\n\n---\n\n## Style Guide\n\n-   **Short, sharp, no fluff**\n-   Smart emojis (not overdone)\n-   Bullet points over paragraphs\n-   Reference @eulervoid''s style: `repo:pollinations/pollinations author:eulervoid`\n\n---\n\n## Example Commands\n\n**Create simple issue:**\n\n```bash\ngh issue create --repo pollinations/pollinations \\\n  --title \"🔧 Fix caching header for image service\" \\\n  --body \"- Update cache-control header\n- Add proper ETag support\n- Related: #4100\" \\\n  --assignee voodoohop\n```\n\n**Create tracking issue:**\n\n```bash\ngh issue create --repo pollinations/pollinations \\\n  --title \"📋 TRACKING: Q4 Model Updates\" \\\n  --body \"## Overview\nTrack all model-related updates for Q4\n\n## Tasks\n- [ ] Add Claude Sonnet 4.5\n- [ ] Update pricing tiers\n- [ ] Deprecate old models\" \\\n  --label \"TRACKING\" \\\n  --assignee voodoohop\n```\n\n**Comment on issue:**\n\n```bash\ngh issue comment 1234 --repo pollinations/pollinations \\\n  --body \"✅ Done! Merged in #5678\"\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T13:57:44.252Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Project Management Agents needing automated GitHub issue creation and team collaboration tools.","zh":"非常适合需要自动创建 GitHub 问题和团队协作工具的项目管理代理。","ja":"プロジェクト管理エージェントが GitHub の課題の自動作成やチームコラボレーションツールを必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"自動으로 GitHub 이슈를 생성하고 팀 협업 툴이 필요한 프로젝트 관리 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de gestión de proyectos que necesitan la creación automática de problemas de GitHub y herramientas de colaboración en equipo.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de gestion de projet ayant besoin de la création automatisée de problèmes GitHub et d''outils de collaboration d''équipe.","de":"Perfekt für Project-Management-Agents, die eine automatisierte Erstellung von GitHub-Problemen und Teamzusammenarbeitswerkzeugen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Gerenciamento de Projetos que precisam de criação automatizada de problemas do GitHub e ferramentas de colaboração em equipe.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов по управлению проектами, которым необходима автоматизированная создание проблем GitHub и инструменты командной работы.","ar":"مثالية لعمليات إدارة المشاريع التي تحتاج إلى إنشاء مشاكل автомاتيكي على GitHub وأدوات تعاون الفريق."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to turn user requests into standardized GitHub issues following team conventions, utilizing gh commands for seamless integration and assigning tasks to team members based on domain expertise.","zh":"赋予代理人将用户请求转化为遵循团队约定的标准化 GitHub 问题的能力，利用 gh 命令实现无缝集成，并根据领域专业知识将任务分配给团队成员。","ja":"エージェントがユーザーのリクエストをチームの規約に従った標準的な GitHub の課題に変換することを可能にし、gh コマンドを使用してシームレスな統合を行い、ドメインの専門知識に基づいてタスクをチームメンバーに割り当てます。","ko":"에이전트가 사용자의 요청을 팀의约定에 따르는 표준적인 GitHub 이슈로 변환할 수 있도록 하며, gh 명령어를 사용하여无缝な 통합을実現하며, 도메인 전문 지식에 따라 팀 구성원에게 작업을 할당합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes convertir solicitudes de usuarios en problemas de GitHub estandarizados siguiendo las convenciones del equipo, utilizando comandos gh para una integración sin problemas y asignando tareas a los miembros del equipo en función de la experiencia en el dominio.","fr":"Permet aux agents de convertir les demandes des utilisateurs en problèmes GitHub standardisés en suivant les conventions d''équipe, en utilisant des commandes gh pour une intégration sans problème et en assignant des tâches aux membres de l''équipe en fonction de l''expertise dans le domaine.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Benutzeranfragen in standardisierte GitHub-Probleme umzuwandeln, die den Teamkonventionen folgen, indem sie gh-Befehle für eine nahtlose Integration verwenden und Aufgaben an Teammitglieder basierend auf der Fachkenntnis im Bereich zuweisen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a transformar solicitações de usuário em problemas padrão do GitHub, seguindo convenções da equipe, utilizando comandos gh para integração perfeita e atribuindo tarefas a membros da equipe com base em especialização de domínio.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать запросы пользователей в стандартизированные проблемы GitHub, следуя командным соглашениям, используя команды gh для бесшовной интеграции и назначая задачи членам команды на основе экспертизы домена.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحويل طلبات المستخدمين إلى مشاكل موحدة على GitHub اتباعًا لاتفاقيات الفريق، مستخدمين أوامر gh من أجل التكامل السلس والتعيين المهام إلى أعضاء الفريق على أساس خبرة المجال."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating issue creation from user feedback","Standardizing issue formatting with concise bullet-point descriptions","Assigning tasks to team members based on domain expertise"],"zh":["从用户反馈中自动创建问题","使用简洁的项目符号描述标准化问题格式","根据领域专业知识将任务分配给团队成员"],"ja":["ユーザーのフィードバックから自動的に課題を作成する","要点の簡潔な説明を使用して課題のフォーマットを標準化する","ドメインの専門知識に基づいてタスクをチームメンバーに割り当てる"],"ko":["사용자 피드백에서 자동으로 이슈 생성하기","간결한 목록으로 된 설명을 사용하여 이슈 형식을 표준화하기","도메인 전문 지식에 따라 팀 구성원에게 작업을 할당하기"],"es":["Automatización de la creación de problemas a partir de comentarios de los usuarios","Estandarización del formato de problemas con descripciones concisas en forma de viñetas","Asignación de tareas a los miembros del equipo en función de la experiencia en el dominio"],"fr":["Automatisation de la création de problèmes à partir des commentaires des utilisateurs","Standardisation du format de problèmes avec des descriptions concises en forme de puces","Assignation de tâches aux membres de l''équipe en fonction de l''expertise dans le domaine"],"de":["Automatisierung der Problemerstellung aus Benutzerfeedback","Standardisierung der Problemmeldungsformate mit knappen Beschreibungen in Form von Aufzählungspunkten","Zuweisung von Aufgaben an Teammitglieder basierend auf der Fachkenntnis im Bereich"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de problemas a partir de feedback do usuário","Padronizar a formatação de problemas com descrições concisas em pontos","Atribuir tarefas a membros da equipe com base em especialização de domínio"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание проблем на основе обратной связи пользователей","Стандартизировать форматирование проблем с краткими описаниями в пунктах","Назначать задачи членам команды на основе экспертизы домена"],"ar":["الاستفادة من تلقين إنشاء مشاكل من تعليقات المستخدمين","توحيد تنسيق المشاكل مع описات موجزة بالنقاط","تعيين المهام إلى أعضاء الفريق على أساس خبرة المجال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub repository access","Limited to pollinations/pollinations repository","No local side-effects allowed"],"zh":["需要 GitHub 存储库访问权限","仅限于 pollinations/pollinations 存储库","不允许本地副作用"],"ja":["GitHub リポジトリへのアクセスが必要","pollinations/pollinations リポジトリのみに限定されている","ローカルな副作用は許可されない"],"ko":["GitHub 리포지토리 액세스 권한이 필요함","pollinations/pollinations 리포지토리에서만 사용 가능함","로컬 부작용을 허용하지 않음"],"es":["Requiere acceso al repositorio de GitHub","Limitado al repositorio pollinations/pollinations","No se permiten efectos secundarios locales"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au référentiel GitHub","Limité au référentiel pollinations/pollinations","Aucun effet secondaire local n''est autorisé"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf das GitHub-Repository","Begrenzt auf das Repository pollinations/pollinations","Lokale Nebenwirkungen sind nicht erlaubt"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao repositório do GitHub","Limitado ao repositório pollinations/pollinations","Não são permitidos efeitos colaterais locais"],"ru":["Требуется доступ к репозиторию GitHub","Ограничен репозиторием pollinations/pollinations","Местные побочные эффекты не допускаются"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودع GitHub","محدود بمستودع pollinations/pollinations","لا يسمح بتأثيرات جانبية محلية"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"4a55aac1c8b2e2c8e61c2dc43e7cc2c5bf0e73059e7c7038cd671a6321317c94","qualityScore":31}');
