sponsive","Facile à installer et à configurer","Compatibilité avec différents frameworks et bibliothèques"],"de":["Persönliches Portfolio-Thema anpassbar","Erweiterte Funktionen für Entwickler","Ansprechendes und responsives Design","Einfach zu installieren und konfigurieren","Kompatibilität mit verschiedenen Frameworks und Bibliotheken"],"pt":["Tema de portfolio personalizado","Recursos estendidos","Baseado no tema Vitesse","Ideal para desenvolvedores","Criação de portfólio profissional"],"ru":["Красивая тема портфолио","Расширенные функции","Основана на теме Vitesse","Идеальна для разработчиков","Создание профессионального портфолио"],"ar":["موضوع محفظة شخصي جميل","ميزات محسّنة","مبني على موضوع Vitesse","مثالي للمطورين","إنشاء محفظة احترافية"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Vitest","Vitest教程","Vitest替代品","Vitest vs Vitesse","Vitest安装","Vitest设置指南","AI工具开发","个人作品集主题"],"ja":["Vitestの使い方","Vitestチュートリアル","Vitestの代替","Vitest vs Vitesse","Vitestのインストール","Vitestの設定ガイド","AIエージェント開発","パーソナルポートフォリオテーマ"],"ko":["Vitest 사용법","Vitest 튜토리얼","Vitest 대체","Vitest vs Vitesse","Vitest 설치","Vitest 설정 가이드","AI 에이전트 개발","개인 포트폴리오 테마"],"es":["herramientas AI para desarrolladores","tema de portfolio personal","vitest alternativa","cómo usar vitest","instalación de vitest","guía de configuración de vitest","desarrollo web con vitest"],"fr":["outils IA pour les développeurs","thème de portfolio personnel","vitest alternative","comment utiliser vitest","installation de vitest","guide de configuration de vitest","développement web avec vitest"],"de":["KI-Tools für Entwickler","persönliches Portfolio-Thema","vitest Alternative","wie man vitest verwendet","Installation von vitest","Konfigurationsanleitung für vitest","Webentwicklung mit vitest"],"pt":["como usar Vitest","o que é Vitest","Vitest alternativa","Vitest vs Vitesse","instalar Vitest","guia de configuração do Vitest"],"ru":["как использовать Vitest","что такое Vitest","Vitest альтернатива","Vitest vs Vitesse","установить Vitest","руководство по настройке Vitest"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Vitest","ما هو Vitest","بديل Vitest","Vitest مقابل Vitesse","تثبيت Vitest","دليل إعداد Vitest"]}},"owner":"UmmItKin","repo":"ummit.dev","repoPath":"UmmItKin/ummit.dev","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.734Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"vitest","description":"Vitest fast unit testing framework powered by Vite with Jest-compatible API. Use when writing tests, mocking, configuring coverage, or working with test filtering and fixtures.","version":"2026.1.28","bodyPreview":"Vitest is a next-generation testing framework powered by Vite. It provides a Jest-compatible API with native ESM, TypeScript, and JSX support out of the box. Vitest shares the same config, transformers, resolvers, and plugins with your Vite app.\n\n**Key Features:**\n- Vite-native: Uses Vite''s transformation pipeline for fast HMR-like test updates\n- Jest-compatible: Drop-in replacement for most Jest test suites\n- Smart watch mode: Only reruns affected tests based on module graph\n- Native ESM, TypeS","body":"Vitest is a next-generation testing framework powered by Vite. It provides a Jest-compatible API with native ESM, TypeScript, and JSX support out of the box. Vitest shares the same config, transformers, resolvers, and plugins with your Vite app.\n\n**Key Features:**\n- Vite-native: Uses Vite''s transformation pipeline for fast HMR-like test updates\n- Jest-compatible: Drop-in replacement for most Jest test suites\n- Smart watch mode: Only reruns affected tests based on module graph\n- Native ESM, TypeScript, JSX support without configuration\n- Multi-threaded workers for parallel test execution\n- Built-in coverage via V8 or Istanbul\n- Snapshot testing, mocking, and spy utilities\n\n> The skill is based on Vitest 3.x, generated at 2026-01-28.\n\n## Core\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| Configuration | Vitest and Vite config integration, defineConfig usage | [core-config](references/core-config.md) |\n| CLI | Command line interface, commands and options | [core-cli](references/core-cli.md) |\n| Test API | test/it function, modifiers like skip, only, concurrent | [core-test-api](references/core-test-api.md) |\n| Describe API | describe/suite for grouping tests and nested suites | [core-describe](references/core-describe.md) |\n| Expect API | Assertions with toBe, toEqual, matchers and asymmetric matchers | [core-expect](references/core-expect.md) |\n| Hooks | beforeEach, afterEach, beforeAll, afterAll, aroundEach | [core-hooks](references/core-hooks.md) |\n\n## Features\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| Mocking | Mock functions, modules, timers, dates with vi utilities | [features-mocking](references/features-mocking.md) |\n| Snapshots | Snapshot testing with toMatchSnapshot and inline snapshots | [features-snapshots](references/features-snapshots.md) |\n| Coverage | Code coverage with V8 or Istanbul providers | [features-coverage](references/features-coverage.md) |\n| Test Context | Test fixtures, context.expect, test.extend for custom fixtures | [features-context](references/features-context.md) |\n| Concurrency | Concurrent tests, parallel execution, sharding | [features-concurrency](references/features-concurrency.md) |\n| Filtering | Filter tests by name, file patterns, tags | [features-filtering](references/features-filtering.md) |\n\n## Advanced\n\n| Topic | Description | Reference |\n|-------|-------------|-----------|\n| Vi Utilities | vi helper: mock, spyOn, fake timers, hoisted, waitFor | [advanced-vi](references/advanced-vi.md) |\n| Environments | Test environments: node, jsdom, happy-dom, custom | [advanced-environments](references/advanced-environments.md) |\n| Type Testing | Type-level testing with expectTypeOf and assertType | [advanced-type-testing](references/advanced-type-testing.md) |\n| Projects | Multi-project workspaces, different configs per project | [advanced-projects](references/advanced-projects.md) |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:03:00.619Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for JavaScript Agents needing fast and efficient testing frameworks with native ESM and TypeScript support.","zh":"非常适合需要快速高效测试框架的JavaScript Agents，具有原生ESM和TypeScript支持。","ja":"JavaScriptエージェントが高速で効率的なテストフレームワークを必要とする場合に最適で、ネイティブのESMとTypeScriptをサポートしています。","ko":"빠르고 효율적인 테스트 프레임워크가 필요한 JavaScript 에이전트에게 적합하며, 네이티브 ESM 및 TypeScript를 지원합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de JavaScript que necesitan frameworks de pruebas rápidos y eficientes con soporte nativo para ESM y TypeScript.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents JavaScript nécessitant des frameworks de test rapides et efficaces avec un support natif pour ESM et TypeScript.","de":"Perfekt für JavaScript-Agents, die schnelle und effiziente Testframeworks mit nativem ESM- und TypeScript-Unterstützung benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de JavaScript que precisam de frameworks de teste rápidos e eficientes com suporte nativo ESM e TypeScript.","ru":"Идеально для Agentов JavaScript, которым необходимы быстрые и эффективные фреймворки тестирования с родным поддержкой ESM и TypeScript.","ar":"Perfect for JavaScript Agents that need fast and efficient testing frameworks with native ESM and TypeScript support."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to leverage Vite-native testing with Jest-compatible APIs, enabling smart watch modes and fast HMR-like test updates using Vitest''s transformation pipeline and native support for JSX.","zh":"赋予代理使用Vite原生测试的能力，具有与Jest兼容的API，实现智能监视模式和使用Vitest的转换管道和对JSX的原生支持的快速HMR样测试更新。","ja":"エージェントがViteネイティブのテストを使用できるようにし、Jestと互換性のあるAPIを提供して、スマートなウォッチモードとVitestの変換パイプラインとJSXのネイティブサポートを使用した高速なHMRのようなテスト更新を可能にします。","ko":"에이전트가 Vite 네이티브 테스트를 사용할 수 있도록 하며, Jest와 호환되는 API를 제공하여智能 감시 모드 및 Vitest의 변환 파이프라인과 JSX의 네이티브 지원을 사용한 빠른 HMR와 같은 테스트 업데이트를 가능하게 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aprovechar las pruebas nativas de Vite con APIs compatibles con Jest, lo que permite modos de vigilancia inteligentes y actualizaciones de pruebas rápidas similares a HMR utilizando la canalización de transformación de Vitest y el soporte nativo para JSX.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''exploiter les tests natifs de Vite avec des API compatibles Jest, ce qui permet des modes de surveillance intelligents et des mises à jour de tests rapides similaires à HMR en utilisant le pipeline de transformation de Vitest et le support natif pour JSX.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Vite-native Tests mit Jest-kompatiblen APIs zu nutzen, wodurch intelligente Überwachungsmodi und schnelle, HMR-ähnliche Test-Updates mithilfe von Vitests Transformationspipeline und nativer Unterstützung für JSX ermöglicht werden.","pt":"Empodera os agentes a utilizar testes nativos Vite com APIs compatíveis Jest, permitindo modos de relógio inteligente e atualizações de teste rápidas HMR-like usando o pipeline de transformação Vitest e suporte nativo para JSX.","ru":"Эмподерает агентов использовать тесты Vite с API, совместимыми с Jest, позволяя использовать умные часы и быстрые обновления тестов HMR-like с помощью Vitest и родного поддержки для JSX.","ar":"Empowers agents to leverage Vite-native testing with Jest-compatible APIs, enabling smart watch modes and fast HMR-like test updates using Vitest''s transformation pipeline and native support for JSX."},"useCases":{"en":["Rerunning affected tests based on module graph","Implementing drop-in replacements for Jest test suites","Utilizing Vite''s config, transformers, resolvers, and plugins for seamless integration"],"zh":["基于模块图重新运行受影响的测试","实现Jest测试套件的替换","利用Vite的配置、转换器、解析器和插件实现无缝集成"],"ja":["モジュールグラフに基づいて影響を受けるテストを再実行する","Jestテストスイートのドロップインの代替を実装する","Viteの設定、トランスフォーマー、リゾルバ、およびプラグインを使用してシームレスな統合を実現する"],"ko":["모듈 그래프를 기반으로 영향을 받는 테스트를 다시 실행하는 것","Jest 테스트 스위트의 드롭인 대체를 구현하는 것","Vite의 구성, 변환기, 해결사 및 플러그인을 사용하여 무결점 통합을 구현하는 것"],"es":["Volver a ejecutar pruebas afectadas en función del grafo de módulos","Implementar reemplazos directos para suites de pruebas de Jest","Utilizar la configuración de Vite, los transformadores, los resolutores y los plugins para una integración perfecta"],"fr":["Réexécuter les tests affectés en fonction du graphique de module","Mettre en œuvre des remplacements directs pour les suites de tests Jest","Utiliser la configuration de Vite, les transformateurs, les résolveurs et les plugins pour une intégration parfait"],"de":["Erneutes Ausführen betroffener Tests basierend auf dem Modulgraphen","Implementierung von Drop-in-Ersatz für Jest-Test-Suiten","Nutzen von Vite-Konfiguration, Transformern, Auflösung und Plugins für eine nahtlose Integration"],"pt":["Rerunning affected tests based on module graph","Implementing drop-in replacements for Jest test suites","Utilizing Vite''s config, transformers, resolvers, and plugins for seamless integration"],"ru":["Rerunning affected tests based on module graph","Implementing drop-in replacements for Jest test suites","Utilizing Vite''s config, transformers, resolvers, and plugins for seamless integration"],"ar":["Rerunning affected tests based on module graph","Implementing drop-in replacements for Jest test suites","Utilizing Vite''s config, transformers, resolvers, and plugins for seamless integration"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Vite app configuration","Native ESM and TypeScript support may require specific setup"],"zh":["需要Vite应用配置","原生ESM和TypeScript支持可能需要特定的设置"],"ja":["Viteアプリの設定が必要","ネイティブのESMとTypeScriptのサポートには特定の設定が必要である"],"ko":["Vite 애플리케이션 구성이 필요합니다.","네이티브 ESM 및 TypeScript 지원은 특정 설정이 필요할 수 있습니다."],"es":["Requiere configuración de aplicación Vite","El soporte nativo para ESM y TypeScript puede requerir una configuración específica"],"fr":["Nécessite une configuration d''application Vite","Le support natif pour ESM et TypeScript peut nécessiter une configuration spécifique"],"de":["Benötigt Vite-App-Konfiguration","Der native Support für ESM und TypeScript kann eine spezifische Konfiguration erfordern"],"pt":["Requires Vite app configuration","Native ESM and TypeScript support may require specific setup"],"ru":["Requires Vite app configuration","Native ESM and TypeScript support may require specific setup"],"ar":["Requires Vite app configuration","Native ESM and TypeScript support may require specific setup"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"87c8cf025987d1f1a0e9c0fd0b8605946a0ebd5478676471ce296d8f0adc0f07","qualityScore":31}');
