lationsanleitung für create-sysy-testcase"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia para desenvolvedores","como criar testes de sysy","o que é sysy","compilador sysy para mips","alternativas para compiladores sysy","guia de instalação do compilador sysy","configuração do compilador sysy","desenvolvimento de compiladores"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты для разработчиков","как создать тесты sysy","что такое sysy","компилятор sysy для mips","альтернативы компиляторам sysy","руководство по установке компилятора sysy","настройка компилятора sysy","разработка компиляторов"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","كيفية إنشاء اختبارات sysy","ما هو sysy","مترجم sysy لمترجم mips","بديلات لمترجمات sysy","دليل تثبيت مترجم sysy","إعداد مترجم sysy","تطوير المترجمات"]}},"owner":"oNya685","repo":"SysYTest","repoPath":"oNya685/SysYTest","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.793Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"create-sysy-testcase","description":"Convert C/C++ code into Strict SysY testcases using Python automation scripts.","bodyPreview":"# SysY Testcase Conversion Workflow\n\nYou are an expert compiler engineer. Your goal is to convert standard C/C++ competitive programming code into **Strict SysY** (a simplified C subset) and generate valid test data.\n\n## Non-Negotiable Grammar Rules\n**Adhere to these rules strictly.** Read `references/sysy_lang_grammar.md` **only** if you encounter an obscure syntax edge case not covered here.\n\n| Feature | Constraint | Fix / Refactor |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Prototypes** | **Implicit** | **D","body":"# SysY Testcase Conversion Workflow\n\nYou are an expert compiler engineer. Your goal is to convert standard C/C++ competitive programming code into **Strict SysY** (a simplified C subset) and generate valid test data.\n\n## Non-Negotiable Grammar Rules\n**Adhere to these rules strictly.** Read `references/sysy_lang_grammar.md` **only** if you encounter an obscure syntax edge case not covered here.\n\n| Feature | Constraint | Fix / Refactor |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Prototypes** | **Implicit** | **Do NOT** write `int getint();` or `int printf(...);`. |\n| **Memory / Size** | **Max 4MB Total** (MARS Limit) | **Scale Down Constants**. `1e6` $\\to$ `1e4`. Total `int` elements < 500,000. |\n| **Preprocessor** | **BANNED** (`#include`, `#define`, `#ifdef`) | Use `const int` for constants. Delete imports. |\n| **Types** | `int`, `void` **ONLY** | No `long long`, `float`, `double`, `char`, `bool`. |\n| **Pointers** | **BANNED** (`int *p`, `&x`, `*ptr`) | Pass arrays as `int a[]`. Use **return values** for scalar outputs (no `void f(int *res)`). |\n| **Arrays** | **1D Arrays ONLY** | Flatten `int a[N][M]` $\\to$ `int a[N*M]`. **No VLAs**. |\n| **Loops** | **`for` loops ONLY**. **No declarations inside `()`** | Move vars out: `int i; for(i=0;...)`. No `do-while`. No `while`. turn `while(1)` into `for(;;)`. |\n| **Returns** | **Non-void funcs MUST return** | Add dummy `return 0;` at end of function, **even after infinite loops**. |\n| **Conditions As Values** | `Exp → AddExp` (arithmetic only) | Do **NOT** use relational / logical expressions as values, e.g. `return a < b;` or `x = (a < b);`. Rewrite: `if (a < b) return 1; return 0;` or `x = 0; if (a < b) x = 1;`. |\n| **Input** | `int getint()` **ONLY** | No `scanf`, `cin`, `getchar`. |\n| **Output** | `printf` **ONLY** | Format string is a **SysY `StringConst`**: **only** `%d` is allowed as a format placeholder, and the **only** escape sequence is `\\n` (backslash may appear **only** in `\\n`). **No** other format specifiers/modifiers (e.g. `%c`, `%s`, `%%`, `%05d`) and **no** other escapes (e.g. `\\\\`, `\\\"`, `\\t`, `\\r`, `\\0`). Ensure the number of `, Exp` arguments equals the number of `%d`. |\n| **Parentheses** | `PrimaryExp → ''('' Exp '')''` and `Exp → AddExp` | `(...)` as an expression can wrap **arithmetic only**. Besides mandatory syntax like `if (Cond)` / `for (...; Cond; ...)`, do **NOT** add extra parentheses around conditions (any `== != < > <= >= && || !`). Rewrite via precedence/distribution, e.g. `if (t2 > 0 && (a == 42 || a == 47))` $\\to$ `if (t2 > 0 && a == 42 || t2 > 0 && a == 47)`. |\n| **Operators** | No Bitwise (`<<`, `>>`, `&`, `|`, `^`) | Use arithmetic: `*2`, `/2`, `%2`. Use lookup tables. |\n| **Structs** | **BANNED** | Split into parallel arrays (e.g., `x[N]`, `y[N]`). |\n| **Globals** | Encouraged for large arrays | Prevent stack overflow in SysY runtime, keep totol size < 4MB. |\n| **Input Data** | **Strictly 1 Integer Per Line** (`in.txt`) | No spaces (`1 2`). Must be `1\\n2`. Matches MIPS syscall. If `testfile.txt` uses a **sentinel** to stop reading (e.g., `if (ch == 0) break;`, `while (x != 0)`, `while (1) { x=getint(); if (x==0) break; }`), then `in.txt` must **explicitly include that sentinel value as the last integer**. **Do not rely on EOF behaving like `0`**: SysY MIPS `getint()` is implemented via `syscall 5` and does not implement “EOF → 0”. |\n\n## Execution Protocol\n\nFollow these steps sequentially.\n\n### Step 1: Initialize\n\nUse the helper script to create the directory and placeholder files.\n\n```bash\npython3 .codex/skills/create-sysy-testcase/scripts/init_case.py <TARGET_DIR>\n```\n\n### Step 2: Write Logic (The Intelligence Part)\n\nTranslate the source logic into Strict SysY. Focus your \"thinking\" here.\n\n- **Scale Down**: If original code has `MAXN = 100000`, change it smaller to fix up to MARS''s address space limit(about 4MB). Ensure logic consistency.\n- **Refactor** logic to fit the constraints above (e.g., flatten 2D arrays).\n- **Write** the code to `testfile.txt`.\n- **Write** input data to `in.txt` (newline-separated integers only) matching your scaled-down size. If the program reads until a sentinel (e.g., `0`) rather than a known count, put that sentinel **explicitly** as the last integer; do **not** rely on EOF.\n\n```bash\ncat <<''EOF'' > <TARGET_DIR>/testfile.txt\n// ... your converted SysY code ...\nEOF\n\ncat <<''EOF'' > <TARGET_DIR>/in.txt\n// ... your input numbers ...\nEOF\n```\n\n### Step 3: Compile, Run & Verify\n\nUse the runner script. It automatically wraps your code with C headers, compiles it (gcc/clang), runs it against `in.txt`, and generates `ans.txt`.\n\n```bash\npython3 .codex/skills/create-sysy-testcase/scripts/run_case.py <TARGET_DIR>\n```\n\n### Step 4: Fix & Retry\n\nIf Step 3 reports a **COMPILE ERROR** or **RUNTIME ERROR**:\n\n1. Read the error output.\n2. Fix the logic in `testfile.txt`.\n3. Rerun Step 3.\n\n## Translation Strategy Tips\n- SysY input (`in.txt`) must be **newline-separated integers**.\n- If the original problem uses strings (e.g., \"PUSH\", \"POP\"), map them to integers (e.g., 1, 2) in your translation logic.\n- **MIPS Compatibility Check**: `in.txt` **must not** contain spaces between numbers.\n- **Never use EOF as a terminator**: if the program’s input loop expects a terminator value (commonly `0`, sometimes `-1`/`-999`), put that value **explicitly** at the end of `in.txt` (and keep it on its own line).\n- **Strengthen `in.txt` slightly**: prefer including a mix of small/edge values (e.g., `0/1/-1`, min/max for scaled constraints) and a few typical values, while still matching the program’s expected format and counts; always end the file with a trailing newline.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:27:40.018Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Compiler Agents requiring expertise in converting C/C++ code to Strict SysY and generating valid test data","zh":"适合需要将 C/C++ 代码转换为严格 SysY 并生成有效测试数据的编译器代理","ja":"C/C++ コードを Strict SysY に変換し、有効なテストデータを生成するコンパイラ エージェントに適しています","ko":"C/C++ 코드를 Strict SysY로 변환하고 유효한 테스트 데이터를 생성하는 컴파일러 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para Agentes Compiladores que requieren experiencia en la conversión de código C/C++ a Strict SysY y la generación de datos de prueba válidos","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents Compilateurs nécessitant une expertise dans la conversion de code C/C++ en Strict SysY et la génération de données de test valides","de":"Ideal für Compiler-Agents, die Erfahrung in der Umwandlung von C/C++-Code in Strict SysY und der Generierung von gültigen Testdaten benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Compilador que exigem conhecimento especializado em converter código C/C++ para Strict SysY e gerar dados de teste válidos","ru":"Идеально для агентов-компиляторов, требующих опыта в преобразовании кода C/C++ в Strict SysY и генерации действительных тестовых данных","ar":"مثالي لعميل مترجم يتطلب خبرة في تحويل كود C/C++ إلى Strict SysY وتوليد بيانات اختبار صالحة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to convert standard C/C++ competitive programming code into Strict SysY, a simplified C subset, and generate valid test data using the SysY to MIPS Compiler, adhering to non-negotiable grammar rules and following the SysY Testcase Conversion Workflow","zh":"赋予代理将标准 C/C++ 竞赛编程代码转换为 Strict SysY，一个简化的 C 子集，并使用 SysY 到 MIPS 编译器生成有效的测试数据，遵循不可商量的语法规则，并遵循 SysY 测试用例转换工作流","ja":"エージェントに、標準的な C/C++ コンピュータプログラミング コードを Strict SysY、C の簡略化されたサブセットに変換し、SysY to MIPS コンパイラを使用して有効なテストデータを生成する力を与え、交渉不可能な文法規則に従い、SysY テストケース変換ワークフローに従う","ko":"에이전트에게 표준 C/C++ 프로그래밍 코드를 Strict SysY, C의 단순화된 하위 집합으로 변환하고 SysY to MIPS 컴파일러를 사용하여 유효한 테스트 데이터를 생성할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 교섭 불가능한 문법 규칙을 준수하고 SysY 테스트 케이스 변환 워크플로우를 따름","es":"Habilita a los agentes a convertir código de programación competitiva estándar C/C++ en Strict SysY, un subconjunto de C simplificado, y generar datos de prueba válidos utilizando el Compilador SysY a MIPS, siguiendo reglas gramaticales no negociables y el flujo de trabajo de conversión de casos de prueba de SysY","fr":"Permet aux agents de convertir du code de programmation compétitive standard C/C++ en Strict SysY, un sous-ensemble de C simplifié, et de générer des données de test valides en utilisant le Compilateur SysY à MIPS, en respectant des règles grammaticales non négociables et le flux de travail de conversion de cas de test de SysY","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, standardmäßigen C/C++-Code für Wettbewerbsprogrammierung in Strict SysY, einem vereinfachten C-Untermenge, umzuwandeln und gültige Testdaten unter Verwendung des SysY-zu-MIPS-Compilers zu generieren, indem es nicht verhandelbare Grammatikregeln einhält und dem SysY-Testfall-Konvertierungs-Workflow folgt","pt":"Habilita os agentes a converter código de programação competitiva C/C++ padrão para Strict SysY, um subconjunto simplificado de C, e gerar dados de teste válidos usando o Compilador SysY para MIPS, seguindo regras gramaticais inegociáveis e o Fluxo de Trabalho de Conversão de Casos de Teste do SysY","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью преобразовывать стандартный код конкурентного программирования C/C++ в Strict SysY, упрощенный подмножество C, и генерировать действительные тестовые данные с помощью компилятора SysY в MIPS, соблюдая неготивные грамматические правила и следуя рабочему процессу преобразования тестовых случаев SysY","ar":"يمنح الوكيل khảية تحويل كود البرمجة التنافسية القياسي C/C++ إلى Strict SysY، وهو子 مجموعة مبسطة من C، وتوليد بيانات اختبار صالحة باستخدام مترجم SysY إلى MIPS، متبعة القواعد النحوية غير القابلة للتفاوض ومتبعة تدفق عمل تحويل حالة اختبار SysY"},"useCases":{"en":["Converting C/C++ code to Strict SysY for compiler testing","Generating valid test data for SysY to MIPS Compiler validation","Debugging SysY code using the testcase conversion workflow","Creating testcases for competitive programming challenges in Strict SysY"],"zh":["将 C/C++ 代码转换为 Strict SysY 以进行编译器测试","为 SysY 到 MIPS 编译器验证生成有效的测试数据","使用测试用例转换工作流调试 SysY 代码","为严格 SysY 创建竞赛编程挑战的测试用例"],"ja":["コンパイラ テストのために C/C++ コードを Strict SysY に変換する","SysY to MIPS コンパイラの検証のために有効なテストデータを生成する","テストケース変換ワークフローを使用して SysY コードをデバッグする","Strict SysY 用の競技プログラミング チャレンジのテストケースを作成する"],"ko":["컴파일러 테스트를 위해 C/C++ 코드를 Strict SysY로 변환하는 것","SysY to MIPS 컴파일러의 유효성 검사를 위해 유효한 테스트 데이터를 생성하는 것","테스트 케이스 변환 워크플로를 사용하여 SysY 코드를 디버깅하는 것","Strict SysY용 경쟁 프로그래밍 챌린지의 테스트 케이스를 생성하는 것"],"es":["Conversión de código C/C++ a Strict SysY para pruebas de compilador","Generación de datos de prueba válidos para la validación del Compilador SysY a MIPS","Depuración de código SysY utilizando el flujo de trabajo de conversión de casos de prueba","Creación de casos de prueba para desafíos de programación competitiva en Strict SysY"],"fr":["Conversion de code C/C++ en Strict SysY pour des tests de compilateur","Génération de données de test valides pour la validation du Compilateur SysY à MIPS","Débogage de code SysY en utilisant le flux de travail de conversion de cas de test","Création de cas de test pour les défis de programmation compétitive en Strict SysY"],"de":["Umwandlung von C/C++-Code in Strict SysY für Compilertests","Generierung von gültigen Testdaten für die Validierung des SysY-zu-MIPS-Compilers","Fehlerbehebung von SysY-Code unter Verwendung des Testfall-Konvertierungs-Workflows","Erstellung von Testfällen für Wettbewerbsprogrammierherausforderungen in Strict SysY"],"pt":["Conversão de código C/C++ para Strict SysY para teste de compilador","Geração de dados de teste válidos para validação do Compilador SysY para MIPS","Depuração de código SysY usando o fluxo de trabalho de conversão de casos de teste","Criação de casos de teste para desafios de programação competitiva em Strict SysY"],"ru":["Преобразование кода C/C++ в Strict SysY для тестирования компилятора","Генерация действительных тестовых данных для проверки компилятора SysY в MIPS","Отладка кода SysY с помощью рабочего процесса преобразования тестовых случаев","Создание тестовых случаев для задач конкурентного программирования в Strict SysY"],"ar":["تحويل كود C/C++ إلى Strict SysY لاختبار المترجم","توليد بيانات اختبار صالحة لتحقق مترجم SysY إلى MIPS","تصحيح أخطاء كود SysY باستخدام تدفق عمل تحويل حالة اختبار","إنشاء حالات اختبار لتحديات البرمجة التنافسية في Strict SysY"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of SysY language grammar","Adherence to non-negotiable grammar rules","Strict SysY subset limitations apply"],"zh":["需要了解 SysY 语言语法","需要遵守不可商量的语法规则","Strict SysY 子集限制适用"],"ja":["SysY 言語の文法を理解する必要がある","交渉不可能な文法規則に従う必要がある","Strict SysY サブセットの制限が適用される"],"ko":["SysY 언어 문법을 이해해야 함","교섭 불가능한 문법 규칙을 준수해야 함","Strict SysY 하위 집합의 제한이 적용됨"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento de la gramática del lenguaje SysY","Cumplimiento de reglas gramaticales no negociables","Se aplican limitaciones del subconjunto Strict SysY"],"fr":["Nécessite une connaissance de la grammaire du langage SysY","Respect de règles grammaticales non négociables","Des limitations du sous-ensemble Strict SysY s''appliquent"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse der Grammatik der SysY-Sprache","Einhalten nicht verhandelbarer Grammatikregeln","Einschränkungen des Strict-SysY-Subsets gelten"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento da gramática da linguagem SysY","Adesão a regras gramaticais inegociáveis","Limitações do subconjunto Strict SysY se aplicam"],"ru":["Требует знания грамматики языка SysY","Соблюдение неготивных грамматических правил","Применяются ограничения подмножества Strict SysY"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة قواعد لغة SysY","الامتثال للقواعد النحوية غير القابلة للتفاوض","تطبيق قيود 子 مجموعة Strict SysY"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"772a728653f78b74c2da2c8a22d336d5b1a5d835df43feb79592897432a565da","qualityScore":31}');
