s","Full-stack-Entwicklung","Integration mit modernen Technologien","Einfache Bedienung für Entwickler"],"pt":["Ferramenta de inteligência artificial para projetos web3","Criação de projetos web3 mais eficientes e escaláveis","Suporte a linguagens de programação como React e Python","Integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento como Node.js e CLI"],"ru":["ИИ Агент для проектов web3","Создание проектов web3 более эффективных и масштабных","Поддержка языков программирования как React и Python","Интеграция с инструментами разработки как Node.js и CLI"],"ar":["أداة إنجليزية للاستقاءة للاجứng web3","سоздать проекты web3 أكثر كفاءة وscalability","دعم لغات برمجة مثل React و Python","إنتеграция مع أدوات تطوير مثل Node.js و CLI"]},"keywords":{"zh":["ahooks教程","FullStack Web3开发","AI工具","ahooks alternative","ahooks vs other tools","how to use ahooks","ahooks安装","ahooks设置指南"],"ja":["ahooksチュートリアル","FullStack Web3開発","AIエージェント","ahooksの代替","ahooksと他のツールの比較","ahooksの使い方","ahooksのインストール","ahooksの設定ガイド"],"ko":["ahooks 튜토리얼","FullStack Web3 개발","AI 에이전트","ahooks 대안","ahooks와 다른 도구의 비교","ahooks 사용법","ahooks 설치","ahooks 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo usar ahooks","qué es Web3","alternativas a ahooks","ahooks vs otros iniciadores de proyectos","instalación de ahooks","guía de configuración de ahooks","desarrollo de aplicaciones full-stack","herramientas de inteligencia artificial para desarrolladores"],"fr":["comment utiliser ahooks","qu''est-ce que Web3","alternatives à ahooks","ahooks vs autres initiateurs de projets","installation d''ahooks","guide de configuration d''ahooks","développement d''applications full-stack","outils d''intelligence artificielle pour les développeurs"],"de":["wie man ahooks verwendet","was ist Web3","alternativen zu ahooks","ahooks vs andere Projektstarter","installation von ahooks","konfigurationsanleitung für ahooks","entwicklung von full-stack-anwendungen","KI-Tools für Entwickler"],"pt":["ahooks","ferramenta de inteligência artificial","projetos web3","criação de projetos web3","suporte a linguagens de programação","integração com ferramentas de desenvolvimento"],"ru":["ahooks","ИИ Агент","проекты web3","создание проектов web3","поддержка языков программирования","интеграция с инструментами разработки"],"ar":["ahooks","أداة إنجليزية للاستقاءة","مشرح web3","سоздать проекты web3","دعم لغات برمجة","إنتеграция مع أدوات تطوير"]}},"owner":"blockmatic","repo":"basilic","repoPath":"blockmatic/basilic","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-04T13:07:01.795Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"ahooks","description":"|","bodyPreview":"# Skill: ahooks\n\n## Scope\n\n- Applies to: ahooks v3+ utility hooks for React state management, grouped state updates, localStorage persistence\n- Does NOT cover: Data fetching (use TanStack Query), URL state management (use nuqs), complex state machines, async operations\n\n## Assumptions\n\n- ahooks v3+\n- React 18+ with hooks support\n- TypeScript v5+ (for type inference)\n- Client-side only (hooks require browser APIs for localStorage)\n\n## Principles\n\n- Use `useSetState` for grouped state that changes","body":"# Skill: ahooks\n\n## Scope\n\n- Applies to: ahooks v3+ utility hooks for React state management, grouped state updates, localStorage persistence\n- Does NOT cover: Data fetching (use TanStack Query), URL state management (use nuqs), complex state machines, async operations\n\n## Assumptions\n\n- ahooks v3+\n- React 18+ with hooks support\n- TypeScript v5+ (for type inference)\n- Client-side only (hooks require browser APIs for localStorage)\n\n## Principles\n\n- Use `useSetState` for grouped state that changes together (not URL-shareable)\n- Use `useLocalStorageState` for persistent state across browser sessions\n- Prefer nuqs for URL-shareable state over localStorage\n- Prefer TanStack Query for async operations and loading states\n- Use `useState` only for simple independent state (rare)\n\n## Constraints\n\n### MUST\n\n- Use `useSetState` for grouped state not in URL (form state, game engine state, ephemeral UI state)\n- Use `useLocalStorageState` for localStorage persistence\n\n### SHOULD\n\n- Prefer nuqs for URL-shareable state over localStorage\n- Prefer TanStack Query for async operations and loading states\n- Use TypeScript generics for type-safe state: `useLocalStorageState<boolean>(''key'', { defaultValue: false })`\n\n### AVOID\n\n- Using for URL state (use nuqs instead)\n- Using for loading/error states (use TanStack Query instead)\n- Using for complex async operations (use TanStack Query instead)\n- Mixing URL state with localStorage without explicit sync logic\n\n## Interactions\n\n- Complements nuqs for URL state management (can sync bidirectionally)\n- Complements TanStack Query for async operations (use TanStack Query for data fetching)\n- Part of state management decision tree (see React rules)\n- Works with React 18+ hooks architecture\n\n## Patterns\n\n### useSetState Pattern\n\nUse for grouped state that updates together:\n\n```typescript\nimport { useSetState } from ''ahooks''\n\nconst [state, setState] = useSetState({\n  name: '''',\n  email: '''',\n  age: 0,\n})\n\n// Partial updates (shallow merge)\nsetState({ name: ''John'' })\nsetState(prev => ({ ...prev, email: ''john@example.com'' }))\n```\n\n**When to use**: Form state, game engine state, UI state that changes together (if not URL-shareable)\n\n**When NOT to use**: URL-shareable state (use nuqs), loading states (use TanStack Query)\n\n### useLocalStorageState Pattern\n\nUse for state that persists across browser sessions:\n\n```typescript\nimport { useLocalStorageState } from ''ahooks''\n\nconst [value, setValue] = useLocalStorageState<boolean>(''key'', {\n  defaultValue: false,\n})\n\n// Type-safe with generics\nconst [settings, setSettings] = useLocalStorageState<Settings>(''settings'', {\n  defaultValue: { theme: ''light'', fontSize: 14 },\n})\n```\n\n**When to use**: User preferences, debug flags, settings that should persist across sessions\n\n**When NOT to use**: URL-shareable state (use nuqs), sensitive data (use secure storage)\n\n### Integration with nuqs\n\nBidirectional sync between URL and localStorage:\n\n```typescript\nimport { useLocalStorageState } from ''ahooks''\nimport { useQueryState } from ''nuqs''\nimport { useEffect, useRef } from ''react''\n\nconst [queryState, setQueryState] = useQueryState(''debug'')\nconst [storageState, setStorageState] = useLocalStorageState<boolean>(''debug'', {\n  defaultValue: false,\n})\nconst isFirstMount = useRef(true)\n\n// Sync on mount: localStorage → URL\nuseEffect(() => {\n  if (isFirstMount.current) {\n    isFirstMount.current = false\n    if (storageState && queryState !== ''true'') {\n      setQueryState(''true'')\n      return\n    }\n  }\n  // Sync changes: URL → localStorage\n  if (queryState === ''true'' && !storageState) {\n    setStorageState(true)\n  } else if (queryState === ''false'' && storageState) {\n    setStorageState(false)\n  }\n}, [queryState, storageState, setQueryState, setStorageState])\n```\n\n**Use case**: Debug flags, feature toggles that should be both URL-shareable and persistent\n\n### State Management Decision Tree\n\n1. **URL-shareable state** → Use `nuqs` (filters, search, tabs, pagination)\n2. **Grouped state not in URL** → Use `useSetState` (form state, game engine, ephemeral UI)\n3. **Async operations** → Use TanStack Query (data fetching, mutations, caching)\n4. **localStorage persistence** → Use `useLocalStorageState` (preferences, settings)\n5. **Simple independent state** → Use `useState` (rare, prefer other options)\n\n## References\n\n- [ahooks documentation](https://ahooks.js.org/) - Official documentation\n- React rules - State management decision tree and patterns\n- TanStack Query - Async operations and data fetching patterns\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-04T14:27:55.191Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Frontend Agents utilizing React state management with ahooks v3+ for efficient and grouped state updates","zh":"适用于使用 React 状态管理的前端代理，利用 ahooks v3+ 实现高效和分组的状态更新","ja":"React の状態管理を使用する Frontend エージェントに適しています。ahooks v3+ を使用して効率的でグループ化された状態の更新を実現します","ko":"React 상태 관리를 사용하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다. ahooks v3+를 사용하여 효율적이고 그룹화된 상태 업데이트를 구현합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes Frontend que utilizan la gestión de estado de React con ahooks v3+ para actualizaciones de estado eficientes y agrupadas","fr":"Idéal pour les agents Frontend utilisant la gestion d''état React avec ahooks v3+ pour des mises à jour d''état efficaces et regroupées","de":"Ideal für Frontend-Agents, die die Zustandsverwaltung von React mit ahooks v3+ für effiziente und gruppierte Zustandsaktualisierungen verwenden","pt":"Ideal para Agentes Frontend que utilizam gerenciamento de estado do React com ahooks v3+ para atualizações de estado eficientes e agrupadas","ru":"Идеально для Фронтенд-агентов, использующих управление состоянием React с ahooks v3+ для эффективных и групповых обновлений состояния","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يستخدمون إدارة حالة React مع ahooks v3+ للحصول على تحديثات الحالة الفعالة والمجمعة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage React state with utilities like useSetState for grouped state changes, leveraging localStorage persistence and TypeScript v5+ for type inference, all within a React 18+ environment","zh":"赋予代理管理 React 状态的能力，使用诸如 useSetState 之类的实用程序进行分组状态更改，利用 localStorage 持久性和 TypeScript v5+ 进行类型推断，所有这些都在 React 18+ 环境中","ja":"エージェントが React 状態を管理する能力を付与します。useSetState などのユーティリティを使用してグループ化された状態の変更を実現し、localStorage の永続性と TypeScript v5+ の型推論を利用し、すべてが React 18+ 環境で実行されます","ko":"에이전트가 React 상태를 관리할 수 있는 능력을 부여합니다. useSetState와 같은 유틸리티를 사용하여 그룹화된 상태 변경을 구현하며, localStorage 지속성과 TypeScript v5+의 타입 추론을 활용하여 모든 것을 React 18+ 환경에서 실행합니다","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar el estado de React con utilidades como useSetState para cambios de estado agrupados, aprovechando la persistencia de localStorage y TypeScript v5+ para inferencia de tipos, todo dentro de un entorno React 18+","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer l''état React avec des utilitaires comme useSetState pour des changements d''état regroupés, en exploitant la persistance de localStorage et TypeScript v5+ pour l''inférence de types, le tout dans un environnement React 18+","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, den Zustand von React mit Hilfsmitteln wie useSetState für gruppierte Zustandsänderungen zu verwalten, die Persistenz von localStorage und TypeScript v5+ für Typinferenz auszunutzen, all dies innerhalb einer React 18+-Umgebung","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciar o estado do React com utilitários como useSetState para alterações de estado agrupadas, aproveitando a persistência do localStorage e o TypeScript v5+ para inferência de tipo, tudo dentro de um ambiente React 18+","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью управлять состоянием React с помощью утилит, таких как useSetState для групповых изменений состояния, используя сохранение данных в localStorage и TypeScript v5+ для вывода типов, все в среде React 18+","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إدارة حالة React باستخدام أدوات مثل useSetState لتغييرات الحالة المجمعة، واستخدام استمرار localStorage وTypeScript v5+ للاستدلال النوعي، كل ذلك في بيئة React 18+"},"useCases":{"en":["Simplifying state management in React applications","Implementing localStorage persistence for user preferences","Optimizing grouped state updates with useSetState"],"zh":["简化 React 应用程序中的状态管理","实现 localStorage 持久性以存储用户首选项","使用 useSetState 优化分组状态更新"],"ja":["React アプリケーションの状態管理を簡素化する","ユーザー設定の保存に localStorage の永続性を実現する","useSetState を使用してグループ化された状態の更新を最適化する"],"ko":["React 애플리케이션의 상태 관리를 단순화한다","사용자 설정을 저장하기 위해 localStorage의 지속성을 구현한다","useSetState를 사용하여 그룹화된 상태 업데이트를 최적화한다"],"es":["Simplificar la gestión de estado en aplicaciones React","Implementar la persistencia de localStorage para preferencias de usuario","Optimizar las actualizaciones de estado agrupadas con useSetState"],"fr":["Simplifier la gestion d''état dans les applications React","Mettre en œuvre la persistance de localStorage pour les préférences utilisateur","Optimiser les mises à jour d''état regroupées avec useSetState"],"de":["Die Zustandsverwaltung in React-Anwendungen zu vereinfachen","Die Persistenz von localStorage für Benutzervorlieben zu implementieren","Die gruppierten Zustandsaktualisierungen mit useSetState zu optimieren"],"pt":["Simplificar a gestão de estado em aplicações React","Implementar a persistência do localStorage para preferências do usuário","Otimizar as atualizações de estado agrupadas com useSetState"],"ru":["Упрощение управления состоянием в приложениях React","Реализация сохранения данных в localStorage для предпочтений пользователя","Оптимизация групповых обновлений состояния с помощью useSetState"],"ar":["تبسيط إدارة الحالة في تطبيقات React","تنفيذ استمرار البيانات في localStorage للتفضيلات المستخدم","تحسين تحديثات الحالة المجمعة باستخدام useSetState"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires ahooks v3+","Limited to client-side applications","Does not support data fetching or complex state machines"],"zh":["需要 ahooks v3+","仅限客户端应用程序","不支持数据获取或复杂状态机"],"ja":["ahooks v3+ が必要","クライアント側アプリケーションに限定される","データの取得や複雑な状態マシンのサポートは行わない"],"ko":["ahooks v3+가 필요합니다","클라이언트 측 애플리케이션으로 제한됩니다","데이터 가져오기 또는 복잡한 상태 머신을 지원하지 않습니다"],"es":["Requiere ahooks v3+","Limitado a aplicaciones de lado del cliente","No admite la recuperación de datos o máquinas de estado complejas"],"fr":["Nécessite ahooks v3+","Limité aux applications côté client","Ne prend pas en charge la récupération de données ou les machines d''état complexes"],"de":["Erfordert ahooks v3+","Begrenzt auf Client-Anwendungen","Unterstützt keine Datenabruf oder komplexe Zustandsmaschinen"],"pt":["Exige ahooks v3+","Limitado a aplicações de lado do cliente","Não suporta busca de dados ou máquinas de estado complexas"],"ru":["Требует ahooks v3+","Ограничен клиентскими приложениями","Не поддерживает получение данных или сложные машины состояния"],"ar":["يتطلب ahooks v3+","محدود لتطبيقات الجانب العميل","لا يدعم استرجاع البيانات أو آلات الحالة المعقدة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"3619a1d5c301136fecc3ca74d2cee8141e56e9ddf581957df92667bd894b257b","qualityScore":31}');
